window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4601,"title":"Chapter 4601: The Terrifying Female Instructor","paragraphs":["\"Tao Yi!\"","\"Here!\"","\"He Wenquan!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Meng Meng!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Jiang Yuyan!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Zhao Dai!\"","\"Here!\"","...","Every time someone was called, Ye Jian would raise her head and look at the student whose name was called. After the 43 new students were called, she had memorized everyone’s names.","Ye Jian, who remembered all their names, folded the list back into her pocket. She stood at the spot where the sun was setting through the gaps in the leaves and bathed in the bright and white sunlight. Her cold voice smashed into everyone’s ears.","\"There are four groups now. Tao Yi is the squad leader of Group One. Students one to ten will form Group One.\"","\"He Wenquan is the squad leader of Group Two. Students 11 to 21 will form Group Two.","\"Meng Meng is the squad leader of Group Three. Students 22 to 32 will form Group Three.","\"Jiang Yuyan is the squad leader of Group Four. Students 33 to 43 will form Group Four.\"","After the roll call, Ye Jian used the simplest method to split the students into four groups. The squad leaders were selected by her after ten minutes of observation.","After the groups were divided, they officially entered the military training. The new students, who thought that being assigned a female instructor was something that other classes envied, regretted it.","In regards to learning to stand at attention and at ease, if they don’t succeed the first time, they could just do it a second time. If they didn’t succeed the second time, they would do it for the third time. Instructor Ye said calmly, \"It’s alright. We can just move our lunch time. The same goes for when we disperse and when we gather.\"","She said the most terrifying words in a calm voice. Who would dare to be lazy?","No one!","They were afraid that their lunch time would be pulled back.","Huang Yawen studied hard. When \"attention\" was called, she stood at attention and didn’t move!","When \"at ease\" was shouted, her right leg swooshed out. Her movements were very fast. She didn’t dare to be lazy at all.","As for her plan to pretend to be uncomfortable and ask for leave, Huang Yawen had completely forgotten about it.","She didn’t dare to do it.","She was afraid that a knife would be put up against her neck.","\"Turn right... Turn right! Turn right! Turn left... Turn left... Turn left... Make neater moves. You can’t differentiate between left and right? I don’t want the tan on your faces to be uneven. I need to split the right and left turns evenly.","\"Liu Qi, you look like you really want to stay and spend more time with the sun later. Turn right. Are you not going to move? Do you really want to stay back?","\"Nie Chenlin, please distinguish between right and left! I don’t want one-half of your face to be another color.","\"Duan Bin, at ease! Move your legs half a beat faster. Your shoelaces are loose. Adjust them. Don’t fall and hurt others.\"","The sentences uttered were funny, but the new students couldn’t laugh.","Why couldn’t they laugh?","That was because they were so shocked that Instructor Ye was able to call out everyone’s names in just less than an hour of getting to know them! How did she know everyone?!","They had met such a beautiful and harmless instructor, but she was so strict that everyone was afraid of her!","\"Move in unison! One, two, one, two, one, two!","\"One, two, three, four!\"","The commands were shouted. Their footsteps slowly became slightly more orderly from the initial mess. From time to time, one could hear the chaotic sounds of slow and fast beats.","It was easy to slack off during the march. The new students, who had been undergoing military training for an hour and a half, couldn’t hold on anymore. The sun was too hot, and their faces were burning with pain. It was so hot that their entire bodies were wet, and their sleeves were drenched.","They really wanted to rest, but their instructor didn’t seem to have that intention at all!"]},{"number":4602,"title":"Chapter 4602: Big Mistake","paragraphs":["The instructor didn’t seem to have the intention of letting them stop. As for them... they didn’t dare to mention it. The instructor, who looked easy to bully, glanced at them coldly every time...","F*ck! They felt as if their heads were about to be cut off!","They were trembling all over!","Were they too afraid to look into her eyes?","Yes, all of them were!","They really wanted to rest, but they were afraid and didn’t dare to raise their voices.","This was a miscalculation on their part!","They thought that the instructor was easy to talk to, but reality was so cruel. They couldn’t even cry right now.","It wasn’t that they hadn’t thought of resisting, but every time they made eye contact with Ye Jian, the calmness in her eyes made them cower. The courage they had painstakingly accumulated was gone like a deflating balloon!","The training started at 10:00 am. They started with standing at attention and at ease. When they finished marching, they stretched their legs. All the students’ faces were red, and they were sweating profusely. They didn’t even have the time to catch their breath and continued training until 11:30 am.","Just as they thought that the training would end at noon, the instructor with a cold facial expression called out the names of several classmates.","\"Wang Haibo, step out! Peng Ye, step out! Xie Han, step out! Huang Pengyu, step out! Ouyang Xiaoya, step out! Su Yi, step out... The rest of you rest for ten minutes.\"","A string of names came out of Ye Jian’s mouth. A total of eight new students came out obediently. The eight people who had been undergoing military training for an hour became Ye Jian’s first targets.","It wasn’t easy for the new students to be able to rest for ten minutes. It was as if they had walked through the execution ground. The students sat under the tree and didn’t want to get up.","Who said that the female instructor wasn’t strict? Who said that the female instructor was easy to talk to?","Wrong, wrong, wrong! This was a huge mistake!","These eight people were always half a beat slower than the others when turning. Ye Jian called them out and got them to march by themselves. After two rounds, Ye Jian said to a boy, \"Wang Haibo, left foot out, right hand out, right leg out, left hand out...\"","That was right, she encountered a boy who walked while stretching out the same hand and leg.","His limbs would move side by side. Ever since he started practicing the march, Ye Jian had discovered a problem. This issue remained even after half an hour,and he didn’t seem to realize it either... Ye Jian had no choice but to pull him out alone.","The main reason why this happened was that his body was not in harmony. Training would straighten things out.","The people in the class didn’t notice that Wang Haibo was moving his arms and legs on the same side simultaneously. Ye Jian didn’t train Wang Haibo in front of the students either. She brought him a little farther away and said, \"I’ll call one, two, one. Refer to my actions and pay attention to your steps and arms. Do you understand?\"","Wang Haibo, who was drenched in sweat, was very nervous when he was pulled out by Ye Jian. Hearing that, he nodded with a tense body. \"Understood!\"","\"Listen to the command! One, two, one! One, two, one! One, two, stop! Have you discovered your problem?\" Ye Jian, who was a few steps ahead, stopped and turned to look at the boy who hadn’t completed his actions. \"Look down at your actions and then look at mine...\"","The boy lowered his head and looked at Ye Jian’s actions. He finally realized his problem. His face turned red, but he quickly adjusted his expression.","\"Keep your right leg still. Retract your right hand and use your left hand.\" Ye Jian was very patient. The boy was anxious and embarrassed. Hence, he still couldn’t get it right.","\"Don’t panic. Think about releasing your right leg, then your left hand, then your left leg, then your right hand. You can slow down the rhythm.\"","Every time there was a mistake, he had to redo it. There were only ten minutes of rest. Ye Jian didn’t expect the boy to fix his problem immediately, but he started to pay attention to whether his actions were coordinated.","Ye Jian taught the boy how to coordinate his movements. The students resting on the other side started to become restless. It had only been one and a half hours of training, but they felt that they were already half crippled. There were still nine days of training. If they didn’t think of a way, how could they endure it?"]},{"number":4603,"title":"Chapter 4603: Bad Idea","paragraphs":["If the boys couldn’t stand it, there was no need to mention the girls. As for thinking of a way... What way could they think of? All the new students were the same. No one was special. What way could they think of?","\"I thought that military training would be fun. It’s only been one and a half hours. I don’t want to play anymore. I don’t want to play at all. I want to dry myself under the fan, eat popsicles, play games, and lie on the bed...\"","\"I want to do that too. I’m so damn tired! My calves are trembling from the marches. We kept turning left and right... I’m dizzy.\"","\"Everything else is fine. It’s just that it’s too hot. I can’t take it. I feel like I’m going to have a heatstroke.\"","\"There are still nine and a half days left. Friends, the long march has just begun!\"","Ye Jian pointed at the uncoordinated movements of the boy, Wang Haibo, in front. The new students who were resting split into a few batches and sat under the shade of a tree. They were already exclaiming about their lives.","The boys who said that they were tired were just saying it. They didn’t have any other thoughts.","There were also a few boys who tried to come up with ideas together. They muttered something in low voices and were so excited that they rubbed their fists.","\"It’s meaningless to write it alone. A few people have to write it together and hand it to the instructor. At that time... Hehe, it might work. Friends, our request isn’t too much. As long as one of us succeeds, everyone will rise to the top!\"","\"We need to find the most handsome person in the class. Girls like good-looking people the most.\"","\"Good idea. We need to find someone good-looking. We can’t win with numbers. It’s just the few of us. Friends, I’m not trying to hit on you. Come, let’s admire each other for three minutes and see if we can appreciate each other’s ’good looks’.\"","...","There was no need for three minutes. 30 seconds was a long enough time.","The boys who came up with the idea to coax the instructor and seek benefits for themselves silently retracted their gazes. Actually... they couldn’t bear to look at each other.","\"It looks like we still have to enlist the help of someone handsome. I think our instructor will definitely like someone who’s handsome. Even if the instructor doesn’t accept the guy, she’ll probably let us off on account of his handsomeness.\"","\"After thinking about it, I don’t think it’s feasible to write a love letter to the instructor. Speaking of handsome, look at the other instructors—especially that instructor who left the girls shocked. He’s handsome enough, right? The military school is full of males, and our instructor is the school belle. There are many handsome boys in the military school. I’m afraid we won’t be able to achieve the effect we want.\"","\"Then what should we do? We can’t do this or that. Are we going to be as tired as cows every day?\"","\"There’s one more way...\"","Before the boy who came up with the idea could say it, a girl beside them heard their conversation and couldn’t help but turn around. \"You can’t bully Instructor Ye just because she’s a female instructor!\"","The boys felt a little awkward when they were caught red-handed by the girl. They silently turned their heads and didn’t continue.","\"We never thought of bullying the instructor. Don’t think too much.\"","\"Ha, I’m thinking too much? What did you say just now? Isn’t that considered bullying?\" The girl was the local girl who fought with Huang Yawen yesterday. Ye Jian was in the same dormitory as her. When she heard the boys’ conversation getting worse and worse, she couldn’t take it anymore and turned around.","The boy who was defending himself didn’t expect the girl to hear everything they said. For a moment, his expression was resentful. He couldn’t say anything else."]},{"number":4604,"title":"Chapter 4604: Challenge","paragraphs":["\"Zeng Can, forget it. Let’s not talk about it anymore.\" Another girl from the same dormitory was afraid that they would quarrel, so she persuaded her softly, \"They’re just talking. They haven’t done anything. Just a reminder will do.\"","\"You’d better not mess around. It’s not good to tease the instructor. Don’t let us be punished with you in the end.\" Zeng Can glared at the boys who wanted to play cheap tricks before turning around.","The boys who were caught weren’t in the mood to say anything else for a moment. They were embarrassed to be taught a lesson by a girl, but they couldn’t argue with her. If they argued with her, they would be the unreasonable ones.","\"Forget it. The method just now didn’t work. Let’s not do that. It’ll be embarrassing if word gets out.\"","\"That’s right. Forget it, forget it. Let’s just go through military training obediently. Since the female instructor is good-looking, we should bear with it. Everyone is the same. We’ll go through hardships together.\"","The boys, who were still excited just now, became dispirited once more. Thinking about it again, they felt that writing a love letter to win over their beautiful instructor... was an extremely bad idea.","\"No, Yu Ji, what else can we do? Voice your ideas.\"","The boy who was called out turned his head instinctively and looked at the girl. Seeing that the girl wasn’t paying attention, he exhaled softly and said with lingering fear, \"Lower your voices. Don’t let them hear you. Zeng Can is in the same dormitory as the instructor.\"","\"Ah, she won’t complain, right?\" A boy immediately jumped up in shock. He couldn’t get into trouble!","The skinny Yu Ji pushed his glasses up his nose bridge. He was still sweating. He whispered, \"There’s someone in our dorm who’s a Taekwondo national runner-up. Let’s make him compete with our instructor. In the afternoon, we’ll go back to the dormitory and ask the instructor to make a bet with Tao Yi. If he wins, the instructor will go easy on us. What do you think?\"","The boys’ eyes lit up when they heard this. No one objected. They all nodded.","This method could work!","Tao Yi, who was being targeted by other people, was surrounded by his classmates. They were also discussing how to make the military training less tiring. In the end, the heavy responsibility would gloriously fall on Tao Yi.","A girl said worriedly, \"I’m confident Tao Yi will win.. I’m just afraid that he can’t control his strength and end up hurting the instructor. What will happen then?\"","\"The instructor is a military school student. She won’t get hurt so easily.\"","\"The squad leader will only be sparring with the instructor. They won’t really fight. Nothing will happen. Don’t you often see soldiers in the military unit sparring on television? Nothing happens then either.\"","Tao Yi had the same thought too. He smiled and said, \"I’ll control my strength so that I won’t hurt the instructor. Now, we have to see if the instructor will accept the challenge. If the instructor accepts it, we can spar.\"","As an instructor, Ye Jian naturally accepted it with a smile. \"The national runner-up of Taekwondo? Not bad. Let’s have a match during the afternoon break.\"","Ye Jian accepted the challenge readily. Hence, the entire class erupted in cheers. The students from her class, who had been standing in military posture for 20 minutes, wanted to know what had happened.","The one who shouted the loudest was a boy. The boy immediately made a request. \"Instructor, if we win, shouldn’t you give us some perks?\"","Just you wait!","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and asked, \"How do you want me to do that?\"","\"We hope that we can have more rest so that our military training won’t be so tiring! The weather is too hot! We can’t take it anymore!\"","\"Yes, Instructor. If we win, you can’t train us so strictly.\""]},{"number":4605,"title":"Chapter 4605: Hero, I’m Relying On You","paragraphs":["His voice was so loud that the instructors nearby heard it. Hearing that, the instructors’ lips twitched. Indeed, the youths knew no fear.","They challenged Ye Jian, someone that even they couldn’t compete with. Tsk, tsk, tsk. The ignorant were truly fearless.","The instructors prayed silently in their hearts for the boy who challenged Ye Jian.","As for Ye Jian, of course, she was happy to play along with them. Smiling, she said, \"What if I win? Wouldn’t you need to do something too?\"","\"The terms need to be fair in a bet. How about this? You ask me to be more relaxed with you. Sure, as long as you win, I’ll be more relaxed with you. Similarly, if I win, you have to follow my rules for military training. How about that?","\"Wait, that’s not right. I have to ask if all of you agree.\"","\"Hahaha, we agree! We agree!\"","\"Instructor, we agree!\"","Ye Jian smiled. These children were still too young. They were so young that she felt a little guilty for bullying them. However, since they were so enthusiastic about challenging her, she would oblige.","\"Okay, it’s settled, then.\" Ye Jian smiled and blinked. A sly look flashed past her eyes.","\"Okay! Okay! It’s settled, then! Do you want to make a pinky promise, Instructor?\"","\"Do it, do it. Instructor, you can’t go back on your word.\"","The ’children’ who dug a hole for themselves were overjoyed. They were so happy that they couldn’t stop laughing. They were so happy that they managed to quickly settle the matter.","There were also people who didn’t agree. For instance... Huang Yawen. She didn’t agree.","Moreover, she had said ’no’ loudly. In the end, she was drowned in the mighty voices that shouted ’yes’. No one heard her objection.","Even if someone heard it, they would ignore it.","The other three girls from Room 405 threw their arms and shouted in agreement. Zeng Can, who had previously warned the boys not to bully the instructor, also shouted in agreement.","There were many students in the class who didn’t dare to speak at first. In the end, they were affected by the atmosphere. Seeing that Ye Jian wasn’t angry, they smiled and shouted, \"Agree!\"","They were so happy... Just like that, the matter was decided!","\"Sure! Tao Yi, come on over!\" Ye Jian smiled and gestured for the boy to come up. \"Being the national runner-up of Taekwondo is indeed an achievement. It’s good to spar. Just treat it as leisure entertainment.\"","Tao Yi walked up and saluted Ye Jian. Then, he smiled and said, \"Instructor, when are we going to start sparring? It’s better to do it earlier than later. Why not now?\"","The boy in front of her was full of confidence. He had thick eyebrows, big eyes, and good facial features. One look and you could tell that he was a righteous boy. Similarly, he had the arrogance of a boy.","He was at that age. He should be full of vigor, confidence, and hope for the future.","\"There’s no hurry. Let’s do it at night. It’s cooler at night.\" Ye Jian looked at the confident boy in front of her and reached out her hand. \"Pinky promise.\"","\"啪!\"","A clear round of applause was heard. The agreement between the instructor and the students was reached.","Tao Yi, who came back after the pinky promise, was welcomed like a hero. \"Tao Yi, we’re counting on you! Let’s have an easy time with the military training. All the best!\"","\"Hero, I’m counting on you!\"","\"We must take down the instructor tonight. Whether we can be happy or not depends on you! I have high hopes for you, friend.\"","The excited boys welcomed the ’hero’ they placed their hopes on happily. They believed that the ’hero’ they chose would definitely lead them to a good life."]},{"number":4606,"title":"Chapter 4606: Stimulated","paragraphs":["Tao Yi, who had a heavy responsibility on his shoulders, was a little proud. He waved his hand in embarrassment and said, \"Don’t be so polite. I’ll try my best. But if I lose, you can’t blame me.\"","\"Hahaha, you won’t lose! you won’t lose! You’re the national runner-up for Taekwondo!\"","\"For the sake of the entire class, I’ll definitely do my best.\" Tao Yi, who was welcomed by the entire class as soon as school started, restrained himself and replied humbly. However, he was still a little proud.","The 18-year-old boy was eager to get attention. He had just entered a new environment, so he more or less wanted to show off and let his classmates see his strengths.","This was how Tao Yi was now. How could he not be happy when he received the attention and recognition of his classmates?","The laughter of the students made the students from the other classes envious. Their bet with the instructor also attracted the attention of the students from the other classes.","They didn’t expect the students to dare to make a bet with their instructor. They didn’t expect the instructor to agree too. She agreed to the students’ request!","Why were other instructors so good?","\"Sigh, should we try...\"","\"Sixth in the fourth row, don’t move!\"","Before the boy from another class could finish speaking, he was discovered by the instructor and given a stern reminder.","\"Don’t move and don’t speak. If I see someone moving and talking nonsense again, the entire class will stand for another ten minutes.\"","The instructors, who were secretly sized up by the girls before the military training, had turned into steel-faced soldiers. All of them had stern expressions on their faces. Whether it was boys or girls, as long as they were discovered by the instructors, they would be directly pointed out without any special treatment.","\"Look in front and clamp your legs together! Relax your shoulders and slowly adjust your breathing. Don’t move! Do you hear me?","\"It’s just the start, but everyone is already going limp. If you’re a man, stand up straight! Don’t let the girls look down on you! Even the girls stand straighter than you!\"","In the depths of the boys’ hearts... they were already cursing in their native language. They had been standing in the military stance for 20 minutes. Why was it so hard to endure?!","What was the class beside doing? They had been standing there for five to six minutes, laughing!","\"Report...\"","A boy from a certain class suddenly shouted. He was agitated. He wanted to make a bet too!","\"Speak!\"","Song Zhiqiu’s voice was cold and ruthless.","The boy straightened his neck and shouted, \"Instructor, we want to make a bet too!\"","The air was a little quiet. There was an undercurrent. The students who were standing until their backs hurt pricked up their ears and cheered for the boy who spoke bravely. Yes, yes, they wanted to make a bet too!","The requirements were the same. As long as they won, the instructor would be more lenient with the military training.","Song Zhiqiu wanted to laugh, but as an instructor, he had to maintain a serious expression. \"Bet? Do you think you can win?\"","\"They’re sparring at night, right? Why don’t you see the results at night before making a bet with me?\" Hearing that, the boy who had the courage to make a request was instantly afraid.","The national runner-up for Taekwondo... had some skills. However, that wasn’t enough in front of Ye Jian.","Tao Yi returned to the team. Ye Jian whistled and started one of the training sessions—military stance.","The military stance looked simple. They just needed to stand still. However, it was hard to stand still.","It wasn’t for long, only 20 minutes. However, because they were delayed for five to six minutes just now, the students from the other classes completed their military stance exercise at 12 o’clock sharp. Meanwhile, Ye Jian’s class continued."]},{"number":4607,"title":"Chapter 4607: So Strong","paragraphs":["At noon, the sun was shining brightly. Even the camphor trees on both sides couldn’t block the power of the sun. The students, who had been standing for 15 minutes, started to feel a little dizzy, especially when they saw the rows of students passing by them. It was an unprecedented challenge to their perseverance and endurance.","Ye Jian went from the front row to the back. From time to time, she would call out the students’ names and remind them to pay attention to their posture. Every time she called out their names, the students’ hearts would jump.","They really couldn’t understand why their instructors knew all their names when they didn’t even recognize each other yet.","There was a fear in the hearts of all the students. They didn’t dare to move or be too presumptuous.","\"Straighten your back, raise your head, and engage your lower abdomen.\"","Ye Jian, who was walking in the middle, reminded a hunchbacked boy. She grabbed the boy’s shoulders and exerted force. The boy felt a dull pain on both sides of his shoulders. It was so painful that his expression was distorted.","\"Widen your shoulders. Don’t tighten them. Firstly, you don’t look manly. Secondly, it’ll damage your image.\"","Ye Jian knew that she exerted a little strength, but she didn’t expect that such a little strength would make the boy’s face twist in pain. She wondered why it hurt when she didn’t use much strength. After thinking for a while, she quickly reacted.","She had forgotten that they were all students and not real soldiers. Their endurance was limited.","She hurriedly apologized, \"I’m sorry, I used too much strength. Are you alright?\"","\"I’m... I’m fine...\"","What else could the boy say? He felt a little embarrassed. It was just a nudge to his shoulders. How much could it hurt?","But he was really in pain just now!","Huang Yawen, who was standing in front of the boy, started chanting in her heart, ’You can’t see me, you can’t see me, you can’t see me.’ Now, she just wanted to turn into an invisible person. She didn’t want to be targeted by the instructor at all.","Murphy’s law—the more you feared something, the more it would happen.","\"Your standing posture is not bad. Your lower body is stable too. Straighten your back more.\"","The voice that she was most afraid of came from behind. Then, a hand patted her back lightly. She panicked, and her body tensed up. Ye Jian ’smacked’ Huang Yawen, causing her to fall forward.","Huang Yawen, who was 1.72 meters tall, was tall and strong. There was a girl standing in front of her. She fell forward and landed on the girl’s back. The girl screamed and was sent flying by Huang Yawen.","\"Ah...\"","Like a domino effect, another girl in front staggered and fell.","Ye Jian was speechless.","She swore to God!","She didn’t use much strength just now. She just patted the student’s back lightly to remind her to straighten her back. How did she send the student flying? She even caused a chain reaction and instantly caused the two girls to fall.","\"I’m sorry, I’m sorry. Instructor, I didn’t do it on purpose. I really didn’t do it on purpose!\" Huang Yawen was about to cry. \"I was shocked just now. I didn’t expect you to pat my back. I’m sorry, Instructor. I didn’t do it on purpose.\"","Huang Yawen was so frightened that she didn’t dare to help the girls who were sent flying. The students around her, who didn’t know what was happening, hurriedly helped the two girls up and asked if they were okay.","Ye Jian felt a little awkward when she saw Huang Yawen’s pale face.","Last night... she seemed to have frightened this tyrant too much. Now, with just a slight move from her, Huang Yawen would be frightened.","\"I know. Return to the formation and stand properly!\" Ye Jian had a serious expression on her face as she comforted the frightened Huang Yawen. She felt guilty and quickly left to check in with the other two girls who fell.","There was nothing wrong with them. It was just that they couldn’t take it after standing in the military stance for too long."]},{"number":4608,"title":"Chapter 4608: Suspense","paragraphs":["The girl knew that there was nothing wrong with her. She was just tired from standing and was caught off guard. Suddenly, someone pushed her from behind and she fell.","But some people didn’t know.","Yu Ji’s face contorted again. His shoulders were still hurting because of Ye Jian. He panicked for no reason.","What great strength!","What great strength!","She was even sent flying by the instructor!","Why did he feel that Tao Yi’s win against the instructor was a little uncertain?","He was the first to panic. He didn’t know what to do, and he didn’t dare to say it out loud. He was afraid that it would affect the people’s morale. Hence, he could only hold it in until the 20 minutes of military stance ended.","After the military training ended in the morning, the entire team left. The instructors no longer led them to the cafeteria. They didn’t have strict rules like the military unit.","The cafeteria was extremely lively today. Even the girls with small appetites increased from one bowl of rice to two. It couldn’t be helped. They were hungry! Too hungry! They had never been so hungry before.","And they were very, very tired!","They thought that it was tiring to stand at attention and at ease, but that wasn’t the case. The most tiring thing was the military stance. This was the most tiring and difficult hurdle.","\"We couldn’t move for 20 minutes. This is the first time I know that as it turns out, standing still is torture! It’s tiring, too tiring!\"","\"I thought that I wouldn’t be able to endure it and would faint. Who knew that I could endure it for 20 minutes? F*ck! This is the first time I hate myself for not being weaker!\"","\"I saw two girls in the class fainting just like that. The instructor hurriedly asked someone to help the girls out to lie down. At that moment, I envied their gender! I’m as strong as an ox. Even if I fainted, I’d be kicked by the instructor!\"","\"F*ck! I thought that the instructors from the military school would be more refined, but in the end, they’re all the same! When they’re ruthless, they’re all ruthless. They’re really training us as soldiers.\"","\"Military training. Brother, do you think it was a joke? We’re soldiers now... It looks like being a soldier is tough.\"","\"I think it’s quite interesting. Don’t you think it’s fun? Unfortunately, I got into a university. If I couldn’t get into a university, I’d definitely become a soldier.\"","People who said that the military training was enjoyable and interesting would usually be looked at as if they were crazy. However, there were many students like this. There were even girls like this.","Zeng Can belonged to this category, and so did Huang Yawen.","After Huang Yawen’s apology last night, the other girls, including Zeng Can, didn’t completely ostracize Huang Yawen. They just didn’t talk to her much.","Zeng Can’s eyes lit up as she ate. She said directly, \"I want to be a soldier. I want to be as cool as our instructor! She’s so cool! When she taught us how to march, oh my God, I felt that was about to fall in love with her.\"","\"Cough, cough, cough...\"","Huang Yawen choked on her soup. Falling in love with the instructor... Was she crazy?! These people had never seen Instructor Ye’s murderous gaze!","Just as she was about to say ’Don’t think too highly of Instructor Ye’, she saw a row of people in green uniform passing through the glass door of the cafeteria. Instructor Ye, whom Zeng Can admired, was walking in front. She looked like... Damn! Did she see her?","Huang Yawen, who was holding the bowl, lowered her head. She almost buried her head in the fist-sized stainless steel bowl.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze silently. She was sure that... she had really frightened Huang Yawen.","What should she do?","She didn’t expect the female tyrant to be so easily frightened. She... She was just like Captain Xia, using her gaze to intimidate Huang Yawen. In the end, she actually frightened the student. She felt guilty."]},{"number":4609,"title":"Chapter 4609: Brainless","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t expect such a domineering student to turn from a tiger to a mouse.","When it was time to eat, Song Zhiqiu, who was sitting opposite her, sighed and said, \"The boys in your class took the lead. Now, a few boys in my class want to fight me one-on-one. Their request is the same. If they win, I have to be more lenient with them.","\"How would I dare to agree? Who knows what they’ll compete with me about? That’s why I rejected them and told them to take a good look at the results of tonight’s competition.\"","Someone eating at the side almost choked on his rice when he heard that. He patted his chest repeatedly before catching his breath. \"Ye Jian, who gave that boy in your class the guts to challenge you? One-on-one?\"","None of them dared to!","No, even the instructors of their school didn’t dare!","What the instructor didn’t dare to do, a hothead student actually dared to do it!","How bold!","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows and said with interest, \"The national runner-up of Taekwondo. I haven’t competed with the runner-up of a regular competition. I’ll treat it as entertainment after military training.\"","So that was how it was. How did he dare to be so brave?","\"It looks like they didn’t come up with the idea at the last minute. I’m afraid they already came up with the plan in advance. Later, they saw that the military training was tough, so they added additional conditions. The boys probably already had the intention of sparring with the instructor. Now, they’re killing two birds with one stone. Why not?\" Song Zhiqiu laughed softly. \"I have to bring the students to watch such a lively event.\"","\"Count us in. Let’s watch and kill their spirit,\" another person echoed with excitement.","The national runner-up of Taekwondo versus Ye Jian, who had the best physical fitness. It was quite exciting.","Ye Jian accepted the challenge because of Tao Yi’s identity. Besides fighting, she wouldn’t dare to accept other challenges.","There were many hidden dragons and crouching tigers among the new students. They didn’t lack any martial arts skills. Who would dare to fight them?","After thinking for a moment, Ye Jian hurriedly said to the other instructors, \"The chief instructor reminded us not to be fooled by the students’ provocation. We can challenge them, but we can’t use the relaxed military training as a bargaining chip. I still have to report the situation to the chief instructor later. I think... we might be criticized.\"","\"Don’t worry.\"","\"The new students are not easy to deal with. A few girls in my class are aggressive. I keep my distance from them even when resting. I only dare to sit with the boys. No matter what, I cherish my life.\"","When it came to the new students they were leading, there were endless topics.","The new students felt that their instructors were too ruthless, but the instructors also felt that the new students were difficult to train. If it were in the military school, anyone who dared to be sloppy would be punished immediately!","The instructors were talking about the new students. The new students were also talking about the instructors. Everyone had endless things to say.","The boy from Ye Jian’s class fell asleep after returning to his dormitory. He wanted to remind Tao Yi not to be too confident, but he ended up not giving the reminder.","The boys in the same dormitory talked enthusiastically as if they would definitely win tonight. If he rushed in and rained on their parade... Fine, there was no need to be that kind of annoying person.","Yu Ji didn’t say anything, but Huang Yawen, who couldn’t swallow her words, did. Her voice was so loud that a few girls thought that she wanted to hit someone again.","Huang Yawen didn’t dare to hit anyone anymore. Who knew when Instructor Ye would reappear?","She cherished her life!","However, these girls were chattering non-stop. She was really annoyed by them. She raised her voice and said, \"Can you guys stop daydreaming? You guys talk as if Tao Yi has already won. Tao Yi is the runner-up in Taekwondo. As for me, I’m the champion of free combat in the entire province. Look at my attitude toward Instructor Ye now. I’m like a mouse that saw a cat. How bold you guys are!\""]},{"number":4610,"title":"Chapter 4610: Feeling Wiped","paragraphs":["On the first day of Huang Yawen’s registration, she left a bad impression on the girls in the dormitory. She was so fierce, and she gave them the feeling that she could hit them at any time. Now that she suddenly opened her mouth, several girls, including Zeng Can, were shocked. They thought that she was going crazy again.","When they heard that she was the champion of free combat in the entire province, the girls’ calves and stomachs trembled.","Huang Yawen could tell that they were afraid. She pursed her lips and revealed a disdainful expression. \"Stop daydreaming. Tao Yi won’t be able to win this bet! Ha, I advise you not to be so optimistic. Wait for Instructor Ye to teach you a lesson!\"","Huang Yawen glanced at the girl whose expression was stiff. She said in a low voice, \"How boring.\" Then, she fell onto the bed and closed her eyes to rest.","She was so annoyed! She was going to be dragged through the mud by these people who didn’t know anything!","She really didn’t know where they got their confidence from to make a bet with the instructor.","If it were her...","Huang Yawen frowned furiously. If it was before she was frightened, she would definitely have joined in the fun. She might even take the initiative to challenge the instructor.","Now, she just wanted the ten days of military training to end quickly. She wanted to send the instructor away as soon as possible!","The military training started at 2:00 pm. When Ye Jian returned to the dormitory at 1:00 pm, the girls were already lying on the bed and resting. She also fell onto the bed and took an afternoon nap. Later, she arrived at the military training location ten minutes early.","At 2:00 pm, the sun was so hot that the leaves were curled up. It made people feel that the weather was so hot that they could faint from the heat.","More than 1,300 new students had already started their military training in the afternoon.","The military training that was arranged for the new students was mainly about standing at attention, standing at ease, looking to the left, standing straight, squatting, turning to the left, and running. There was also kicking, standing in the military stance, and military boxing. These were all the most basic training content. They would practice and repeat the commands every day. The energetic voices of the 36 officers sounded. The voices of the new students followed closely.","The military training in the morning was still alright. After all, it had just started. The feeling of novelty hadn’t worn off yet. After enduring for a while, it would pass. In the afternoon, however, things started to change.","The sun was too hot, and the temperature was too high. Girls fell to the ground one after another because of their weak condition. The community doctor, who had been arranged, immediately came forward to take the unconscious girls away. The rest of the classmates continued their training.","On the other hand, there were more and more students who didn’t cooperate. At this moment, the instructors needed to display their dignity. Some of the corporal punishments carried out were: push-ups, running three rounds under the sun on the sports ground, and marching forward for ten minutes.","After one round, all the boys who were punished were feeling wiped. The punishments made those monkeying around at the back behave and not dare to have any other thoughts.","They were afraid that they would go out for wool and come back shorn.","Ye Jian guessed that her students didn’t behave out of the ordinary because of tonight’s bet. After one and a half hours of military training, they finally had 15 minutes of rest.","Ye Jian blew her whistle. The 43 students didn’t even move. They just sat on the spot. They were so tired that they couldn’t even raise their fingers.","The girls leaned on each other or against the wall to rest. The boys were more energetic than the girls. When they saw the instructor, Ye Jian, sitting down with them to rest, Meng Meng, a squad leader, wiped the sweat that kept dripping down her face and asked Ye Jian, \"Instructor, do the students in your military school have to train every day too? Don’t they have to go to class? Do they train like us?\""]},{"number":4611,"title":"Chapter 4611: Interesting News","paragraphs":["Compared to the sweaty students, Ye Jian was much dryer. She sat cross-legged. As long as she wasn’t training the students, she would smile. She didn’t have the airs of an instructor at all.","She thought for a moment before replying with a smile, \"We’d train every day and attend classes every day. However, we’d be more inclined to physical training. It’s the same as yours, but it’s much more difficult.\"","\"No way... You have lessons and training. Do you have time?\"","\"Yes. We spend our time studying and training. Weekends don’t exist for us. We make use of our time at night too. We have time, but our schedule is quite tight.\"","Knowing that they were curious, Ye Jian didn’t hide it and replied seriously.","Now that the military was reformed, to improve the quality of the entire military, they started to encourage university students to join the military. These instructors didn’t just serve as instructors carrying out military training. They also had to let more university students understand the military unit and encourage them to join the military.","Military training was a national defense education. It could nurture the students’ concept of national defense. The nation also hoped that these students could join the military and serve their country.","Now, the boys were very interested in the military school and military unit. Of course, Ye Jian would tell them everything.","As they were talking, two instructors walked toward Ye Jian. The two of them explained their purpose for coming. Before Ye Jian could nod, the students in the class were already clapping.","\"Instructor, give me one. Instructor, give me one!\"","\"One, one!\"","\"One, one!\"","As it turned out, the boys from these two classes had expressed their opinions. They hoped that they could see how the instructors would stand at attention and at ease, and how they would march and march in unison. They wanted to take a look and hope that the instructors could satisfy their requirements.","These were all small requests. This was in accordance with the chief instructor’s instructions, such as promoting the military unit.","Hence, two instructors went to look for Ye Jian.","Three minutes had passed since the 15-minute break. Ye Jian didn’t reject them. She smiled and said, \"Why don’t we go together? Ten minutes is just right!\"","\"Okay! Together, together!\"","Clap, clap, clap!","The applause sounded like a tide. Ye Jian stood up and gently raised her hand to make a downward gesture. The students who were jumping happily just now stopped.","\"Gather first. It’s not good to be in a state of disunity.\"","After she finished speaking, she blew the whistle. The 43 tired students stood up as if they were on steroids. Then, the chief instructor who learned the news immediately ordered the instructors to gather the students and start the instructors’ military exercise.","During the military training, the students wanted to see how the instructors trained and how they appeared. The chief instructor wasn’t surprised at all. He saw these military school students every year. He was already used to it and was just waiting for this moment.","\"Everyone!\"","As the chief instructor gave the order, the students saw the instructors, who were standing in front of their classes, disappear in the blink of an eye. They all ran toward the gathering point.","It was fast and fierce. Before it even started, there was already applause.","The 36 instructors gathered in one minute. The chief instructor stood in front with a burning gaze. His voice was cold as he said, \"Attention, at ease!\"","When he gave the command, the students saw the instructors in the camouflage uniforms become one. When they stood at attention, their voices and actions were uniform. When they stood at ease, the students seemed to hear the sound of pants cutting through the air. With a whoosh, the instructors completed the action again. No instructor’s footsteps were slow.","With the set of commands given, the surrounding students were shocked."]},{"number":4612,"title":"Chapter 4612: Morale","paragraphs":["\"Count!\"","\"One, two, three... Ten, 11... 20, 21... 35, 36!\"","Their voices were so powerful that they could smash a hole in the ground. Just a simple count was enough to let the surrounding new students feel the instructors’ majestic aura. It was the sacred and inviolable military might of a soldier.","\"Turn left!\"","The 36 figures turned around at the same time. At this moment, they were no longer individuals with their own rhythm. Instead, they were in the same rhythm. They had already become one, an unbreakable one.","\"Turn right!\"","Swoosh!","Their actions were straightforward and neat. No one messed up the rhythm.","\"Okay!\"","\"Okay!\"","\"Cool!\"","\"Instructors, you guys are the best!\"","Applause and cheers sounded. The 36 trained figures were unmoved. They maintained a serious expression and followed the commands.","\"Let’s go!\"","Swoosh!","Their pants rubbed against the air again, and there seemed to be a static sound. 36 figures and their camouflage uniforms displayed the elegance of the local soldiers in front of the 1,300 new students.","\"Parade step, march!\"","Thud!","Their style suddenly changed drastically. Their elegance turned into a strong wind. Every step they took hit the hearts of all the students. At that moment, their hearts were surging and their blood was boiling.","Thunderous applause sounded again. The students clapped and cheered loudly. Every student was exceptionally excited and couldn’t take their eyes off the scene in front.","In ten minutes, the 36 instructors completed all the content of the military training. It was so cool. The boys stared at it in awe while the girls were excited.","Too handsome, too handsome!","The instructors were so handsome!.","With this display, the following military training became exceptionally exciting. The classes were secretly competing to see who was the loudest. Their morale was so high that the instructors couldn’t bear to stop them.","Looking at the intense military training, the chief instructor thought that many university students would join the military this year.","In this day and age, university students were still very rare. Even if they wanted to join the army, their families would be the biggest obstacle. In that case, the local armed forces needed to do some brainstorming.","Reform of the entire army was not something that could be seen overnight. It would take a long time to improve the overall quality of the army. It was important to persevere.","The morale of the new students was high for the entire afternoon. When the military training ended at 5:30 pm, there were still students who felt that time passed so quickly. Why did it end before it even started?","At 5:30 pm, the sun wasn’t as scorching as it was at noon. There was even a cool breeze. The students who finished their day of military training started singing. Their voices got louder and louder. They weren’t singing. They were shouting!","Ye Jian looked at the energetic young faces. There was a bright smile in her eyes. After a day of military training, she felt the joy of teaching other students from another school.","After dinner, the setting sun spread across the sky like flames. Groups of freshmen, who were already wearing their camouflage uniforms, rushed to the military training location. They didn’t want to miss the main event.","After dinner, Ye Jian wanted to go back to Room 405 to wash her face and wipe the sweat off her body. After that, she planned to go to the sports ground. At this moment, the female dorm was quieter. Most of them had gone to the sports ground. Perhaps they didn’t come back from their walk after dinner. From the first floor to the fourth floor, Ye Jian met a few waves of girls. She smiled and nodded at them before walking toward Room 405.","Before she could push open the dormitory door, she suddenly heard a sharp scream from downstairs. \"Thief, catch the thief! Ah! Catch the thief!\""]},{"number":4613,"title":"Chapter 4613: Too Late","paragraphs":["Huang Yawen didn’t know how she came out of the dormitory or how she reached the military training point. She walked over in a daze and stood still. It was like she lost all her senses and couldn’t hear all the sounds from the outside world.","When Zeng Can and the rest saw her coming over, their expressions changed slightly. They lowered their heads and bit their lips. They stood up silently and distanced themselves from her.","\"Huang Yawen is here!\" A boy suddenly said without rhyme or reason. The other boys immediately turned their heads with excitement in their eyes.","\"Let’s go and talk to her! F*ck, I just found out that she’s the champion of free combat in the entire province! With such powerful skills, she needs to go on stage.\"","\"It’s much more convenient for a girl to go on stage. We have to know if she’s willing.\"","\"Of course, she’d be willing. Who doesn’t want to slack off during military training? If I knew free combat, I’d offer myself up!\"","\"Should we get the girls to ask her first?\"","\"Alright. We’ll let the girls in her dorm ask. Tao Yi, what do you think?\"","Tao Yi, who was fanning himself in his camouflage uniform, looked at the tall Huang Yawen and smiled. \"Sure, let’s ask her if she agrees first. Then, we’ll see if the instructor agrees.\"","\"Hahaha, this is just a backup plan. If you lose, we still have Huang Yawen.\"","\"Do you think I’ll lose? Tsk!\" Tao Yi smiled and punched the boy’s shoulder. It wasn’t a heavy punch. They were close friends. Because he would be sparring with Ye Jian tonight, he became the most popular boy in the class. His classmates also remembered this ordinary-looking boy who was the runner-up of the national Taekwondo competition.","His confidence made the boys and girls around him laugh. The evening breeze was gentle, and their laughter was loud. Huang Yawen, who was standing there in a daze, finally came back to her senses bit by bit.","Hearing the laughter coming from the class, Huang Yawen’s gaze suddenly darkened. She glared at Tao Yi, who was among the laughing crowd.","Damn it!","They were still laughing!","They still had the time to laugh here!","She would see how they laugh later!","Huang Yawen wanted to rush over and beat Tao Yi up until he was sent to the infirmary. If it were yesterday, she would’ve taken action immediately considering her temper.","But now, she couldn’t. She had a feeling that the instructor could kill her with just a gaze. She had to endure it! Endure it! Endure it with all her might!","She couldn’t take it anymore and left!","Huang Yawen, who had to bear with it because she was afraid of Ye Jian, didn’t want to stand here anymore. She turned around and planned to find a place to stand alone.","\"Hey, why did she leave? Tao Yi, hurry up and chase after her!\"","\"F*ck, why should I go after her alone? Let’s go after her together!\" Tao Yi smiled and elbowed the boy who was speaking on purpose. As he spoke, he stood up.","The other boys could hear the hidden meaning in his words. They laughed loudly. Huang Yawen heard their laughter and walked faster as if she was escaping.","They kept laughing!","Everyone thought that Tao Yi would win?","In their dreams!","Huang Yawen muttered angrily, \"They’re a bunch of idiots, and they think they can win?\" Suddenly, Tao Yi’s voice came from behind. \"Huang Yawen, stop for a moment. We have something to discuss with you.\"","F*ck!","She didn’t want to have anything to do with them!","Huang Yawen, who didn’t want to deal with them at all, walked even faster. This time, she really looked like she was running away.","\"F*ck, why is she running? She’s running so fast.\"","\"Did she not hear us? Hurry up and chase her! It’s almost 7:00 pm. If we don’t tell her now, it’ll be too late!\""]},{"number":4614,"title":"Chapter 4614: Don’t Drag Her","paragraphs":["Tao Yi took the lead and chased after her. He really wanted to spar with the champion of free combat in the entire province. If Huang Yawen didn’t want to fight with the instructor, the two of them could spar too. Anyway, they had their own leisure time at night. It was good to show off to the students and add some liveliness to the class.","While the other classmates were thinking about how to slack off during the military training, Tao Yi was thinking further. He wanted more classmates to know, remember, and acknowledge him. It would be very helpful for his future development.","Huang Yawen was thinking, ’Don’t follow me! Get lost!’","In the end, Huang Yawen didn’t manage to escape. The boys behind her kept calling her name. She wasn’t deaf... She must have heard them. If she continued to escape, it would be obvious.","She turned around and crossed her arms. She glared at the three boys who were chasing after her. \"What are you doing? If you have something to say, say it!\"","Her gaze was very unfriendly, and even her tone was unfriendly. The three boys couldn’t help but be stunned. That... didn’t seem to have done anything to anger her.","\"I’m sorry to have delayed you for two minutes. Isn’t Tao Yi sparring with the instructor tonight? I heard from the girls that you’re the champion of free combat in the entire province. We want you to spar with the instructor too. Let’s make preparations. If one fails, the other will take over.\"","Huang Yawen waved her fist. Her gaze turned even more vicious. \"I want to beat someone up now! If you’re seeking death, don’t drag me down with you! Move! Don’t follow me anymore. There’s no room for discussion.\"","She knew that nothing good would happen out of this!","They even wanted to drag her down with them. In the morning, she thought that Tao Yi might be able to win against Instructor Ye. Then, she saw Instructor Ye hugging the drainage pipe and sliding down from the fourth floor to the first floor. She knocked down the thief the moment she saw him. She won in less than three seconds!","Tao Yi wanted to win against instructor Ye?","Dream on!","A bunch of idiots! They were even more stupid than her!","Before one offended someone, one had to look at the other person’s clothes, how they talked, and what they ate.","These people were audacious!","Damn it!","They challenged Instructor Ye directly!","If they wanted to die, they shouldn’t drag her down with them!","After gritting her teeth, Huang Yawen glared at Tao Yi and rushed back to her class.","The boys: \"...\"","Damn it!","What was with her explosive temper?","\"We didn’t offend her, right? She’s so brutal!\"","\"Forget it. That’s just what her temper is like. Yesterday, the girls said that Huang Yawen was domineering and unreasonable. She bullied the girls in her dormitory the moment she came in. It looks like it’s true.\"","Tao Yi, who was being glared at, saw that the other two boys’ expressions didn’t look good. He patted their shoulders and comforted them. \"You guys are fine. I’m the most innocent, but I got glared at by her. It’s fine if she doesn’t agree. She’s a girl. Let’s give in to her.\"","He didn’t argue with her. He was just a little unhappy.","What they didn’t know was that the moment they left, a few girls from other classes walked past them and started discussing their instructor.","She was so cool!","She was even cooler than the male instructors!","She was so cool that they wanted to run to Instructor Ye’s class and have her teach them.","When the incident happened in the female dormitory, the boys didn’t know anything. Not everyone in the female dormitory knew either. Only three or four classes of girls knew about it. When they returned to their classes to share the news, it caused exclamations all around.","\"No way! You saw it with your own eyes?\" The boys didn’t believe it and looked doubtful.","The girl who saw it with her own eyes nodded vigorously. \"I saw it, I saw it! You don’t know this, but when Instructor Ye heard that there was a thief, she hugged the drainage pipe outside the wall and slid down. I ran to the window to take a look. I saw Instructor Ye block the thief, causing him to fall.\""]},{"number":4615,"title":"Chapter 4615: Instructor Ye, You’re So Cool","paragraphs":["The girl who saw it with her own eyes had stars twinkling in her eyes. She was very lucky. She had watched the entire process and knew the situation the best!","Another girl said, \"I didn’t see how Instructor Ye came down from the fourth floor. When I was on the first floor, the thief passed by me. I didn’t react at all. Then, Instructor Ye appeared and took down the thief. Oh my god! She’s so cool that I fell in love with her instantly.\"","\"Why is she so cool?! She’s too cool! She made me dumbfounded!\"","Instructor Ye, who caught a thief, was cool. The boys swallowed their saliva and thought of something else. They prayed for the boy who bravely issued a challenge to Instructor Ye.","\"Do you want to tell their class in advance...\"","\"They should already know everything.\"","\"Don’t say it. What if they don’t want to compete anymore after finding out? Then, we won’t be able to see Instructor Ye’s skills.\"","\"Forget it, let’s not say it...\"","\"It’s too late to say now. The instructors are all here.\"","A row of neat and imposing figures walked over. They were the 36 instructors who were here to carry out military training. The chief instructor led them to the training location on time.","At this moment, Ye Jian handed the thief to the security office and rushed to the gathering point.","This was the first time she encountered a thief in university. This kind of thing would never happen in the National Science University! However, it was common in other universities. During the first few days of school, thieves would disguise themselves as parents and sneak into the campus, waiting for an opportunity to act.","The thief she caught just now had disguised himself as a student’s parent and sneaked into the campus. He avoided the dormitory teacher and entered the female dormitory.","Ye Jian was surprised too.","There were still five minutes before seven o’clock. Ye Jian walked to the group of students she was training. As soon as she walked over, she received enthusiastic applause. Ye Jian almost misunderstood that it was because she caught a thief.","In the end...","That wasn’t the case!","They were waiting for the spar, so they were very excited. They also thanked her for being open-minded as an instructor.","Ye Jian smiled.","Everyone knew that Ye Jian would spar with the students, including the teachers from Xiangnan University.","Originally, they would be sparring at the military training venue. Now, they were at the sports ground. All the students formed a circle, and the snow-white lights lit up the surroundings. The school even arranged for a teacher to host the competition. In an instant, the scene became even livelier.","\"Now, let’s welcome Instructor Ye from the third class and Classmate Tao Yi from the third class with a warm round of applause!\" The teacher smiled as he finished speaking. The entire sports ground erupted with applause.","\"Instructor Ye! Instructor Ye! You’re the coolest!\"","\"Instructor Ye, I love you! I love you! Instructor Ye!\"","\"Instructor Ye, I want to confess to you! I love you!\"","\"Classmate, you’re a girl and you’re from the first class. Why did you fall in love with Instructor Ye?\"","The teacher in charge was used to bringing up the atmosphere. When he heard countless girls confessing to Ye Jian, he chose a random girl and passed the microphone over. \"Come, come. Classmate, tell me how you fell in love with Instructor Ye.\"","\"Instructor Ye, my name is Liu Ying. I know how to sing, dance, and play instruments. I love you, Instructor Ye! You were so cool when you caught the thief today! I love you!\"","As soon as the female student, Liu Ying, finished speaking, many confessions came from the surroundings. They were all saying, \"Instructor Ye, you’re so cool! You’re so cool that I’ve fallen in love with you.\""]},{"number":4616,"title":"Chapter 4616: Operation","paragraphs":["There were both boys and girls. The other classmates who didn’t know about the thief incident now knew about it too.","\"Woah!\"","\"Ahhhhh!!!\"","With the microphone in hand, the students confessed to Ye Jian!","The sound was so loud that everyone seemed to hear thousands of horses galloping. The entire sports ground was filled with all kinds of excited voices.","Screams, roars, and whistles... The scene was so explosive that their eardrums were rattling.","The instructors were dumbfounded too. This situation... they had never seen it before! There was such a thing? These students even dared to... confess like this!","This was the first time the instructors saw a scene like this. They raised their hands to wipe their sweat. Wherever Ye Jian went, she would become popular.","A spare microphone was handed to the person involved, Ye Jian. She cleared her throat and smiled. \"I’m sorry. This is the first time a girl confessed to me, so I’m a little shocked. Thank you for liking me. I like you very much too.\"","\"Instructor, are you shy?\"","\"Hahaha, Instructor Ye is shy.\"","\"Instructor Ye, your voice is very nice! Can you sing a song for us later?\"","\"Instructor Ye, I love you!\"","Waves of excitement came one after another. The teacher didn’t dare to pass the microphone to the students anymore. He quickly retracted it and laughed loudly. \"Students, do you still want to see Instructor Ye and Tao Yi’s spar? If you do, you have to be quiet.\"","The instructors in charge of the military training stood up too. They blew their whistles to signal the students to be quiet. When the instructors took action, the heat subsided instantly. Only the sound of the whistles could be heard.","When the chief instructor saw this, he smiled, revealing his white teeth.","Ye Jian was really... She would be welcomed warmly wherever she went. Unfortunately, such an outstanding student wasn’t thinking of remaining in the school. What a pity!","The students in Ye Jian’s class were stunned. Their instructor caught a thief?","When did this happen?","Why did the students from the other classes know that their instructor caught a thief? Why didn’t anyone in their class know?","Everyone in the class was discussing. Only Huang Yawen didn’t participate.","How could she participate?","She had already warned them and even objected. Who listened to her?","If they didn’t want to listen, then so be it.","Ten days of military training would exhaust them, but it wouldn’t tire her!","The warm voices gradually became softer. Under the whistles of the instructors, discipline was quickly enforced. Ye Jian, who was standing in the arena, reached out her hand and smiled. \"I look forward to it.\"","Tao Yi calmed down and reached out to hold her hand. He smiled calmly and said, \"I look forward to it.\"","Not bad. His mentality was good. Ye Jian smiled and retracted her hand.","The chief instructor stood in the middle. After the two of them shook hands, he approached Ye Jian and reminded her in a low voice, \"Don’t be too fierce. Show mercy.\"","Ye Jian nodded slightly.","Only then did the chief instructor announce the rules of the competition. The winner had to hit the vital points three times and knock the opponent down for ten seconds.","As the chief instructor blew the whistle, the atmosphere on the sports ground, lit up by the snow-white lights, suddenly became tense.","It was starting!","Ye Jian’s students clenched their fists tightly. They were so nervous that they even held their breaths. They were cheering for Tao Yi!","\"Ah!\"","Before they could finish their thoughts, Instructor Ye had pushed Tao Yi down. Tao Yi was the one they had pinned their hopes on...","Damn it!","Who saw how Tao Yi fell?","Song Zhiqiu said to a student he was in charge of training, \"Even our school’s chief instructor wouldn’t issue a challenge against Ye Jian. Do you think that boy can win?\"","...","The entire class was silent. Fortunately, it wasn’t their class who issued the challenge."]},{"number":4617,"title":"Chapter 4617: Stop","paragraphs":["Many students were still in a daze, especially those who lowered their heads to let their mind wander. They suddenly hear silence around them. They raised their heads and looked at the venue in confusion. Then, they were very confused.","\"Why did that boy fall before they even started? Did his feet slip?\"","A student who had zoned out asked the classmate beside him in amusement. In return, the classmate rolled his eyes. \"Slip and fall? Didn’t you see what happened?\"","\"I didn’t. It’s just a warm-up round, no?\"","\"The first round has ended.\"","\"Ah! It’s over! I didn’t see it!\"","The students who didn’t see it were shocked. But who else could they blame? They could only blame themselves.","The students who saw it were no better than those who didn’t. They were confused, surprised, dumbfounded, and stunned... In short, they didn’t believe it. They didn’t believe what they saw. They didn’t believe that the first round had ended. They didn’t believe that the national runner-up of Taekwondo was knocked down by the instructor just like that. It only took five seconds!","They were going crazy!","They were going crazy!","Within five seconds, their instructor knocked Tao Yi down!","The students Ye Jian were in charge of were more confused than the students of any class. They couldn’t accept what they were seeing. Ahhhhh, Tao Yi must’ve been unprepared!","It must be!","If not, he wouldn’t have lost so quickly!","\"Go, Tao Yi! Go, Tao Yi! You’re the best!\"","\"Tao Yi, my good brother! You’re the best!\"","\"Tao Yi, Tao Yi, come on!\"","The boy who reacted first shouted again, \"Buddy, you have to hold on! You’re our hope of slacking off during military training!\"","He had to hold on!","The boys started shouting, and the girls followed suit. Tao Yi, whose face was red from the fall, didn’t feel so awkward anymore.","Just now, he didn’t know how he was knocked down by the instructor.","Just as he raised his leg and swept it out, the instructor grabbed the ankle of his leg tightly with one hand and threw it out!","Instant knockout!","Ye Jian pulled up the stunned boy down from the ground and smiled. \"Tao Yi, this is a competition. You need to show the right attitude during the competition. Don’t be careless, understand?\"","\"Instructor...\" Tao Yi jumped up with his outstretched hand and did a suave gesture of brushing his hair away from his forehead. He took a step back and quickly recovered from the awkwardness. He said calmly, \"Instructor Ye, be careful.\"","After all, he had been in competitions before. When he realized that he had underestimated his opponent, he didn’t panic immediately. Instead, he immediately calmed down and prepared for the next round of sparring.","Just now, he underestimated his opponent and thought that he could take down the instructor easily. He didn’t expect...","In the dark, Tao Yi’s eyes darkened slightly. He bit his cheeks. He had to get back at her, but he couldn’t embarrass the instructor either.","Ye Jian saw the expression on his face and smiled. She replied calmly, \"I’ve always been very careful.\"","She glanced at Tao Yi’s right leg. As she smiled, a sharp look swept past the corners of her eyes.","In the first round, Tao Yi was careless and she won in an instant.","From now on, Tao Yi wouldn’t be as careless as he was in the first round. From his gaze just now, she could tell that as the national runner-up of Taekwondo, he wouldn’t allow himself to lose too badly.","The chief instructor whistled and announced loudly that Ye Jian won the first round.","Thunderous applause sounded again. The instructors, who were about to be promoted to fourth-year students, saw their students straying away from them.","They were too enthusiastic."]},{"number":4618,"title":"Chapter 4618: Very Popular","paragraphs":["Song Zhiqiu said to his students, \"Everyone, are you planning a betrayal to join Class Three? We’re from Class One!\"","\"Hahaha, Instructor, are you jealous? Hahaha, you can compete with Instructor Ye too. We’ll definitely support you.\"","Song Zhiqiu took a step back and said with a serious expression, \"No, I still want to live for a few more years. Which one of you isn’t afraid of death? I’ll support you.\"","\"Tsk...\"","The students looked down on him. After a day of interaction, they knew that Song Zhiqiu, who was in charge of this class’ military training, was a humorous instructor. If the boys liked him, the girls... liked him even more!","The boys liked Song Zhiqiu’s wit, and the girls liked Song Zhiqiu’s face.","He was handsome! Of all the male instructors, Instructor Song was the most handsome.","\"Instructor, does Instructor Ye have a boyfriend? Are there many people wooing Instructor Ye? She’s such a beautiful instructor. The military school is full of boys. The boys wooing Instructor Ye must be plenty.\"","Song Zhiqiu raised his head and sighed. \"You’re wrong, very wrong. No one dares to woo Instructor Ye.\"","\"Ah! No way! Why? Don’t tell me you don’t like instructor Ye?\"","\"Wrong again. It’s because we’re not allowed to date!\"","After Song Zhiqiu finished speaking, the students in his class laughed heartlessly. Some boys even teased him. \"Instructor Song, aren’t you afraid that Instructor Ye will be snatched away by the boys from Xiangnan University?\"","\"Hahaha, how pitiful. You can’t date in senior high, and you can’t date in university. Life is a pursuit.\"","\"Be serious! Our life goal is to protect the country and our family, so we sacrifice romance. If we indulge in romance, our thoughts will sublimate. Instructor Ye has been in the military school for three years. All her time is spent on training, experiments, and exercises. How can she have the time to fall in love? You can’t say things casually. Be careful not to cause trouble with your mouth.\"","Song Zhiqiu’s half-serious and half-joking words caused the boys and girls to shut up silently and stop making a fuss. They were already adults. They should know when to stop.","Song Zhiqiu didn’t want word to spread that Ye Jian was wooed by a boy from Xiangnan University after a military training. He had to know when to put an end to things. He didn’t want rumors to spread for no reason.","Fortunately, this group of students knew when to stop. Thus, the topic ended and no one mentioned it again.","The instructors of the other classes had encountered similar situations. Before the military training, the chief instructor had instructed them not to allow rumors to spread about instructors getting into relationships with students. Hence, when sensitive topics were mentioned, the instructors would immediately suppress them.","Other topics could be joked about, but this kind of joke that would have a huge impact could not be allowed to spread.","Countless female students were still screaming, \"Instructor Ye is so cool. Instructor Ye, I love you.\" The teacher in charge turned on the microphone and smiled. \"Instructor Ye, you’re very popular. There’s still the second round. May I ask...\"","Everyone thought that he would pose a question to Instructor Ye, but they didn’t know that the teacher was a sneaky one. He asked Tao Yi, \"Tao Yi, do you have the confidence to defeat your instructor?\"","Tao Yi, who was caught off guard, froze for a few seconds. He quickly reacted. A confident smile appeared on his young and energetic face. \"Of course...\"","His classmates thought that he would say ’of course’. They immediately screamed in encouragement. In the end..."]},{"number":4619,"title":"Chapter 4619: Who’s Better","paragraphs":["Tao Yi was mischievous. \"Of course not! I was knocked down by Instructor Ye just now. I still have lingering fear. I thought that I could win, so I dared to spar with Instructor Ye. Is it too late for me to regret now?\"","This was a boy with a high EQ. He wanted to win, but he didn’t want to embarrass the instructor. He didn’t want the instructor to have a bad impression of him either. Hence, he showed his weakness to show his respect.","At the same time, he wasn’t completely confident that he could win. In order to prevent himself from embarrassing himself if he lost, he decided to mock himself in advance. Not only did he tell his classmates in advance that he might not be able to win, but he also found a way out for his ’loss’.","The reason why the teacher asked him was to give someone out.","The smart boy understood and quickly dispelled the awkwardness that might occur.","Ye Jian, who was standing at the side, smiled slightly. It was a pleasure to interact with someone with high EQ.","The students below laughed heartily. They placed their hands around their mouths and shouted loudly, \"It’s too late! Hahaha, buddy, brace yourself!\"","\"Buddy, our happiness is in your hands. How can you regret it?\"","\"Don’t regret it. Charge forward boldly!\"","The students from the same class were the loudest and happiest.","Huang Yawen, who was sitting down, pursed her lips. She didn’t have such a bad opinion of Tao Yi anymore.","Fortunately, he knew what he was capable of. If he dared to talk nonsense again, she would really beat him up.","The second round started as the chief instructor blew the whistle. Some people shouted, \"Instructor Ye, come on! Instructor Ye, you’re the best!\" Some people shouted, \"Come on, Tao Yi, you’re the best!\"","It was very lively. It was so lively that it made people feel relaxed. Even the night wind that blew over brought with it a pleasant and refreshing feeling.","Tao Yi wasn’t as careless as before. He clenched his fists and started to probe carefully. In the end, he suddenly approached and punched Ye Jian’s face.","The combat skills that Ye Jian learned were all killing moves. She didn’t waste her energy on probing.","Ye Jian stepped back and tilted her head. She avoided Tao Yi’s attack easily.","Tao Yi didn’t expect to hit his target with his first punch. At the same time, his competitive spirit was ignited. He started to treat this spar seriously.","After missing his attack, he immediately retracted his fist. At the same time, he let out a low growl. He raised his leg and jumped toward Ye Jian.","\"Wow!\"","The students outside the arena widened their eyes. Some students even exclaimed.","How cool!","He could even bounce up and kick.","Huang Yawen, who was sitting casually, straightened her body. Finally, she stopped pouting and having all kinds of disdainful expressions. Instead, she started watching attentively.","The national runner-up of Taekwondo had some skills.","If even she was reacting this way, there was no need to mention the other classmates.","Someone touched her shoulder lightly. A boy asked in a low voice, \"Between you and Tao Yi, who’s better?\"","’How lame!’ Huang Yawen replied in her heart and went to sit down in another spot. She didn’t want to talk to the boy who asked her a question.","If they had never competed, who knew who was better?","The boy who didn’t get an answer felt awkward. He knew about Huang Yawen’s free combat, which was why he asked the question. Who knew that... the other party would ignore him?"]},{"number":4620,"title":"Chapter 4620: Can’t Win","paragraphs":["Exclamations sounded again. Huang Yawen saw Tao Yi kicking three times consecutively. Every kick was very powerful. Instructor Ye avoided it easily every time. She didn’t even face Tao Yi head-on.","A layman would think that Tao Yi had forced Instructor Ye into a corner. Only an expert like Huang Yawen would know that Instructor Ye wasn’t using her full strength.","\"Is he going to win?! Is Tao Yi going to win? F*ck! I knew that this kid could definitely do it!\"","\"Don’t be agitated, don’t be agitated! The results are not out yet, don’t be agitated.\"","\"Tao Yi can’t win. Instructor Ye hasn’t even done anything. Idiot.\" Huang Yawen snorted coldly. She used the softest voice to express her disdain for her classmates.","She thought that she was the only one who heard it, but that was not the case. At least the students on her left and right heard it clearly.","Huang Yawen said that Tao Yi couldn’t win against Instructor Ye. Was that true? How could she tell? Instructor Ye had been backed by Tao Yi until she couldn’t fight back.","\"Tao Yi can’t win against Instructor Ye? You didn’t see wrongly, right? Instructor Ye is clearly being forced back by Tao Yi. She can’t even retaliate.\"","A boy who heard this came over and asked Huang Yawen, \"He can’t even retaliate. Do you think Tao Yi won’t be able to win against Instructor Ye?\"","Huang Yawen turned her head and looked at the boy who was approaching her. There was obvious disdain on her face. \"Instructor Ye is retreating in order to advance. She needs to familiarize Tao Yi’s punching and kicking speed as well as his attacking habits. She’s just testing him now.","\"Also, you only see that Instructor Ye is being forced to retreat by Tao Yi. Don’t you see that Tao Yi hasn’t managed to hit Instructor Ye at all?","\"Tsk, Instructor Ye is showing mercy on Tao Yi. To think that you still have the face to say that Tao Yi will win. It would be weird if he won.\"","The boy’s expression changed again and again as he listened to Huang Yawen’s merciless comments. He wanted to say something, but he didn’t know what to say.","\"Really?\"","\"Nope, I’m lying! Don’t ask me again. You’re so noisy!\" Huang Yawen retorted rudely. Her patience was limited. Her patience shouldn’t be tested.","The boy was rendered speechless. Damn, she was the girl with the worst temper he had ever seen!","No wonder she quarreled with the girls from her dormitory on the first day of reporting.","Forget it, a man wouldn’t fight with a woman!","The boy turned around and told his classmates what Huang Yawen said. Then, the message was passed from classmates to classmates. After a while, more than half of the classmates knew that Huang Yawen said that Tao Yi couldn’t win against Instructor Ye.","\"That’s impossible! He’s the national runner-up in Taekwondo. He has her own specialties. It’s impossible that he can’t win against Instructor Ye.\"","\"That’s right. Look, instructor Ye hasn’t retaliated. How can he not win?\"","\"Did Huang Yawen say that on purpose because she’s not the one fighting?\"","\"She doesn’t want to spar with Instructor Ye. It’s impossible for her to say that on purpose. She learned free combat, so she knows more than us. Also, I feel that what she said is not unreasonable. Instructor Ye has been retreating, but Tao Yi hasn’t managed to kick Instructor Ye.\"","Facts spoke louder than words. There was no need to explain too much. One would know the truth when one saw it with their own eyes.","Tao Yi knew that Instructor Ye wasn’t an easy person to deal with. He didn’t manage to kick Ye Jian at all.","Fortunately, he had given himself a way out just now so that the students would be prepared for him to lose. This way, it wouldn’t be awkward if he lost.","However, it was impossible for him to admit defeat immediately."]},{"number":4621,"title":"Chapter 4621: Heat Wave","paragraphs":["The look in Tao Yi’s eyes changed when he attacked again. At this moment, they were competing to see who would win. If he wanted to win, he had to defeat his opponent!","Ye Jian admired a student like Tao Yi. He never gave up. Seeing that his kicking speed was much faster, she knew that he was going all out.","As for her... she had almost seen through all of Tao Yi’s moves. It was her turn to act.","\"Tao Yi, have a good spar with me. Don’t hold back anymore.\" Before she attacked, Ye Jian smiled and reminded him. After reminding him, she started her counter-attack without waiting for Tao Yi’s reply.","Compared to Tao Yi’s kicks, even laymen could tell the amount of strength in Ye Jian’s moves.","\"Wow, when Instructor Ye makes a move, nothing can stop her! Oh my, my little heart. Quick, help me up. I can’t take it anymore. My heart’s about to explode!\"","\"Scram, scram! Don’t block my gaze!\"","\"She’s so cool! What should I do? I really want to woo instructor Ye!\"","\"Get lost. You’re lacking still.\"","Under the snow-white spotlights, Ye Jian’s figure was like a cold sword drawn from a scabbard. She was wrapped in an aura that swept over everything. In an instant, the outcome seemed to have been determined..","Tao Yi was shocked. He was shocked by Ye Jian’s gaze.","\"It’s over, it’s over. He’s definitely going to lose. He’s definitely going to lose. I didn’t expect our instructor to hide her skills so well. I can’t tell that she’s an expert.\"","\"So be it. It’s just leisure and entertainment. Don’t take it to heart. Even Yu Ji, the one who proposed the idea, is keeping quiet now. Isn’t that right, Yu Ji?\"","Yu Ji forced a stiff smile. \"Yes, so be it. It’s not embarrassing to lose to the instructor, right?\"","He no longer had any hope of Tao Yi winning.","\"That’s right. It’s not embarrassing. I don’t care about winning or losing now. I’m only concerned about why our instructor is so cool! Quick, look, she’s soaring in the air. Damn! She’s really soaring in the air!\"","On the field, Ye Jian stopped probing and attacked.","For Tao Yi to be able to get the second-place, his body was indeed not bad. His speed and strength were very accurate. His moves were all ruthless too. He only made critical attacks. However, no matter how agile Tao Yi was, he was no longer a threat to Ye Jian.","Of course, it was impossible for her to deal with a student the same way she would deal with a vicious enemy. It was just a spar. She would stop when necessary!","After two consecutive side kicks in the air, Tao Yi’s legs were swept by her. The tall and big boy was knocked down again.","\"Damn it! The instructor knocked Tao Yi down again!\" The boy who spoke was filled with shock. He widened his eyes and stared at the domineering figure again. He exclaimed repeatedly, \"She’s really amazing. She’s very cool. She’s the coolest and most beautiful girl I’ve ever seen!\"","The girls’ screams sounded again. The screams were louder and more enthusiastic than before. The other instructors had no choice but to take a few steps back again so that their eardrums could suffer less.","Tao Yi, who was knocked down, didn’t admit defeat immediately. He still wanted to struggle to get up, but Ye Jian’s hands were like iron pincers. The more he struggled, the tighter her hands around him. In the end, even his shoulders and ribs hurt.","\"One, two, three... eight, nine, ten! Time’s up! The instructor wins!\"","This time, the teacher in charge came to count down. After counting to ten, Ye Jian immediately let go of Tao Yi. Outside the arena... the atmosphere was boiling.","\"Ahhhhh! Instructor Ye! Look here, I love you! Instructor Ye!\"","\"Instructor Ye, you’re so cool! You’re the coolest instructor I’ve ever seen!\"","\"Instructor Ye, you’re amazing!\""]},{"number":4622,"title":"Chapter 4622: Convinced, Convinced!","paragraphs":["The teacher in charge asked, \"Are you convinced now?\"","\"We are!\" They were united.","\"Do you admit defeat?\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Do you still dare to challenge the instructors in the future?\"","\"We won’t do it again!\"","The teacher in charge asked again, \"Are you still going to compete?\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Let’s not compete anymore!\"","This time, their words were different.","Amidst the screams, Ye Jian smiled at Tao Yi and said, \"I used a lot of strength, but you almost broke free. Fortunately, I was prepared.\"","Tao Yi was aware of their difference in strength. Although he was mentally prepared to lose, he was still a little disappointed. He scratched the back of his head in embarrassment. \"I’m sorry, Instructor. I’ve delayed your time.\"","\"No, I wanted to spar with you too. Also, you’re very skilled. It’s just that my path is different from yours. I believe that you were able to see some clues.\"","That was true. Tao Yi recalled the look in her eyes that frightened him just now. Now that he thought about it again, his heart was still palpitating. That look... If he had seen it before, he would never have suggested sparring with the instructor.","Just her gaze was enough to make him retreat.","There was no need to compete in the third round. The results were evident. They might as well have some other entertainment programs. The chief instructor whispered a few words to the hosting teacher. Ye Jian and Tao Yi returned to their class amidst the cheers.","At this moment, Ye Jian finally felt how enthusiastic the students were. Their gazes were so intense that she felt herself burning up.","After returning to the class, she was welcomed again. Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Students, you won’t be able to propose any conditions for the next nine days of military training. And I won’t agree to any of your conditions either.","\"Military training is a national defense education. There’s no such thing as slacking off. There are no shortcuts either. I hope you can remember this. I also hope that the ten days of military training will bring you a different experience. No matter how magnificent the future is, military training will always be the most beautiful memory in your mind.","\"And you’ll also be a beautiful memory in my military life.\"","\"Instructor Ye, you’re the most beautiful memory in everyone’s hearts now!\" The sweet-talking boy shouted loudly, and the students followed suit.","Ye Jian revealed her purest smile. Her eyes were bright, and her teeth were white. She looked like the most beautiful moon in the sky.","In an instant, the smile became the most beautiful sight in the students’ eyes. Later on, someone saw the general who was awarded the highest medal in the military on television and could recognize that the general was once their military training instructor.","After this spar, the restless students in the class put away their thoughts and didn’t dare to tease the instructor anymore. Especially when they returned to the dormitory at night and heard the story about the instructor sliding down the drainage pipe from the fourth floor to the first floor in the evening. She knocked down the thief in three seconds. The awe that arose in their hearts made them freeze.","Even the students from the other classes became very well-behaved and did not dare to be too naughty.","Tao Yi listened for a long time before saying, \"If I had known, I wouldn’t have fought with Instructor Ye.\"","Yu Ji, who was in the same dormitory, struggled for a long time. In the end, he told the entire dormitory about his experience. In response, all the boys in the dormitory fell silent. The night ended with exclamations and curses.","If they had known, they wouldn’t have pushed Tao Yi out to compete!","\"Do you know? Huang Yawen was the only one who objected to you sparring with Instructor Ye. Do you think she knew something?\"","Before turning off the lights, a boy said in a low voice, \"Otherwise, why would she resist when we went to look for her?\""]},{"number":4623,"title":"Chapter 4623: Private Talk","paragraphs":["It was not a secret in the class that Huang Yawen refused to spar with the instructor. At that time, the news of her rejection spread quickly. There were even a few boys in the class who had some objections.","On top of that, she kicked up a fuss in the dormitory on the first and second day after registration. Although she had only been in class for three days, the boys’ impression of Huang Yawen was very ordinary. Now that Huang Yawen was mentioned, the boys in Tao Yi and Yu Ji’s dormitory fell silent.","After being silent for a long time, Yu Ji sighed softly and said slowly, \"The girls said that Huang Yawen is very arrogant, but ever since the military training, Huang Yawen has never dared to go against Instructor Ye. Everyone agreed to the spar except for her. She must have known that Instructor Ye was very powerful, so she didn’t dare to.","\"I’m hunchbacked. During the day, Instructor Ye used her hands to widen my shoulders. At that time, I was in so much pain that I thought my bones were going to crack. Later, she patted Huang Yawen’s back lightly. Huang Yawen was so frightened that she fell forward. The two girls in front were so frightened that they fell as well.","\"Sigh... Actually, from that moment onward, I already had a bad feeling.\"","At the mention of what happened during the day, Yu Ji simply said everything in one breath. \"Huang Yawen is the champion of free combat in the entire province. She’s tall, strong, and can fight. She’s in the same dormitory as Instructor Ye. Instructor Ye just patted her lightly and she was so frightened... Friends, she must’ve realized that Instructor Ye was powerful. It’s just that all of us wanted to slack off, so we didn’t think too much about it.\"","A boy immediately said, \"Damn, why didn’t you tell us this earlier?\"","Yu Ji was embarrassed. \"I didn’t have the face to say it. A man’s dignity needs to be kept, no?\"","\"Even if you had told me earlier, I would’ve still sparred with instructor Ye,\" Tao Yi continued. His voice sounded very light. He wasn’t affected by this. \"Not everyone has the chance to spar with the instructor.\"","The boy sleeping on Tao Yi’s upper berth leaned out and smiled. \"Then don’t think about it anymore. It’s not embarrassing to lose to the instructor.\"","Tao Yi, who wasn’t sleepy, smiled and replied, \"I’m fine. Don’t think too much. Instructor Ye’s path is different from mine. It’s normal that I lost to her.\"","\"Let’s be more well-behaved in the future. We shouldn’t slack off in front of Instructor Ye. We shouldn’t think that she’s easy to bully just because she’s a girl. Everyone, let’s finish the nine days of military training obediently.\"","Tao Yi, who was talking with his eyes closed, recalled the scene during the fight. Every time he recalled it, the first thing that entered his mind was the pair of eyes that were filled with ruthlessness. The gaze was very cold. It was bone-chillingly cold. That gaze... was something he would never forget.","\"Even you can’t beat Instructor Ye. How can we dare to play any cheap shots? I really can’t tell how amazing Instructor Ye is.\"","\"Who among us would have known? Otherwise, we wouldn’t have let Tao Yi compete. Tonight, our instructor became famous after one match. The girls are already so crazy, let alone the boys. Do you think that after the military training ends, there’ll be boys confessing to Instructor Ye?\"","\"Hahaha, definitely! Now, I think that Instructor Ye isn’t beautiful. She’s handsome. She’s graceful like a dragon. What kind of man can become Instructor Ye’s boyfriend? How blissful he must be.\"","Speaking of topics that all the boys were interested in, the frame beds creaked.","The boys in this dormitory weren’t the only ones who kept chatting. The other dormitories were the same. Besides the boys, the girls didn’t fall asleep immediately either. They were all talking about the military training."]},{"number":4624,"title":"Chapter 4624: Scary","paragraphs":["As for the news of Ye Jian catching the thief, all the new students knew about it. The girls who saw it with their own eyes kept repeating what happened in the evening.","Every time the students heard about Ye Jian rushing out from the fourth floor and grabbing the drainpipe on the outer wall, they would gasp.","A girl specially ran to the fourth floor to look at the drainage pipe. Then, she glanced at the first floor and returned to the dormitory.","It was terrifying!","The drainage pipe placed on the outer wall was not something that could simply be touched with one’s hands. Instead, one needed to stand on the cement railing and raise their hands and feet at the same time. Their entire body would be half suspended in the air before they could barely touch the drainage pipe on the outer wall. In that case... how could Instructor Ye reach the railing and hug the drainage pipe?","The person who was most qualified to answer this question was Huang Yawen. She was the closest to Ye Jian at that time. She was so close that she could see how Ye Jian climbed to the railing with both hands and jumped from the four-story railing. She hugged the drainpipe that was a certain distance away, risking taking a fall from the fourth floor...","It was late at night, and the sound of the insects had reduced a lot. Only the stars in the black sky were resplendent.","The door of Room 405 opened slowly. A muscular figure was trying to squeeze out from the gap. The size of the gap was not big enough. The figure turned sideways but still had no choice but to open the door a little more.","In the dormitory, Ye Jian, who was sleeping on the wooden bed at the outermost corner, watched the black shadow as it got up and squeezed through the door. There was a faint smile in her eyes. The timid Huang Yawen wasn’t as arrogant as a few days ago. Overall, she wasn’t bad.","In the past, she was pampered too much by her family, so she developed an overbearing personality that made her think that she had the final say. Now that she was far away from her family and had lost her parents’ indulgence, she had no choice but to face the fact that not everyone would go along with her, spoil her, and acknowledge her.","It was a good thing for Huang Yawen to realize the differences between society and family in school.","However... it was already 11:30 pm. Why did she sneak out?","After thinking for a while, Ye Jian got up from the bed.","Huang Yawen was standing at the spot where Ye Jian climbed up the drainage pipe during the day. She placed her hands on the cement railing and took a few deep breaths. Then, she nimbly climbed onto the railing and hugged the wall with her hands...","Her legs were shaking. When she glanced at the first floor, not only were her legs shaking, but even the hands that were supporting her against the wall were shaking.","Damn it!","She was so high up!","Then, she looked at the drainage pipe an arm away. Huang Yawen’s legs were trembling. She closed her eyes and took deep breaths. When she felt that she wasn’t so afraid anymore, she slowly stretched her hand toward the drainage pipe...","One of her hands slipped, and her body fell uncontrollably. She was so frightened that she broke out in a cold sweat. She immediately retracted her trembling hand and hugged the outer wall tightly again. Cold sweat appeared on her forehead.","Ye Jian, who came out, happened to see her actions. Ye Jian, who was tensed up, felt her heart jump into her throat. She stared at Huang Yawen intently, afraid that she would jump down from the fourth floor.","However... she didn’t look like she wanted to commit suicide. Instead, she looked like she wanted to touch something.","What did she want to touch?","Ye Jian quickly hid in the shadow of the railing that was half the height of a human. She hunched her back and approached Huang Yawen."]},{"number":4625,"title":"Chapter 4625: Criticism","paragraphs":["What was Huang Yawen trying to do by climbing the guardrail in the middle of the night?","Ye Jian was so frightened that she broke out in a cold sweat. She didn’t dare to stop Huang Yawen at all. She was afraid that if she suddenly spoke, she would scare her.","Huang Yawen didn’t notice Ye Jian. This was the first time she didn’t succeed. She hugged the outer wall with both hands and stood motionless. She took deep breaths.","’Come on, Huang Yawen! You can definitely do it! If other people can do it, you can definitely do it too!’","She just needed to try again. If she tried again, she might succeed!","Huang Yawen closed her eyes. She didn’t feel so afraid anymore. She started moving again...","Ye Jian didn’t give her a chance to move. The moment she got close, she hugged Huang Yawen’s thigh and pulled her inside. With a scream, Huang Yawen was pulled back to the corridor of the fourth floor.","The scream came from Huang Yawen. A scream suddenly sounded in the quiet dormitory building. The girls who weren’t asleep got goosebumps.","Ye Jian covered Huang Yawen’s mouth in time and didn’t give her a chance to scream again. \"Huang Yawen, why aren’t you sleeping in the middle of the night? Why did you come out to climb over the railing? If you fall, do you think anyone will be able to find you in an instant?\"","The cold voice floated into Huang Yawen’s ears again. Her entire body froze like a rock. Even her screams were stuck in her throat. She widened her eyes in fear, not knowing what to do.","A few flashlights shone upstairs from the first floor. Ye Jian stood up and stood by the railing. She said to the teacher who was alarmed, \"Teacher, I’m fine. I was frightened by a mouse.\"","The teacher in charge of the dormitory heaved a sigh of relief. She didn’t recognize Ye Jian. She raised her voice and said sternly, \"Hurry up and go back to the dormitory to sleep!\"","\"Yes, Teacher.\"","Ye Jian, who was acting as a student, replied. Then, she turned around and looked at Huang Yawen. She saw that she was trying to escape.","She took a few steps and blocked her path. She said in a low voice, \"Do you know what you were doing just now? Aren’t you going to explain it to me?\"","...","In front of Ye Jian, Huang Yawen, who had turned from a tiger into a mouse, hunched her back and explained nervously.","Ye Jian was speechless.","She really wanted to scold her!","Huang Yawen wanted to see if she could jump onto the drainage pipe and slide to the first floor. That was why she sneaked over when everyone was sleeping.","Ye Jian took a deep breath and suppressed the anger in her heart. She tried her best to make her voice calm. \"The fourth floor is so high up. Every floor is three meters high, so the fourth floor is 12 meters high. In addition, you’re 1.7 meters tall. Do you know the consequences of falling from a height of 14 meters?\"","Huang Yawen was so scared that she was about to cry. She kept nodding. She knew. Of course, she knew.","Then why did she do it when she already knew?!","Ye Jian was so angry that she laughed. \"If you know it, why did you still do it? Tell me the reason. What’s the reason you forsook your life and climbed over the railing?\"","\"Instructor, I just want to be a soldier. I thought that if you could climb over it, I... I could definitely do it too.\"","This was the first time Huang Yawen spoke to Ye Jian since that night. Her voice was as soft as a mosquito.","She wanted to be a soldier... Ye Jian was furious. She remembered Huang Yawen’s unreasonable behavior that night. She was arrogant and unreasonable... Yet, she wanted to be a soldier.","It was a good thing to want to be a soldier, but it didn’t look like she wanted to be a soldier. It looked more like she wanted to die!","Ye Jian adjusted her breathing again. Her voice was so deep that it was rusty. \"If I can do it, you can do it too? Who told you that? I’ve undergone professional training. Have you? You learned free combat, not climbing! Do you know why I can climb? I’ve been training for almost seven years. What about you? Where did you get the confidence to think that you can climb too?","\"Huang Yawen, it’s good to be bold, but you’re audacious now!\""]},{"number":4626,"title":"Chapter 4626: A Caring Elder Sister","paragraphs":["Even though Ye Jian was bold, she broke out in a cold sweat because of Huang Yawen’s boldness.","Because other people could climb over the railing, Huang Yawen actually thought that she could too. If other people killed and set fires, wouldn’t she be interested in killing and setting fires one day?","After scolding her in one breath, Ye Jian’s face was still ashen. Her gaze was as cold as ice. It was so cold and sharp that Huang Yawen’s shoulders tightened. She lowered her eyes and didn’t dare to look at Ye Jian.","After Ye Jian finished speaking, the anger in her heart dissipated bit by bit. Fortunately, nothing happened to Huang Yawen. If something had happened to her... Just thinking about it made Ye Jian’s heart tremble.","A family’s daughter was sent to Xiangnan University to study but she never came back. How could the parents, who doted on their daughter so much, accept this? They would probably want to blow up the school.","\"Huang Yawen, you’re already 19 years old. You’re no longer a child. I don’t know how you managed to live your life day by day in the past, but now, you’re an adult who has left home and your parents. You need to live alone and face everything alone. You should restrain your recklessness and learn to think seriously and maturely. You shouldn’t just rely on your personal preferences to deal with everything.","\"If you had fallen tonight, do you think you would’ve been able to live to see the sun tomorrow? You’d pay with your life.","\"Do you know why you’re afraid of me? It’s because I’m not afraid of you. In fact, I’m even more ruthless than you are. That’s why you’re afraid. You know that I’ll definitely be even more ruthless to you. That’s why you’re afraid of me.","\"There’s always someone better. Society isn’t your home. You won’t be able to do whatever you want. There’s a bottom line for everything. When you cross it one day, someone will stand up and teach you a lesson.","\"For example, you stepped on my bottom line the last time. I won’t let you continue to step on my bottom line. I’ll clearly warn you of the consequences if there’s a next time.","\"Even if your parents appear, I won’t back down. I have thousands of ways to let you know the consequences and teach you a lesson.\"","\"No one will allow you to be impudent. You’ll definitely be taught a lesson because of your impudence. Think about what I said tonight and see who has given in to you before.","\"It’s late now. We still have training tomorrow. Rest early.\"","As an instructor, Ye Jian could only educate and criticize Huang Yawen. There was nothing else she could do.","Huang Yawen’s parents were the biggest culprits for spoiling her until she was arrogant. She didn’t even have basic morals.","Huang Yawen tightened her shoulders and moved her hands and feet. She didn’t dare to look at Ye Jian. She lowered her head and got up. She wanted to shrink herself, but her body size and weight didn’t allow her to do so. No matter how much she shrank, she couldn’t disappear from Ye Jian’s sight.","Ye Jian was amused and angry when she saw this. \"Do you really think that I’ll kill you? Student, this is a lawful society. I can’t kill you just because I want to. Hurry up and go to sleep!\"","She was so afraid. Ye Jian didn’t know if she should call her bold or timid.","Huang Yawen, who didn’t say anything, quickly raised her head and glanced at Ye Jian. Seeing that Ye Jian was still staring at her, she was so frightened that she retracted her head and walked toward Room 405.","She was dawdling so much, but Ye Jian simply waited for her to walk ahead.","She needed to keep an eye on Huang Yawen. What if she did something stupid again?","After taking a few steps, Huang Yawen stopped moving. She lowered her head and stood there like a pillar. Ye Jian looked at her for a while and sighed. \"Do you have something to say to me?\"","She felt that she wasn’t an instructor at this moment but a caring elder sister!"]},{"number":4627,"title":"Chapter 4627: One Thought","paragraphs":["Huang Yawen really wanted to ask Ye Jian something, but she didn’t dare to. Now that Ye Jian suddenly asked, she swallowed her saliva and made up her mind. She closed her eyes and asked quickly, \"Instructor, did you really not rely on your connections to enter the military school?\"","What she said made Ye Jian feel like vomiting blood. She took a deep breath before replying, \"You need to take exams to enter military schools. Just like how you got into Xiangnan University, you need to take exams too. You can only enter the military school after an interview, a physical examination, and a political review.","\"connections? Why don’t you find one for me?\"","Huang Yawen quickly raised her head and glanced at Ye Jian. Then, she quickly said, \"I just can’t find any connections. That’s why I’m asking you.\"","\"Then let me tell you now. It doesn’t matter. You have to take the exams yourself. Do you want to be a soldier? University students can be one too. Change your bad habits and try again. You can’t be domineering, unreasonable, stubborn, and condescending... If you don’t change your bad habits, you won’t be able to pass the first round.","\"Also, even if you really become a soldier one day, you shouldn’t think of yourself as all that. There are many capable people in the military unit. It’s far beyond your imagination. Don’t think that you’re so great just because you learned free combat. In our eyes, it’s easy to get rid of you.","\"If you want to be a soldier, you have to change yourself first. Otherwise, it’s useless even if you want to be one.\"","Ye Jian was really frustrated. What kind of family raised a child like Huang Yawen? Wanting to use connections? Could it be that her family relied on connections? Did she think that there was no other solution?","Huang Yawen lowered her head again. After a while, she said in a low voice, \"Oh.\" She was confused. She didn’t understand what Ye Jian meant.","However, she didn’t ask anymore. She followed Ye Jian back to the dormitory obediently.","The news that Huang Yawen wanted to try to climb the drainpipe on the fourth floor didn’t spread. Only Ye Jian knew about it.","In the following days of training, Huang Yawen became more honest and quiet. Even the girls in the dormitory felt that she had changed a lot. Sometimes, they were willing to take the initiative to talk to her.","Every time the training ended, the boys would pester Ye Jian to ask her about military school and the military unit. As for the boys, they had a natural bloodthirstiness and yearned for the military. As long as it didn’t involve secrets, Ye Jian would answer their questions seriously.","Other than Ye Jian’s class, the other classes were the same. Even when Song Zhiqiu and the rest returned to the dormitory, they had to entertain the boys who came to visit from time to time and answer their questions.","During lunch, a third-year student laughed softly and said, \"Why do I feel like we’re spies who have infiltrated the enemy’s ranks?\"","The other third-year students nodded in agreement.","As they interacted from time to time, the students and instructors got along harmoniously.","Director Guan smiled at the chief instructor. \"The students from the National Science University are still the best. After a few consecutive military trainings, this batch is the most honest and obedient. They make me the least worried.\"","In the previous batches, there were even fights between instructors.","This time, from the start to the eighth day of military training, everything was calm. Besides the students who fainted from heatstroke, no other accidents happened. Also, the students and instructors cooperated well. The students looked forward to nightfall the most. They hoped to chat with the instructors more.","The day after tomorrow was the tenth day of the military training. It was time for it to end.","As the military training neared its end, there were obvious changes to the 1,200 plus new students. Take the military stance, as an example. It was not a problem for them to stand still for half an hour. The leaders who came to observe from time to time nodded secretly.","On the night of the ninth day, Ye Jian and the other 36 instructors received the news that Xiangnan University had decided to merge the new students from the two campuses and review them together tomorrow. At the same time, the instructors in charge of the other campus hoped to have a martial arts performance with the instructors here."]},{"number":4628,"title":"Chapter 4628: Who Is More Impressive","paragraphs":["When Ye Jian and the rest knew that the instructors from the north campus wanted to have a competition with them, their first reaction was that the other party was going to mobilize a large number of people.","There were more than 2,000 students in the northern campus and more than 1,300 students in the main campus. If the students from the northern campus came to the main campus, there would be dozens of buses!","\"Why did you suddenly make such a decision?\" Ye Jian asked the chief instructor in surprise. \"Isn’t this decision too hasty? Tomorrow is the review. If the students are merged, won’t the two sides have to go back to square one?\"","They had been practicing since yesterday. Today, they had practiced six times. Tomorrow, they just needed to complete the review based on the two days of practice.","Now that they were suddenly merging into one, how could they complete the inspection? It would be chaotic!","However, this was the university’s decision. The chief instructor couldn’t change it. He understood Ye Jian’s worry. Before he received the news, he expressed his opinion to the university immediately. The university couldn’t change the decision either. The students from the north campus requested an emergency meeting. In the end, the university agreed to the students’ request.","\"The students requested that the university hold an emergency meeting, and the university agreed in the end. There won’t be any changes on our side. The only change is the competition between the instructors tomorrow. The rest won’t change. After the event ends, we’ll have a meeting.\"","The chief instructor saw that Ye Jian, who was always calm and composed, was frowning. He teased her, \"Why? Are you afraid that you’ll embarrass yourself in the competition tomorrow? I don’t think that you’ll lose even if it’s one against three.\"","The one was Ye Jian while the three were others.","Facing the teasing, Ye Jian laughed softly. \"I wouldn’t dare to embarrass myself. I’m just worried that it’ll affect the review.\" Her smile disappeared slightly, and there was a hint of worry in her clear voice. \"The students from the north campus haven’t practiced at the main campus. The scene is completely unfamiliar. They’re used to the square venue of the north campus. I’m afraid there’ll be chaos if there’s a sudden change.\"","The chief instructor said, \"The university will arrange for the northern students to arrive tomorrow morning and practice twice in advance. The basic problems will be solved. As usual, we won’t interfere with each other.\"","At this point, it was useless to say anything else. Before the event started, Ye Jian and the other 36 instructors told this news to the students in their class. They thought that the students would be conflicted, but they were all exceptionally excited and looking forward to the arrival of the students from the north campus tomorrow.","They were so excited that Ye Jian was stunned. She asked, \"Aren’t you worried about the review tomorrow? It’s been hard on you for nine days. Aren’t you worried?\"","\"We’re not worried!\"","\"Instructor Ye, we’re not worried at all. Since they dare to come, we’ll fight them!\"","\"That’s right. We’re not afraid of anyone! Let them see our might!\"","\"Let’s fight! Instructor Ye, you taught us this! Worry? Hahaha, we’re not worried at all. We need to make them worry!\"","\"I’m worried that we’ll snatch all their glory! Hahahaha!\"","The confident laughter of those from Ye Jian’s class echoed. After recovering from her surprise, she laughed softly. She made a mistake.","She only thought about the review getting affected. She didn’t expect that... this group of young university students would be so excited to compete with the students from the north campus.","Not bad, this was how youths should be!","Even the students had this thought. As an instructor, she should be reprimanding herself for being negligent.","The other classes were similar to Ye Jian’s class. The students thought that the students from the north campus came here to show off.","Heh, they would see what the outcome was!","Who was more impressive?"]},{"number":4629,"title":"Chapter 4629: Rules","paragraphs":["Hence, Ye Jian threw away the worry in her heart and sat in a circle with the students. She smiled and said, \"Since they’re coming here, let’s fight. Tomorrow, you have to shout the slogan and walk in an orderly manner. Also, remember to eat your breakfast. Only when you’re full will you have the energy to work. Do you understand?\"","\"We understand!\"","The young and energetic students replied to Ye Jian in their loudest voices.","If more than 1,300 students formed a circle on the sports ground and spent the last night of their military training, it would also be a night for the students to show off. The event would start at 7:30 and end at 9:30. It would be two and a half hours. That would be the time for the students to show off.","Ye Jian’s class proposed four programs. In the end, two programs were chosen. One was a street dance performance that would be done by nine students. The other one was a musical performance. Besides the lute player, the other three students came from other classes.","Ye Jian had only seen the street dance rehearsal of her class. There were seven boys and two girls. Ye Jian kept clapping when she saw them dancing. The music coupled with the ostentatious and powerful body movements completely stunned Ye Jian.","When the nine students saw their instructor clapping until their palms were red, their confidence increased greatly. They rehearsed even more diligently and wanted to achieve the best effect.","As for the musical performance, Ye Jian had never seen the students rehearsing before. She didn’t even know where they were rehearsing. This afternoon, she wanted to take a look, so she asked the girl who was playing the lute where they were practicing so that she could take a look. In the end... the girl ran away with a smile and said that it was a secret.","Secret... Even an instructor like her was not privy to this information.","The event hadn’t started. Ye Jian, who was chatting with the students, listened to their thoughts on the nine days of military training quietly. As it was the last night of military training, the students’ laughter had a hint of disappointment. Even when they spoke, there was a hint of sorrow in their voices.","As they chatted, they talked about old topics... They asked for contact methods.","\"Instructor, just give us your contact method secretly. We won’t tell anyone, okay?\"","\"That’s right. We won’t tell anyone. Just give it to us. We know that all the instructors are military school students from the National Science University. Look, our schools aren’t too far apart. We’ll be able to keep in touch.\"","\"That’s right. We won’t go over to look for you often. It’s just that we’ll occasionally contact each other like friends. Instructor, give us your contact method.\"","Actually, it was easy to look for Ye Jian at the National Science University. Almost all the sentinels at the sentry post knew Ye Jian. The main reason was that they wouldn’t let anyone in.","Ye Jian’s reply was the same as before. She shook her head and smiled. \"This is the rule. After the military training, we are not allowed to write or call the students. We are not allowed to leave our contact methods. You can’t get me to violate the rules.","\"Strict discipline is the basic requirement of soldiers. To us soldiers, rules are absolute. No one can violate it or ignore it.","\"If I give you my contact method today, it’ll be a small matter that you’ll forget when you turn around. However, to me, it’s not a small matter. I would’ve violated the rules and regulations. I would’ve violated the rules that a soldier should follow.","\"That’s why no matter what you say, I won’t break the iron rules.\""]},{"number":4630,"title":"Chapter 4630: Strange","paragraphs":["When the students received the same reply as before, they were so disappointed that they heaved long sighs. Just as they were about to say something, a boy who was going to change into his street dance clothes ran over. He panted and shouted excitedly, \"Instructor!\" Then, he said to his classmates, \"Friends, there’ll be a huge surprise waiting for you tonight! I’ll invite the instructor to a place first. You can continue chatting!","\"Remember, there’s a huge surprise today. You’ll definitely scream!\"","Ha, he was already excited.","\"Instructor, the instructor of the first class has invited you over. He said that he has something to discuss with you.\" The boy took Ye Jian away under the sparkling eyes of all the students. The students who were purely audience members whispered to each other and guessed what the surprise would be.","\"Meng Meng, what did you plan behind my back? You’re the squad leader that I personally chose. You can’t hide anything from an instructor like me.\"","On the way, Ye Jian started to pry information from the guy, Meng Meng, to find out what the so-called ’surprise’ was.","Her instincts told her that this surprise... had a lot to do with her!","The instructor of the first company was Song Zhiqiu. Could it be that the ’surprise’ had something to do with him? Or was he the one who planned it?","Meng Meng laughed like a thief. The tall and skinny boy, who knew how to dance, kept the secret to himself. He shook his head and said, \"I don’t know either. Instructor, you’ll know when you get there.\"","\"You really don’t know? Ha, I know that this surprise has something to do with me. Since you came to inform me, how can you not know?\"","\"I really don’t know. I’m just in charge of passing the message. I don’t know anything else. Instructor, I’m mute now. I won’t be able to answer you.\"","Instructor Song had reminded him not to be tricked by Instructor Ye because she was very smart. If he wasn’t careful, she would guess the surprise they had planned.","Meng Meng, who had remembered Song Zhiqiu’s advice, decided to pretend to be mute from this second onward!","Ye Jian smiled and didn’t probe further.","If she continued asking, she would be able to pry out what the ’surprise’ was.","After passing through the sports ground, they went around a blue sports ground and walked through a tree-lined path with towering trees on both sides. They finally arrived at their destination.","This was the secret base of a certain club in Xiangnan University.","The place was built with red bricks from the 1980s. Back then, it didn’t have any paint and looked like it came from a certain era. However, it had been renovated and looked modern now.","Ye Jian walked up the stairs. As soon as she reached the second floor, she heard the sonorous music. Ye Jian stopped in her tracks. Her black eyes, which were still smiling just now, became depressed at a speed visible to the naked eye. It was like an unfathomable sea. It made people’s hearts ache.","Ambush from Ten Sides...","She could hear the music inside. This was their ’surprise’. They wanted her to dance Ambush from Ten Sides again. As it turned out, this was the surprise the instructors would give the students.","And yet...","Ye Jian closed her eyes gently and suppressed the tears that were about to fall.","Ambush from Ten Sides was the song she used to commemorate her comrade, J5. It wasn’t a surprise. It was the sorrow in her heart that still hurt to this day.","Meng Meng, who was half a step behind, noticed something amiss. He even saw weakness and... sorrow on Ye Jian’s face.","What was going on?","\"Instructor Ye, you...\"","The boy opened his mouth nervously. He wanted to ask what was wrong, but he keenly felt that even if he did, the instructor would not answer truthfully.","\"I’m fine. Let’s go.\""]},{"number":4631,"title":"Chapter 4631: For Whom","paragraphs":["Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly and raised her chin slightly. She suppressed the bitterness in her eyes and said in a feather-like voice, which made Meng Meng’s heart tremble for no reason.","Why did Instructor Ye have a look of sorrow just because of Ambush from Ten Sides?","Suppressing the doubts in his heart, Meng Meng didn’t dare to speak. Even his facial expression couldn’t help but become solemn.","He pushed the door open and entered. Ambush from Ten Sides immediately sounded. It was a song about the soldiers who died on the battlefield and left the world with nostalgia. Meanwhile, the living soldiers raised their spears and roared loudly. They charged again. They fought for their country, for their home, and for the peace of their country.","It was the same for the soldiers in ancient times and now.","Ambush from Ten Sides was originally played on the pipa. During the students’ performance, the pipa was still the main instrument. The others were used as support. The four musical instruments gave different effects.","\"The students in your class are too difficult to deal with. They insisted that I tell them what kind of performance you’ve done. We were classmates for three years, but I only saw you perform once. But that one time was enough. It was enough to shock us all. It was truly unforgettable.","\"If it’s inconvenient for you to dance again, we can cancel it.\"","Song Zhiqiu looked at Ye Jian quietly with worry in his eyes. Even his voice was low.","Just now, Meng Meng said that when Ye Jian heard Ambush from Ten Sides, a look of sorrow suddenly flashed across her face. Song Zhiqiu’s heart sank.","Could it be that this song had another meaning for Ye Jian?","After a long time, Ye Jian sighed softly. \"The reason why I didn’t reject Xu Wen the last time was because I was dancing for a comrade who had been sacrificed.\"","Song Zhiqiu’s heart trembled. Even his eyes were filled with shock. She danced for a comrade who had been sacrificed?","Who?","Why didn’t he know?","No, how could he know?","There were many secrets about Ye Jian that they weren’t aware of and didn’t know about. From the fact that she would take leave from time to time for a few days every year and lose contact with her entire class of comrades during winter and summer vacations... they could tell that Ye Jian was doing other things.","A sacrificed comrade... ’Ye Jian, what did you do all the times you went missing?’","\"I’m sorry. I should’ve asked you.\" When he opened his mouth again, Song Zhiqiu’s voice was dry and tense. He knew that he had made a stupid decision.","It was equivalent to tearing open the scar in Ye Jian’s heart and making her face the past again.","Ye Jian smiled lightly. Her clear eyes seemed to be veiled with a faint gray color. \"It’s okay. I’ll dance. It’s okay...\"","Song Zhiqiu pursed his lips. He tried to persuade her again but to no avail.","On the other hand, a third-year senior from Xiangnan University who had sweet facial features and was wearing a strapless dress was one of the hosts of tonight’s event. She went through the list of programs. Then, she silently recited her lines for tonight and smiled at her partner. \"Which performance are you looking forward to?\"","The handsome male host, who was wearing a white shirt and a black suit, smiled and said, \"There’ll be a performance of the song Ambush from Ten Sides. The only female instructor will take the stage then.\"","\"Didn’t you say that she might not go on stage?\"","\"Just now, the production team told me that the female instructor has agreed. When the time comes, you must take a good look at the female instructor. I heard she’s very beautiful.\"","The male host was also a third-year student of Xiangnan University. He and the female host had been partners since their first year of university. They had good chemistry.","\"I’ve heard you say it countless times. Also, please don’t say that another girl is beautiful in front of me, okay? It’s very hurtful.\" The female host smiled and glared at her partner. She looked him up and down a few times, teasing, \"Do you want to woo the female instructor?\"","\"Hahaha, I can’t. She’s from the Southern Province like you. Wang Rui, the girls in the Southern Province are too difficult to woo!\"","Wang Rui was from the Southern Province and Ye Jian’s senior high classmate."]},{"number":4632,"title":"Chapter 4632: Handsome, Handsome","paragraphs":["At this moment, Wang Rui didn’t know that she was about to meet her old classmate. She only knew how popular the female instructor was. Even her partner, Jing Yi, yearned for her.","\"I must take a good look at how beautiful the female instructor is later. I want to see if she’s prettier than our school belle, Wang Rui. It’s rare that there are beauties in the military school. I suspect that the juniors have bad taste. Or perhaps it’s because she’s the only female instructor that they think she’s beautiful.","\"I have to confirm it with my own eyes.\" The male host, Jing Yi, raised his chin slightly in front of the mirror. He tidied his clothes and used a comb to gently comb his hair. Then, he tilted his head to the left and right. When he felt that there was nothing wrong with his appearance, he whistled narcissistically.","\"I’m so handsome!\"","He threw the comb on the dressing table and spread his arms. He turned to Wang Rui. \"How is it? Am I handsome? Can I attract a beautiful instructor?\"","Wang Rui was putting on eyeliner. When she heard this, she glanced at him from the corners of her eyes and nodded perfunctorily. \"Yeah, you’re handsome. You’re also a show-off. Unfortunately, Tian Tian isn’t around. Who are you looking good for?\"","At the mention of his girlfriend, Jing Yi didn’t mention the beautiful instructor anymore. He had no choice. His girlfriend was the jealous type, and he was in the same class as her. He didn’t want his girlfriend to give him the cold shoulder treatment for a few days.","There were still five minutes before seven o’clock. As the instructors blew their whistles, the lively sports ground instantly became silent. Wang Rui and Jing Yi held hands as they walked past the aisle that was specially reserved.","The students were so neatly organized that Wang Rui and Jing Yi, the two hosts, smiled.","The military training was very useful to the new students. Just like in the past, they gained a lot after going through it. The most obvious change was that... their applause became uniform.","After the opening speech, the event officially began. The 18 new students who were proficient in all kinds of martial arts walked onto the temporary stage and started their exciting performance. The audience below clapped hard to tell them how outstanding their performance was.","Jing Yi, who was the closest to Wang Rui, smiled and said, \"This year, there are many capable people. The new generation surpasses the old.\"","He was a little sad and depressed. Most of all, he was reluctant to part with the campus.","Four years in university passed in the blink of an eye. He clearly felt that he was still a new student, but in the blink of an eye, he had entered his fourth year and was about to enter society.","\"Are you sad now? Don’t cry in front of me. I don’t know how to comfort people,\" Wang Rui replied with a smile. She wasn’t as immature as when she was in senior high. She was slender and beautiful, as if she had undergone a transformation.","On the other hand, Ye Jian practiced the quartet no less than five times. She danced until she was drenched in sweat. Only then did she stop practicing.","Those who learned music might be more sentimental and emotional. When the last note was finished, the girl playing the pipa retracted her chords and slowly pulled her hand back. Tears fell from her eyes and landed on the strings.","The four students, including the two boys, were silent. They were silent because of... their instructor’s sword dance.","The girl playing the lute kept her head low. Her tears did not stop for a long time.","Ambush from Ten Sides was intense and shocking. It put the artistic conception of a difficult journey into the chords. It could easily move a listener’s emotions."]},{"number":4633,"title":"Chapter 4633: The Best Tribute","paragraphs":["\"This song will make those who hear it be excited at first, then they’ll start crying and weeping... They won’t be able to help themselves.\"","The girl spoke in a low voice.","Ye Jian retracted her sword. As she retracted her sword, she still appeared tragic. Blood had already stained the depths of her heart.","The corners of Song Zhiqiu’s eyes were red. He walked to Ye Jian’s side and reached out his hand. He slowly took the sword in Ye Jian’s hand and said softly, \"I finally understand...\"","That year, he was also present when Ye Jian was rehearsing. At that time, he was already shocked that Ye Jian, who had no dancing skills at all, could dance to such a level. Under the flashes of the blade, she perfectly portrayed the tragic and desolate scene of a hero at the end of his life. At that time, he only thought that Ye Jian was just performing.","Now, his opinion had completely changed.","She wasn’t putting on a show. It was a tribute!","She was paying tribute to her comrade who had sacrificed himself. She was paying tribute to her comrade who fought for their country. She was paying tribute to the heroes who used their flesh to resist the darkness and finally fell. These heroes remained unknown for the rest of their lives. Only a few people knew about them.","Ye Jian raised her head and gave Song Zhiqiu a forced smile. She opened her mouth to say something, but she felt her throat closing up. In the end, she pursed her lips.","Her emotions were fluctuating greatly now. That year, she suddenly received a call from Captain Xia. The bad news sent chills to her limbs and bones. She couldn’t accept the news of her comrade’s passing. In the end, she sent her comrade, J5, off with a song.","Now that she was in her fourth year, it meant that it had been two years since J5’s passing. It was still a pain in her heart that could not be touched.","After making some adjustments, Ye Jian looked up at the four students who were still looking at their instruments and said, \"It should be our turn soon. Let’s go.\"","\"Instructor...\" A choked voice was heard. The girl playing the pipa trembled and said, \"I want to wash my face first. I’m very sad and can’t control my tears.\"","The girl who raised her head was in tears. She cried because of the tragedy of the sword dance. She cried for the farewell of a hero who died on the battlefield.","She had played Ambush from Ten Sides countless times, but today... She cried today, and her heart tightened. Her emotions were driven by the dance, which became the perfect accompaniment.","Ye Jian didn’t expect to make others cry. In the past, Xu Wen was the same.","Looking at the other three students, the girl who was playing the zither was also secretly wiping the corners of her eyes. The two boys were also red in the eyes.","Seeing this, Ye Jian suddenly felt as if something had broken out of the ground and crawled into the depths of her soul.","Ye Jian looked at the students who were crying in a daze. Even her soul was in pain. She vaguely saw J5. He was wearing a tailored military uniform that showed the aura of a soldier. There was a faint smile in his bright eyes as he looked at her and the sad students...","Finally, Ye Jian’s soul trembled in pain. Suddenly, there was a light that drove away the darkness, took away the haze, and welcomed hope. At that second, she finally understood the true meaning of ’war’.","Soldiers were protecting these people... And now these people were crying for their heroes. It was worth it to die in battle!","’J5, my comrade, do you see this?","’You must have seen it.","’Look, although the people you protected don’t know about your existence, they’re crying because of you and thousands of people like you.’","Heroes wouldn’t be forgotten. The tears the civilians shed were the best tribute to heroes."]},{"number":4634,"title":"Chapter 4634: Glory","paragraphs":["\"Go ahead. Those who need to wash their faces, go ahead. Those who need to clean up, go on. We have to hurry, or we’ll be late.\"","Ye Jian smiled. The sorrowful and solemn atmosphere was instantly shattered when she smiled. The attentive Song Zhiqiu noticed that when Ye Jian mentioned leaving, she had waved goodbye. It was a small gesture. If one didn’t look carefully, one would think that she was just waving casually.","However, he was certain that she was indeed saying goodbye.","The smile on her face changed too. It was as bright as the moonlight that was gradually revealed in the night clouds. It was clear and bright, as if it was lighting up the darkness. It cast a light in the darkest corner that could allow people to avoid the darkness. It wasn’t bright, but it was enough to let people know that it was dark ahead and they needed to be careful.","Song Zhiqiu couldn’t see through Ye Jian’s emotions behind her smile. If Xia Jinyuan were here or any special forces soldier from the Xueyu unit were present, they would know.","On the sports ground, the host, Wang Rui, saw the name on the list that was a last-minute addition. She kept looking at it. Her eyes, which were even more beautiful with eyeliner, widened. Her eyes were filled with disbelief.","Ye Jian...","She actually saw the name ’Ye Jian’ on the performance list. It was a name that she interpreted as ’glorious’ when she was in senior high.","Was it really her?","Was it her senior high classmate, Ye Jian?","It had to be her!","The National Science University was the military school that Ye Jian was in!","In the past, she even tried to contact them and went to the National Science University several times. In the end, she lost to the administrators of the National Science University. Even though she was in the same city as Ye Jian, she never met her.","When the announcement was made, Wang Rui’s breathing was a little messy. Jing Yi immediately helped her and smiled. \"It looks like the beautiful instructor is extremely charming. Even the host beside me can’t wait to see the beautiful instructor’s exciting performance. Students, let’s welcome Instructor Ye and the four students with warm applause! Let’s welcome Instructor Ye!\"","Finally, Ye Jian, who was holding a longsword and wearing a camouflage uniform, went on stage. Beside her were four students who were holding musical instruments. When she walked to the middle, the applause became intense again. All kinds of cheers could be heard. Some students shouted, \"Instructor Ye, I love you!\"","Jing Yi was shocked by the enthusiasm of the 1,300 new students. \"Oh my god, she’s so popular! I’ve hosted two military training events, but this is the first time I’ve seen such a popular instructor. I think their voices will go hoarse from shouting!\"","The figure in the middle of the stage was straight and tall. She was like a pine tree in the forest or an orchid in an empty valley. She had the pride of a pine tree and the beauty of an orchid. Even if she stood still, she would be the center of attention.","It was the same as when she was in senior high. Nothing had changed.","Wang Rui, who was staring at the venue, didn’t hear what her partner said. She only knew that the Ye Jian who appeared was her senior high classmate. It had been three years since they last met. Ye Jian was even more beautiful and dazzling than before!","Wang Rui took out her phone from her makeup bag and sent a message to her senior high classmates at the fastest speed.","[I saw Ye Jian at Xiangnan University! She’s the most liked instructor among the freshmen. She’s performing with a sword now! We were classmates for three years in senior high. Who has seen Ye Jian’s performance? Well, I’m going to watch it now. Also, she’s prettier than before. She has a powerful temperament now. She’s beautiful and dashing!","[When she went on stage just now, all the juniors shouted at the top of their lungs, ’Ye Jian, I love you’! She’s as popular as when she was in senior high! Both men and women adore her!]"]},{"number":4635,"title":"Chapter 4635: Tears","paragraphs":["The long message had to be split into two. Then, Wang Rui sent a few more messages. All the senior high classmates with cell phones received Wang Rui’s messages.","The lute was played first. Ye Jian, who was holding her sword, started dancing to Ambush from Ten Sides. She was dancing for her comrade who had passed away. She was still sad about what happened.","Wang Rui’s phone kept beeping. Wang Rui replied to the three classmates who were the first to get back to her. [Ye Jian’s performance is starting. We’ll talk about it later.] Wang Rui then ignored the beeping.","She had already been completely enthralled by her old classmate’s sword dance.","Wang Rui wasn’t the only one. Jing Yi, the teachers from Xiangnan University, and more than 1,300 students were all attracted by the dancing figure.","The music became an accompanying performance. It was no longer the main highlight. The real highlight was the figure holding a sword and dancing in the middle of the stage. The tense atmosphere of being ready to fight surged forward with the cold light of the longsword. On the battlefield, soldiers were commanded, the war drums thundered, the bugles were blown, and the longswords were in the air. The two armies would fight until blood flowed like rivers...","There were many sword shadows and very strong killing intent. On the battlefield, the generals would join the army, and the soldiers would charge and guard their country!","Kill! Fight!","Blood would splatter everywhere as they roared.","\"Strive to move the mountains together with overwhelming energy. Though the times are unfavorable, the glory will not fade away...\"","Some people cried, others were stunned as their hearts trembled. Some placed their wrists by their mouths and gritted their teeth to suppress the tears in their eyes. Some closed their eyes and were so sad that they didn’t dare to watch anymore.","A long flute note suddenly sounded. The sound of the flute brought everyone’s emotions into another time and space. One second ago, they were watching a performance. The next second, they were fighting with guns. The music was sorrowful. Then, the dancer’s sword moved quickly. The students who were trying their best to suppress their sadness couldn’t help but burst into tears.","The sound of the pipa suddenly sounded. They had reached the end. The general died but had no regret. The sound of the musical instrument was tragic. It was expressing sorrow for the general and soldiers who died in battle.","The dancing figure in the venue seemed to have gradually lost her strength. She turned from anxious to desolate because... the general was dead and the people were crying...","The sound of the pipa gradually subsided, and the sound of a zither could be heard. It was the girl playing the melodious zither. It was no longer Ambush from Ten Sides but Spring, Flower, Autumn, and Moon. After the fierce battle, the world welcomed peace and prosperity.","When Ye Jian retracted her sword, the melodious sound of the zither slowly fell. The surroundings were silent. Only low sobs could be heard.","Wang Rui covered her mouth. Her tears had smudged her makeup.","Her partner, Jing Yi, had red eyes as well and was speechless for a long time. He even forgot that it was his turn to speak.","The sound of a cell phone message was heard. Jing Yi was so shocked that he rushed forward. He almost made a mistake!","Wang Rui followed closely behind and said, \"Ye Jian, my former senior high classmate. It’s been three years since we last met. You gave me a huge surprise! You made me cry back there. Shouldn’t you comfort me?\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Jing Yi immediately went along with her and said in surprise, \"So, you were too busy crying just now that you failed to tell me that Instructor Ye was your classmate in senior high?\"","Ye Jian adjusted her breathing and looked at her former classmate who was walking over. When she saw that her makeup was smudged from her tears, a faint smile appeared in Ye Jian’s eyes.","’J5, my comrade, the people you protected cried for you tonight.’ Ye Jian finally understood why he and thousands of heroes were willing to sacrifice themselves fearlessly.","It was because of these people. So, what was there to be afraid of?"]},{"number":4636,"title":"Chapter 4636: Old Friends","paragraphs":["When Wang Rui asked Ye Jian why she knew how to dance Ambush from Ten Sides, Ye Jian took a deep breath and replied, \"To honor the sacrificed heroes. I hope we can remember them. Even if we don’t know their names, I hope you know that a group of unknown heroes sacrificed their lives to protect this country.\"","The answer received the warmest applause again, and it made people cry even more.","They didn’t say much. There was still a show to continue. Wang Rui turned off the microphone and made plans with Ye Jian to meet up somewhere else before the next performance.","Jing Yi kept asking Wang Rui about why she didn’t tell him in advance. Wang Rui rolled her eyes at him a few times.","\"You didn’t tell me in advance. You’re not loyal at all. Now, you don’t want to bring me along. You’re too ruthless. Wang Rui, bring me along. I’ll just talk to your former classmate for a while. After that, I’ll leave immediately. I won’t disturb your meeting with your former classmate, okay?\"","\"Jing Yi, Tian Tian will be here the day after tomorrow. Do you dare to let her know about this?\" Wang Rui, who was in a hurry to leave, glared at her partner one last time before running away with her makeup bag.","She had an appointment with Ye Jian and couldn’t be bothered with him.","In the end, Jing Yi didn’t go to meet Ye Jian. He sighed and walked back to his dormitory. He sent a message to his roommates. [You didn’t come back to campus early. What a huge loss! A female instructor came for the freshmen’s military training. She’s a military school student, but she’s so beautiful that girls were shouting out their confessions to her. She’s really beautiful. She’s even more beautiful than the beauties we discussed last time. She’s dashing and beautiful. What a huge pity that you didn’t see her!]","The most popular topic among guys was beautiful girls, so they responded quickly.","One still needed to go to an internet cafe in the 2000s to go online. One had to rely on paid texts to communicate. Jing Yi finally found a sense of superiority when he saw how envious his roommates were.","At least he had seen her in person. He was much luckier than his roommates who never got to see Ye Jian!","Jing Yi and his roommates continued to chat about it. On the other hand, Wang Rui didn’t stop despite her phone constantly ringing with notifications.","Ye Jian, who was standing under the streetlamp, looked at her former classmate who was running over. Her eyes were curved.","She didn’t have any interactions with her former senior high classmates. She didn’t even know that Wang Rui was in Xiang City. If she hadn’t come to Xiangnan University to train the students, she wouldn’t have known that Wang Rui was in Xiang City.","In senior high, besides having a bad relationship with Yao Jing and Sun Ying, Ye Jian had a good relationship with her other classmates. It was the same with Wang Rui.","When the two of them met, they hugged passionately. Then, they laughed together. They were so happy that they couldn’t stop laughing.","\"Come, come, come. Take a look at their messages. I told them that you were performing. They’re surely envious. Look, a few classmates asked me to send over photos of your sword dance.\"","Wang Rui took out her phone. Before she could read the old messages, there were dozens of new messages that she hadn’t read. She started reading from the first message.","Ye Jian only knew that Wang Rui was in contact with 17 of their former senior high classmates when she saw the messages. She smiled and said, \"I nearly lost contact with all of our former senior high classmates.\"","After graduating from high school, she lost contact with her classmates. Now that she saw the familiar names again, those beautiful memories surged in her heart once more.","Although she had only spent three years in senior high, she had many beautiful memories during that time. She found out about Captain Xia’s feelings for her... when she was in senior high."]},{"number":4637,"title":"Chapter 4637: Topics","paragraphs":["Wang Rui, who was flipping through the messages, pursed her lips and smiled. \"Every summer and winter vacation, you never returned to the Southern Province. You never logged into your email either. We would have gatherings every time and would send you an email in advance. But you’re so heartless. You didn’t even participate once.","\"However, we all know that you must be busy. If not, you would definitely have joined us. That’s why we don’t blame you. We always thought that we’d have a chance to meet.","\"Look at this. It’s from the class monitor. Look at how envious he is... He said that the next time we meet, he has to watch you perform.\"","As Wang Rui spoke, she suddenly lowered her voice. \"Let’s change the performance. Your performance makes people cry easily. You dance so well that you make people want to cry. When I asked you about it, you only replied that it was a tribute to the sacrificed heroes. But why do I feel that... it happened to you?\"","In the past, she felt that the word ’sacrifice’ was very far away from her. However, today, Ye Jian suddenly said that she wanted to ’remember the sacrificed heroes’. It made her feel that such sacrifices weren’t far away. It was just that she didn’t know about them.","Ye Jian looked at the messages sent by her former classmates. The corners of her lips curled up slightly as she said softly, \"Yes, it happened to someone close to me, so my emotions were fluctuating a lot. Huh, Meng Wen is in Xiang City too? Do you see her often?\"","Wang Rui’s lips trembled slightly. She wanted to ask Ye Jian if she was in danger, but she didn’t have the courage to ask it.","Seeing that Ye Jian didn’t want to say too much either, Wang Rui retracted her gaze and looked away cooperatively. \"Yes, we used to see each other often on weekends. We saw each other the most during our first year. In her second year, she got a boyfriend. Alas, she immediately forgot about her friends after getting into a relationship. It’s already good enough that we can see each other every month.","\"A few days ago, she told me that she would bring her boyfriend back home during National Day to meet her parents. I advised her not to be anxious. It’ll be better for her to let her parents meet him after she graduates and her career is stable. I wonder if she’ll heed my advice.\"","It wasn’t strange for a girl to have a boyfriend when she was already in university. Ye Jian smiled and said, \"If you have the intention to persuade her, she’ll definitely take your words to heart. As for whether she’ll have her parents meet her boyfriend now or later, you don’t have to worry too much about it.","\"I’ll memorize her cell phone number. If I’m able to come out of school, I’ll call the two of you to see if we can meet up. Besides you and Meng Wen, are there any other classmates in Xiang City?\"","\"That’s all of us. There are others in the coastal cities, but they’re already working now. We don’t have many common topics to talk about online. The ones I’m in contact with are all still studying.\"","As she spoke, Wang Rui sounded a little sad. \"If friends go for a long time without seeing each other, there’ll be fewer and fewer topics to talk about. It’s not like how it was in senior high anymore.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly. That was true. As time passed, the friendship between former classmates would fade. When they met again, they would feel a sense of unfamiliarity.","After the two of them finished reading all the messages, Ye Jian borrowed Wang Rui’s cell phone and replied to her former classmates one by one. She kept replying until... Wang Rui received a notification that she owed money for her phone bill!","It was impressive to send so many text messages that a bill was sent over!","Fortunately, the convenience store on campus was still operating. Ye Jian ran over while Wang Rui chased after her. Ye Jian then paid the bill for her. Wang Rui didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"You’re still the same as before. You don’t want to take advantage of others at all! The bill is probably 30 yuan at most, but you topped up a hundred yuan directly!\"","Ye Jian smiled and replied, \"Because I earn a salary!\""]},{"number":4638,"title":"Chapter 4638: Sigh","paragraphs":["Sure enough, Wang Rui lost. \"So what if you earn a salary? Are you looking down on me because I don’t earn a salary?\"","The two of them laughed. The unfamiliar feeling due to a long separation gradually disappeared, and more and more topics were being discussed.","\"The biggest difference in the military school is the military management. There’s also the lessons. Our physical fitness is more important. Not much emphasis is placed on cultural studies, but scientific research is still very important. Studying and physical fitness are two different things. If we fail any subjects, we’ll have to work hard to make up for it.","\"We can’t go out to play casually either. We can’t go out during the holidays as well. We have to have a release notice. That’s why we don’t expect to get leave during holidays. Even if we have a holiday, we’d be requisitioned. It’s hard to take a holiday during National Day and May 1st. We’ll still exercise and perhaps rest for a day at most.","\"Communication is very inconvenient. Once you enter the school, you’ll be isolated from the world. All communication devices will be handed over. If you don’t, you’ll be caught. The punishment is strict, so no one will dare to break the rules.","\"I’m eating well. The food is not bad. It’s enough to keep me full. As for the clothes...\" Ye Jian patted the camouflage uniform on her body. \"I wear the military uniform all year round. I don’t have many chances to wear casual clothes, so that saves me time from shopping.","\"It’s the same as the military unit. There’s no difference. How the military unit is managed is how the military school is managed. It’s very strict, but after getting used to it, it’s fine.\"","Ye Jian was talking about the differences between military schools and universities. Wang Rui exclaimed when she heard the reply. \"No, no. If it were us, we’d want to escape after three days at most.","\"No holiday, only training! And I have to hand in my communication device too? Although you have a salary, these rules and regulations are enough to make me give up! Fortunately, I didn’t register for the military school. If not, I would’ve gone crazy.\"","Just listening to it made her panic. The military school students weren’t allowed to do so many things. They would be randomly inspected. If they didn’t button their clothes properly, they would be criticized. If they didn’t wear their caps properly or didn’t bring their identification documents with them...","\"You have to be disciplined about food, accommodation, and clothes...\" Wang Rui summarized with her fingers. In the end, she glared at Ye Jian in horror. \"Ye Jian, is there any aspect that’s lax?\"","Her overly shocked expression made Ye Jian laugh softly. Ye Jian thought about it carefully and shook her head. She said seriously, \"I don’t think so. Everything is strictly enforced.\"","\"That’s crazy! How did you survive three years in military school? You’re still so energetic too. It’s unbelievable! I finally understand why when the teachers knew that you were going to apply for military school, they all persuaded you to reconsider it. It’s so impressive that you were able to survive such strict management.\"","If it were her, she might not even be able to last a day in the school, let alone three days.","The rules and restrictions that Wang Rui was shocked by were nothing to Ye Jian. Without rules, nothing could be done. If the military unit didn’t have rules, how could they protect the country?","Time passed quickly as Wang Rui exclaimed from time to time. They chatted until 11:30 pm before Wang Rui left reluctantly.","The next day, there was still military training. Ye Jian needed to rest early. If not, Wang Rui would definitely drag Ye Jian to her dormitory and chat until dawn.","Tonight was destined to be another night of private conversations. Many students were talking about Instructor Ye’s sword dance to Ambush from Ten Sides. Some felt that Instructor Ye danced very well, while others felt that she couldn’t be compared to a professional. However, they all felt the tragic sorrow of the dance.","The night was dark, and the commotion was over. Only the lamps were quietly shining."]},{"number":4639,"title":"Chapter 4639: Blades And Shadows","paragraphs":["The girls in Room 405 had already fallen asleep. Ye Jian, who was lying on the bed quietly, closed her eyes. She fell asleep too.","In the dark, Huang Yawen opened her eyes. As she held her breath, she turned over very gently. Her gaze landed on the upper left corner opposite her.","After a long time, Huang Yawen retracted her gaze.","The host named Wang Rui was the instructor’s former senior high classmate. A third-year senior... It should be easy to find her. After sending off the instructor, she planned to look for Wang Rui and see if she could understand how Instructor Ye got into the military school.","In the dark, Huang Yawen pursed her lips. She could join the military if she got rid of her bad habits...","Before she went to university, she didn’t think that she had any bad habits. She even thought that other people had many bad habits. But now... she gradually realized that she had many bad habits.","For instance... she randomly rummaged through the instructor’s luggage. In the past, she thought that she was just taking a look. It was not a big deal if she didn’t steal or snatch anything. Now, she realized that what she thought was a small matter didn’t even meet the most basic code of conduct.","There were many things she needed to change, but there was finally a reference for her to follow.","Instructor Ye was the reference for her to correct her bad habits!","Huang Yawen, who was thinking about all kinds of things, yawned. Only then did she fall asleep.","At 6:30 am the next day, dozens of buses drove into the campus one by one. The 1,000-odd students from the north campus started their square exercise while the 1,300-odd students from the main campus started their normal military training. This was their last day of military training. They were more serious and hardworking than ever. Even their voices were louder.","At 8:00 am, the instructors in charge of the military training met the instructors of the north campus. There were more than 1,000 students in the north campus and 60 instructors in total. There were more than 1,300 students in the main campus and 36 instructors in total. There were a total of 96 instructors from Xiangnan University. When the two sides met, the scene was quite spectacular.","The instructors of the military training at the north campus came from the local armed forces. They were armed police soldiers sent by the armed police unit. They were from a different military school from the National Science University. When the two parties met, even though they were smiling and saluting, there was a faint glint in their eyes.","Even the chief instructors on both sides could feel the tension in the air when they saluted and shook hands.","When the instructors met, they mainly discussed how the competition would go. When the other party saw that there was a female instructor, the chief instructor of the north campus teased, \"The female student is in charge of enjoying the shade. We shouldn’t let her get hurt during the competition.\"","In return, the chief instructor of the main campus smiled. \"Our students are looking forward to working with the armed police. Everyone will participate. As for our female instructor, you should send an armed police officer who can take a beating.","\"I’m worried that our female instructor might accidentally injure the armed police.\"","As they chatted and laughed, their swords were already unsheathed.","The chief instructor of the north campus had a smile on his face, but he was sneering in his heart. In that case, there was no need to be polite.","After the meeting ended, they shook hands politely again. Then, they went back to their respective campsites. They would wait and see.","The inspection started at 8:30 am in the morning. When the flag bearer waved the flag and passed the reviewing platform, the first team was officially inspected.","The ten days of military training allowed the new students to grow up. When they walked past the reviewing platform, their footsteps were neat and their expressions were serious. The school leaders and teachers on the reviewing platform kept nodding."]},{"number":4640,"title":"Chapter 4640: Don’t Be An Embarrassment","paragraphs":["The students trained by the military school... were actually so good! They even had the aura of soldiers.","\"Do you hear their voices? If you don’t want to be outshone by them, you have to shout louder and walk more imposingly than them!\"","\"You were the ones who jointly applied to come to the main campus for a review. Now that you’re here, don’t embarrass yourself!\"","\"They were trained by military school students. You guys were trained by veterans. Don’t embarrass me and don’t embarrass yourselves. Do you hear me?\"","Sensing the results of the inspection by the students of the military school, the instructors from the north campus started to remind their students again and again. They really didn’t expect the students to be so good!","One had to know that these veterans of the military unit had never thought much of the military school students. Now that they suddenly realized that the new students who were trained by the military school students were actually so orderly and had the aura of soldiers, they naturally had to be careful.","The students from the north campus were also trying their best. They definitely couldn’t embarrass themselves!","The students from the main campus had the same mentality. All the students from the north campus came here for their inspection. How could they embarrass the main campus? They had to be upright and domineering. They had to fight for their dignity!","This caused the students to hold their breaths. They exerted all their strength and displayed the results of the ten days of military training.","The students and instructors from the north campus were fully armed and ready for battle. The students from the main campus walked past the reviewing platform one by one and received applause.","Wang Haibo, Ye Jian’s student, was so nervous that he kept muttering, \"Left, right, left, left, left, right, left.\" The students around him were nervous too.","The boy on his left, the squad leader chosen by Ye Jian, Meng Meng, reminded him softly, \"Stop reciting. The instructor has fixed your problem. If you continue reciting, you might go back to being on the same foot and arm as before. Just do what you usually do during training. Relax, it’s fine!\"","How could Wang Haibo not be nervous?","He was the only one in the entire class who had to be called aside by the instructor every day for extra training. His resting time had to be cut short. Now that he had finally adjusted, he was afraid that his nervousness would make him go back to square one.","\"Relax, relax. You usually perform well.\"","A voice that was clearer than the other students sounded. Wang Haibo hurriedly raised his head and looked over. Their instructor walked over and smiled lightly. She encouraged him, \"You usually do quite well. There’s no need to pay special attention.\"","The squad leaders that Ye Jian brought were still waiting. To prevent any of her students from feeling nervous, Ye Jian walked back and forth. When she realized that some of her students were nervous, she comforted them immediately.","Wang Haibo wasn’t the only one who was nervous. Even Huang Yawen was nervous.","\"Take a deep breath and clench your fists before slowly unclenching them. Try doing it five times.\"","Wang Haibo finished listening. Facing the instructor’s smile, Wang Haibo didn’t feel so nervous anymore. He pursed his lips and whispered shyly, \"Instructor, thank you. I’m not so nervous anymore.\"","The host announced that it was their class’ turn to appear. Ye Jian smiled at Wang Haibo and returned to the front of the team.","On the stage, Regimental Commander Pang from the armed forces department smiled at Commissar Yue from the military school. \"I just heard from my instructors that you sent a female student over. Old Yue, it looks like this female student is very outstanding.\""]},{"number":4641,"title":"Chapter 4641: Protective","paragraphs":["This was the first time the National Science University sent a female student out of school for training. Regimental Commander Pang from the armed forces department naturally wanted to ask about it. The veterans from the armed forces department kindly suggested to the other party that the female soldier did not have to participate in the martial arts competition. However, they were refuted.","They wanted to see just how powerful the female student from the National Science University was.","The leaders in the military unit had a common problem. They all thought that their soldiers were very impressive. Even if they felt that they were ordinary, they thought that their soldiers would definitely impress outsiders. They were all experts at protecting their own people.","Regimental Commander Pang of the armed forces was no exception.","It was the same for Political Commissar Yue of the National Science University.","Hearing this, Commissar Yue, who had always been outstanding in political thinking, smiled calmly and said, \"She’s very outstanding. You’ll be able to see her skills later.\"","\"Sure, I’ll be waiting.\"","Regimental Commander Pang raised his eyebrows. There was a hint of contempt in his tone.","It was no wonder that Regimental Commander Pang looked down on the military school students. The veterans were thrown in the mud and trained in the wind every day. On the other hand, the military school students had to take lessons. Their training time was naturally shorter. It was normal that their physical fitness was not as good as the veterans.","Commissar Yue knew the difference between the two, but so what? Other than having good stamina, did soldiers and officers not require education? Did they not need knowledge when leading troops to war?","In any case, both sides felt that they had a point. Both sides felt that their soldiers were very powerful. Hence, every time they met, tension would always be high.","Commissar Yue was very unhappy with Regimental Commander Pang’s indifferent reply. He wanted to argue further, but he thought that it was better to rely on strength to retaliate rather than waste his breath. Hence, he endured it.","If he let his students use their ability to retaliate, he would be able to admire the change in Regimental Commander Pang’s expression. It would definitely be exciting.","Thinking about the martial arts competition that would be held in an hour or so, Commissar Yue smiled. The bright white sun shone on Commissar Yue’s teeth.","Regimental Commander Pang saw this and couldn’t help but frown.","Old Yue might be a political commissar, but he was as ruthless as a martial arts practitioner. He was sly and scheming. He was good at hitting the weak spot. Even his old partner, Old Zhang, who had worked with him once before, had to admit defeat when faced with Commissar Yue.","This ruthless and scheming fellow was actually holding back today.","Could it be...","Regimental Commander Pang gripped the red tablecloth. Could it be that the female student really had some ability?","Wasn’t she just a beautiful girl?","Regimental Commander Pang rubbed his thumb lightly. He felt that he needed to remind the instructors sent by the armed forces.","Commissar Yue saw this without batting an eyelid. The corners of his lips twitched. His expression made Regimental Commander Pang feel even more alarmed. The female soldier was probably capable!","Ye Jian’s class had reached the reviewing platform. As the host announced the results, the 43 students started to be inspected in unison. Ye Jian narrowed her eyes and adjusted her breathing.","\"Assemble, let’s go!","\"One, two, three, four!\"","As the commands were shouted, the 43 students straightened their backs and started their inspection.","\"March, go!\"","Thud!","The most rhythmic march began. It was so orderly that the leaders of the reviewing platform clapped hard.","\"Not bad, not bad. This batch of students are not bad.\"","\"Their steps are neat, their voices are loud, and they’re very energetic.\"","\"This batch of students are not any worse than the students trained by the male instructors. Not bad.\""]},{"number":4642,"title":"Chapter 4642: Come, Fight","paragraphs":["The leaders on the reviewing platform applauded and communicated in low voices. Commissar Yue wanted to be humble, but when he thought of Regimental Commander Pang from the armed forces department beside him, he felt that there was no need to be humble.","He smiled and said, \"Little Ye is the most outstanding student in our school. She might be a lady, but her comprehensive qualities are better than many male students. This is also her first training outside the school. I heard that the feedback from her class is not bad. The students admire her very much.\"","\"She’s not bad. From the students, we can tell that she’s good.\"","\"It’s very important that the students trust her. Some instructors and students can’t get along at all.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. Instructors with bad tempers don’t have the patience.\"","...","The muttering low voices made Regimental Commander Pang secretly glare at Commissar Yue a few times. In return, Commissar Yue smiled. Regimental Commander Pang pursed his lips. He regretted letting his political commissar go on a business trip!","If he knew this would happen, he would have brought Old Zhang over!","It was most appropriate to leave the task of fighting for the upper hand to Old Zhang. He was a rough man, but he really couldn’t compete with Old Yue!","Regimental Commander Pang gritted his teeth secretly. He regretted not bringing the political commissar from his regiment along.","Commissar Yue, who had won a round, picked up a bottle of mineral water that was hot from the sun. He unscrewed the cap and took two gulps. No matter how hot the sun was, he felt good.","It would definitely take some time for more than 4,000 students to finish marching. From 8:30 am to 11:30 am, the students from the north campus and the main campus did their marches. At this moment, the sun was already so hot that it made people dizzy. The surface of the ground was steaming, causing everyone to be drenched in sweat.","After the students left, it was the instructors’ turn to fight. The 96 instructors stood at the empty square venue below the reviewing platform. The students were feeling so hot that their eyes turned red. They instantly perked up and widened their eyes, looking forward to the show.","The 96 instructors formed their teams. With a loud shout, the 72 instructors quickly stepped out. The other 24 instructors stood in line, leaving the venue to the instructors of the competition.","Although it was called a martial arts competition, it was actually bare-handed combat. It wasn’t an all-rounded martial arts competition in the military unit.","Hand-to-hand combat was a battle between two instructors. Advanced practice? No way!","Showing mercy? Impossible!","That was impossible. They were going to fight for real!","\"I’m a little nervous. Do you think our instructor will lose?\"","\"I don’t know. He won’t lose, right?\"","\"Is it a real fight? Or a fake fight? It shouldn’t be a real fight, right? If the other party loses, won’t it be very embarrassing?\"","\"I don’t care if they’re really fighting or not. Just watch.\"","\"That female instructor is participating too. Is that okay?\"","The 4,000 students started discussing in detail. Their voices weren’t loud, but they were like buzzing bees. All of them hoped that their instructor would win and cheered for them.","Someone suddenly shouted, \"Instructor, all the best!\" In an instant, the entire audience was filled with the same shouts and cheers.","The competition between the instructors had yet to start, but the venue was already very lively. The cheers made the instructors purse their lips and laugh.","On the reviewing platform, Regimental Commander Pang leaned forward slightly and smiled at Commissar Yue. \"Old Yue, if you lose, don’t criticize them when you go back. After all, they’re just a bunch of students. They can’t be compared to the veterans under me.","\"When they graduate and train with the veterans in the military unit for a year or two, it’ll be about time.\""]},{"number":4643,"title":"Chapter 4643: Perfect Fight","paragraphs":["\"Regimental Commander Pang, you should sit down and take a good look. Don’t be too agitated later. Come, drink some water first.\" Political Commissar Yue pushed the mineral water bottle over and smiled. \"The sun is too hot, and people get angry easily in this weather. You have to calm down.\"","After unscrewing the cap, Regimental Commander Pang drank half a bottle in one go and sighed in satisfaction. As the instructors shouted in unison, Regimental Commander Pang focused all his attention on his soldiers.","’If these bastards can’t even defeat the military school students today... Heh, I’llprepare to skin them when they go back!’","In the arena, the armed police instructor clenched his fists and bent his legs slightly. He stared at the military school student who would be fighting with him.","The armed police instructor, who was fighting with Ye Jian, moved his neck slightly. The muscles on his arm were revealed. One look and you could tell that he was very powerful. He raised his eyebrows at Ye Jian, expressing his interest.","Ye Jian smiled, indicating that she was interested too.","Both sides provoked each other. No one was willing to fall behind.","At this moment, no one would admit defeat easily. They wanted to compete.","Ye Jian was no exception. She just wanted to win beautifully!","As the whistle sounded, a loud shout was heard. The unarmed combat officially started!","\"Instructor, come on! Instructor, come on!\"","\"Instructor Song, all the best! All the best!\"","\"Instructor Ye, all the best! You’re the best, and you’re the most beautiful!\"","\"Let’s go! Let’s go!\"","The two instructors fought. They hacked, slashed, kicked, fell, and hugged... Everything was done. The students exclaimed when they saw this.","\"Tao Yi, Tao Yi, can our instructor win? The armed police officer who’s fighting with her is twice as big as Instructor Ye!\" A guy was extremely nervous. He pulled Tao Yi and asked, \"If his punch lands, Instructor Ye will probably be sent flying!\"","\"Don’t talk nonsense! Instructor Ye is very powerful!\"","Before Tao Yi could reply, Huang Yawen opened her mouth to defend Ye Jian, \"Do you think that she can’t fight just because she’s skinny? Tao Yi looks stronger than Instructor Ye too, right? Didn’t he lose all the same?\"","Tao Yi’s heart skipped a beat. He said to the guy, \"She’s right. In hand-to-hand combat, strength alone isn’t enough. You need to be agile. Besides, Instructor Ye’s strength...\"","Thinking back to the sparring session on the first day of military training, Tao Yi could still feel the pain in his leg when Ye Jian kicked him.","Pursing his lips, Tao Yi continued in a low voice, \"Instructor Ye is not weak. She’s quite strong. We don’t even know if the other instructor can win.\"","\"The winner and loser won’t be determined so quickly. Let them warm up and test each other first. Then, we can see who’s doing better.\"","Those who knew the ropes could naturally see the twists and turns. They weren’t like other classmates who only cared about who got hit.","Seeing that Tao Yi didn’t say anything else, Huang Yawen turned her head and looked at him seriously.","During the ten days of military training, even Ye Jian didn’t expect Huang Yawen, who provoked her first, to become the girl with the best military training performance. She was able to climb and stand still. Even her shooting results yesterday were not bad. Ye Jian was shocked.","Huang Yawen made a good soldier!","If she got rid of her bad habits, she could take a leave of absence from school and apply for enlistment. If her performance in the military unit was good, she could continue to stay.","Meanwhile, the two instructors’ had basically finished probing each other. They both reached a conclusion in their hearts. It was time for them to compete for real.","A cold look appeared in Ye Jian’s eyes. She suddenly grabbed the arm of the instructor with one hand. She stretched out her right leg and tilted it. Her entire action was fast and fierce. She didn’t give the instructor any chance to resist. After she turned her right leg, she tilted her upper body too. As she shouted, she threw the instructor... over her shoulder perfectly!"]},{"number":4644,"title":"Chapter 4644: One Word","paragraphs":["\"Good job!\"","Commissar Yue shouted and was the first to clap.","As he clapped, the leaders and teachers of the school, who were dizzy from the sun, started clapping too. The loudest applause belonged to the instructors sent by the National Science University.","Regimental Commander Pang had to clap. Even if his canine teeth almost broke, he had to clap too!","Clap... Clap... Clap...","He arched his wrists and pulled his palms away. Clap! His fake smile made people panic.","How could Commissar Yue let go of such an opportunity? He could tell that Regimental Commander Pang was gritting his teeth and enduring the bitterness he felt. He leaned closer and smiled. \"Regimental Commander Pang, thanks for letting me win.\"","\"No wonder you sent a female student over. Not bad, she does have some skills!\" Although they were the ones who lost, Regimental Commander Pang had to admit that the attack of the female student from the National Science University just now was quite good.","It was a direct attack. There was no need to put on airs. She just started fighting directly. He had to admit that although she was a female student, her ability was not to be underestimated!","The smile on Commissar Yue’s face deepened.","The students watching were already clapping excitedly.","\"Gosh! Our instructor is amazing! Impressive! Too impressive! She can actually throw such a tall instructor over her shoulder! Too impressive!\"","\"I’m so excited to see more. Instructor Ye is the first person to knock the opponent down! She’s the first!\"","\"Tao Yi, did our instructor show you mercy that night? She didn’t throw you like this, right?\"","Tao Yi was resigned to being brought up again. He couldn’t go around this topic.","\"I didn’t fall like this the previous time. She did show mercy. Take a good look. He won’t just fall once. There’ll be two more times.\" Tao Yi didn’t want to become the topic of conversation, so he quickly changed the topic. It was fine if his classmates kept mentioning him if he won, but he had lost. If he kept being mentioned... it would be embarrassing.","Ye Jian’s classmates were so excited that their eyes were shining. If it weren’t for maintaining order, they would be roaring and cheering.","No matter how excited they were, the 4,000-odd students stood in their own square formation. There was no chaos.","This was also one of the results of the military training. The students now showed good discipline.","The instructor, who was stunned by Ye Jian’s throw, laid on the hot ground for at least five seconds before he reacted. He thought, \"Damn it, I was actually knocked down by a female soldier!\"","No, she wasn’t a female soldier. She was a female student from the military school!","He was knocked down just like that!","The instructor, who was full of confidence just now, got up. A vicious look flashed across his face as he attacked again.","Without rehearsing, there wouldn’t be a situation where the moves of both parties would be the same. Hence, the entire scene would be a little messy, but it would definitely be several times more exciting than if the moves were choreographed in advance.","The students who were sent out to train this time were all outstanding students in all aspects, especially in terms of physical fitness. All of them were tough characters. Commissar Yue drank his water silently and was extremely glad that he had made a wise decision.","He was the one who arranged for the students to come to Xiangnan University to train. What he said to the vice-principal was, \"We have to make good arrangements for this. The north campus will be trained by the military police soldiers sent by the local armed forces. This is the first time we’ve established a military training partnership with Xiangnan University. They’ll definitely make a comparison between the two groups of instructors. We can’t lose. The students sent to Xiangnan University this time must have strong stamina!\""]},{"number":4645,"title":"Chapter 4645: Three Wins","paragraphs":["It was because of his suggestion that the 36 outstanding students came to Xiangnan University to train the new students.","Even though they were facing the armed police now, they didn’t have to worry about losing.","The smile on Regimental Commander Pang’s face had already disappeared slightly. He really didn’t expect the students sent by the National Science University to be so powerful. They were so powerful that even a female student... Damn it! She knocked down his soldier again!","\"Get the f*ck up!\"","The smile on Regimental Commander Pang’s face disappeared completely. He clenched his fists so tightly that his knuckles cracked.","The instructor was pressed down by Ye Jian on the back of his neck. One of his hands was clasped behind his back and his waist was pressed tightly... He couldn’t accept it. He was knocked down again!","This time, it was even worse. He was restrained by the female student and couldn’t move!","As he struggled, the instructor’s tanned face turned red. Large drops of sweat flowed down his cheeks. He made a low sound like a trapped beast.","\"Don’t mess around, buddy. I’ll have to trouble you to stay still for ten seconds. After ten seconds, I’ll let go immediately,\" Ye Jian reminded him kindly. \"There’s only three seconds left.\"","This kind of reminder... would only make people vomit blood!","There was no way to rule out the possibility that it was intentional.","However, it was what it was.","Song Zhiqiu also successfully threw an armed police instructor to the ground. Then, he wrapped his legs tightly so that the other party couldn’t move his lower body at all. He clasped the other party’s hands behind his back, and the two of them fell to the ground. Ten seconds passed.","Not all the instructors were like this. Some military school students were knocked down by the armed police instructors and couldn’t move.","The more than 4,000 students kept clapping when they saw the real unarmed combat. They were so excited that they felt like they were fighting on the field. All their attention was attracted by the instructors’ combat.","Regimental Commander Pang, who thought that his side would win overwhelmingly, had a tense expression on his face. Even the air around him was much colder. He pursed his lips and sat there expressionlessly. It was obvious that he was furious.","Commissar Yue smiled. He couldn’t look away from Old Pang.","However, it was understandable. It would be strange if Regimental Commander Pang could feel at ease when the difference between the two groups suddenly made itself clear.","When Ye Jian knocked down the armed police instructor for the third time, she kicked sideways and tripped the other party. Then, she pressed her elbow on the other party’s neck. Huang Yawen had already clapped so hard until her palms were red. She used so much force that Tao Yi, who was sitting behind her, was worried that her palms would swell.","\"Gosh! Instructor Ye is really amazing. She’s so cool! Three times. She knocked down the instructor over there three times!\"","\"I really couldn’t tell that she was so skilled! She’s definitely the best at fighting!\"","\"I was almost scared to death. Instructor Ye has the other person in a death lock! Will she really kill the other instructor?\"","\"This is the first time I’ve realized that a girl can fight so well. She looks like she’s been possessed by Bruce Lee!\"","\"She’s beautiful and good at fighting. I’m a little worried that Instructor Ye won’t be able to get married.\"","\"Shoo, shoo, shoo. Many people want to marry our instructor!\"","With the one hand-to-hand combat, Ye Jian had completely won over all her students, regardless of gender.","The 15-minute competition ended very quickly. The students wanted to see it again but unfortunately, it was only 15 minutes.","After the two instructors ended their hand-to-hand combat and shook hands politely, they were no longer as fierce as before. They could even smile at each other.","The armed police officer, who was shaking hands with Ye Jian, was about to cry. He whispered, \"Instructor Ye, do you know what will happen to me? I’ll be miserable!\"","Why was he so unlucky to be knocked down three times by a female student from the military school?"]},{"number":4646,"title":"Chapter 4646: Praise Her For Her Toughness","paragraphs":["The bulky armed police instructor silently looked at the muscles on his arm and cried silently in his heart.","Previously, Regimental Commander Pang sought him out and said that he wanted him to fight Ye Jian, the only female instructor. If he had known... he would have rejected the regimental commander!","After shaking hands, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"I’m sorry. I feel that I have to give my opinion to the higher-ups when I go back. It’s better to fight with the same moves. We shouldn’t fight on the spot.\"","Later on, every time the instructors fought, they would rehearse in advance and unify their moves. They would also determine which instructor would be knocked down in the end.","After the competition between the instructors ended, it was the last segment of the military training. The representatives of the new students gave a speech. The north campus and the main campus each sent a student.","The student representative came from Song Zhiqiu’s class. A tall and handsome guy went up the stage. Ye Jian could clearly hear the gasps of the girls from her class.","The handsome boy’s skin was still fair after ten days of military training. To many girls, it was probably love at first sight.","Ye Jian looked at the girl in front of her in amusement. She coughed lightly, indicating that the girl should be more reserved and mind her actions.","At this point, the girls only cared about faces. Whoever was handsome was number one in their hearts. Even when they were resting and chatting, they would often talk about who was handsome.","As for Song Zhiqiu, who was good-looking and had the aura of a scholar, he became the instructor that the girls discussed the most in private. From time to time, they would walk past Song Zhiqiu to attract his attention.","In private, Song Zhiqiu had already protested to Ye Jian. He hoped that she could stop the girls from being enthusiastic because... he would feel uncomfortable every time the girls stared at him.","Although he was a guy, he was shy too!","Among the instructors, Song Zhiqiu was definitely the most handsome one. The chief instructor teased him, \"It’s just a small sacrifice. Don’t be so petty. If they want to see you, let them. You won’t suffer just from that.\"","The other male students laughed out loud. It couldn’t be helped. Song Zhiqiu was handsome.","The handsome boy on the stage did not have to refer to the script the entire time. He spoke Mandarin fluently without any accent, and his clear voice was quite pleasant to the ear. Just by listening to his voice, one would think that he was a handsome boy with substance.","Love at first sight?","Ye Jian nodded slightly and smiled.","This was the kind of gentle and handsome boy that young girls liked.","\"The instructor I admire the most in this military training isn’t Instructor Song from our class. I’m sorry, but I still have to praise Instructor Ye...\"","Below the stage, the students were already laughing softly. Even the leaders on the reviewing platform were laughing.","Ye Jian raised her hand to cover her forehead. Praise her? Was she being praised for being tough?","All the boys in the class said that she was tough. Some students even teased her... Would she give in to her future husband if they fought?","Song Zhiqiu was also amused by the new student representative. This kid was naughty.","The boy complimented Ye Jian. On the stage, Regimental Commander Pang went to Commissar Yue’s side and asked curiously, \"What’s the background of Little Ye? Is she from a soldier family?\"","The cheers for her were so loud that even students from other classes and other instructors were also praising her. She was very popular!","Commissar Yue knew about Ye Jian’s family situation. Of course, the only thing he knew was that Ye Jian’s mother was a martyr. He sighed slightly and replied to Regimental Commander Pang, \"I guess you can say that. Her parents died and her mother was a martyr. She inherited her mother’s legacy.\""]},{"number":4647,"title":"Chapter 4647: Rare","paragraphs":["At the mention of Ye Jian’s family, Commissar Yue’s eyes were filled with pity. She lost her parents when she was young. It was not easy for such a child to grow up. It was even more difficult for Ye Jian to be so talented.","\"Her parents are gone?\" Regimental Commander Pang was a little surprised. He paused for a moment and sighed. \"Her parents are both dead but she’s still able to become a talent. This shows that she’s outstanding.\"","\"Yes, she’s very disciplined. She manages herself very well. No one else dares claim to have better discipline than her. She’s an outstanding female student. Hence, Old Pang, it’s not unjust for your soldiers to lose to her. Even the military school’s own instructors don’t dare to casually fight with her since she was in her second year.\"","\"Is she that powerful?! When are you free to come to the armed forces to give my soldiers pointers?\"","Regimental Commander Pang’s interest was piqued. There was a scheming look in his eyes. Commissar Yue immediately became vigilant and rejected him. \"The fourth-year students don’t have much time to go out. Also, aren’t you embarrassed to seek her guidance? She’s just a military school student.\"","Speaking of embarrassment... Regimental Commander Pang coughed a few times and suppressed his thoughts.","After the new student representative finished speaking on stage, the host announced the end. The music sounded, and the ten-day military training for the new students ended.","The buses had already stopped in the inner courtyard of the campus, waiting for the new students and instructors to get on.","When it was time to part, Ye Jian was completely surrounded by the students. Some girls even cried. The boys were reluctant and wanted to get Ye Jian’s contact method.","At the same time, Ye Jian received a message book. There were 43 students’ messages and their contact methods. They hoped that she could contact them in the future.","Ye Jian kept the beautifully-done message book. As for the contact methods, according to the rules, even after the military training ended, the instructors were not allowed to keep in touch with the students.","Looking at the reluctant faces in front of her, Ye Jian didn’t tell them the truth.","\"Instructor, come to Xiangnan University more often in the future. Contact us when you’re here. We’ll definitely be there!\"","\"Instructor, remember to send us an email. Don’t lose contact with us. If I want to be a soldier one day, I’ll definitely reach out to you.\"","\"Instructor, you must find a handsome boyfriend! We’ll wait!\"","\"Instructor, if you can’t find a boyfriend, come to us to make your pick. We’ll queue up and let you choose. I’ll be the first to sign up!\"","\"F*ck! Are you cursing our instructor so that she won’t be able to find a boyfriend? Instructor, let me sign up too. I’ll be the second one.\"","Perhaps it was because the military training had ended, but their speaking tones sounded much more casual. However, their respect remained, and they didn’t dare to say anything overboard.","Ye Jian had already lost her ability to speak because of their teasing. This group of children... Yes, in her eyes, they were just a group of children. They were much more energetic than when she was young. They were 18 or 19 years old and were full of vigor.","It was time to part. No matter how reluctant she was, she waved and said goodbye. The bus started moving. Ye Jian saw the students from her class standing and waving at her from afar.","Ye Jian sighed softly. She lowered her head and rubbed the message book with her hands. There were 43 messages left behind by her students. She felt the urge to cry.","It was rare to see people with a pure heart.","Although the military school students were able to control their emotions in front of their students, they were all in low spirits in the bus. The atmosphere in the bus was very low. None of them wanted to speak.","Ye Jian and Song Zhiqiu sat in the same row. The two of them, who had a good relationship, didn’t speak. One looked out of the window while the other looked at the message book. They were so silent that one could tell that their moods were at a low point."]},{"number":4648,"title":"Chapter 4648: Collection","paragraphs":["The chief instructor stood up and looked at the 36 students on the bus. He sighed softly. It was the same every year. Every year, his heart would feel heavy.","Although the military training only lasted for ten days, to these students, the students they trained were their own soldiers. Their actions and commands taught the students how to sweat and laugh together. Even if it was only for ten days, they were still the soldiers they trained.","How could they be in a good mood when they were separated from the soldiers they trained?","They would be fine after some time. Time was the best medicine for healing.","They were almost at the school. Song Zhiqiu, who was sitting by the window, moved his arm and took out a few letters from his pocket. He touched Ye Jian’s arm lightly and handed the letters over.","Ye Jian was looking at the message book. Seeing the letters, she looked at Song Zhiqiu in confusion. \"For me?\"","\"Yes, a few boys in my class secretly stuffed them into my backpack. After thinking about it, I brought them along.\" Song Zhiqiu, who was in a slightly better mood, smiled teasingly. \"They’re love letters, but I didn’t read them.\"","Ye Jian replied calmly, \"They stuffed them into your backpack for you. What do they have to do with me?\"","It was better for her not to accept the love letters. It couldn’t be helped. Her man was narrow-minded. If he knew about it, tsk... He would drown in jealousy again.","\"You’re really not going to read them? Aren’t you curious?\" Song Zhiqiu raised his eyebrows. \"You don’t mind me reading them, right? I want to learn from them.\"","Ye Jian thought for a moment before replying, \"I suggest that you don’t read them. After all, this is a matter of personal security. Don’t let them be discovered by the chief instructor, or you’ll be criticized.\"","If they even dared to accept love letters written by a student, they’d be asking for a beating!","In the end, the two of them didn’t look at what was written in the love letters. Instead, they looked at the message book in Ye Jian’s hand. There were many witty words written, and some even quoted what Ye Jian had said.","[Reporting, Instructor. I have a bug on my face!]","[You can either kill it with your eyes or use your eyes to enlighten it. Choose one!]","[Reporting, Instructor. I want to go to the toilet!]","[Don’t be anxious. Your bladder has enough capacity. Bear with it. You just went 20 minutes ago. Now, you’re asking to go again. I can’t help but suspect that you’re a little weak in some aspects.]","[Can you persevere?]","[Yes!]","[Not bad, let’s add another ten minutes of military stance!] There was a machete at the end of this sentence. [Instructor, at that time, you tortured us thousands of times in our hearts!]","Reading the messages, Song Zhiqiu could only suppress his laughter until his stomach cramped. \"I didn’t expect you to have so much fun during the military training. I couldn’t tell. I really couldn’t tell. I wasn’t as happy as you.\"","\"My popularity isn’t for nothing.\" Ye Jian was laughing so hard that she needed to clench her fists to suppress her laughter. Even she didn’t believe that she had said so many funny things during the military training.","Her mood improved bit by bit as she read and laughed.","As for the phone numbers and emails... The two of them chose to ignore them because it was impossible to contact the students again.","After returning to the military school and entering her fourth year, Ye Jian quickly immersed herself in her studies. Xu Wen and He Jing were the same. The out-of-school training became a good memory for Ye Jian in her military career. She would suddenly remember it and smile unconsciously.","The fourth-year students were even busier. They didn’t have the so-called life of a fourth-year student. They were as busy as usual. Sometimes, they even had to run over to bring the first-year students for training. They were so busy that they even had to calculate their sleeping time carefully.","From the days of the scorching sun to the snow-covered scenery, Ye Jian realized that the days were passing quickly. In the blink of an eye, the fourth semester was over."]},{"number":4649,"title":"Chapter 4649: Single","paragraphs":["Another semester was about to end. Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan hadn’t contacted each other for an entire semester. The two of them seemed to have lost contact. Neither of them knew what the other person was doing. They didn’t know if things were good or bad.","Although the two of them hadn’t contacted each other, Ye Jian received a call from G3 from the brigade in the middle of December. He was ordered to contact Ye Jian and tell her about the matters in the brigade and why they lost contact with Captain Xia Jinyuan.","Not long after he came back from the north of the border, Xia Jinyuan carried out another mission with the new special forces soldiers. Not long after he came back, he sent them overseas again. This time, he sent them to the side of the Head who was going overseas for a visit. Right on the heels of that, he went overseas for another mission. When Pigeon contacted Ye Jian, he hadn’t returned to the team.","However, before he left, Xia Jinyuan told G3 that if he didn’t come back by the end of December, he should contact Ye Jian and tell her about his situation.","It had been a month since she received the call in the middle of December. Ye Jian didn’t receive any more calls from the team. She didn’t know if Xia Jinyuan had returned to the team.","Fortunately, Ye Jian was used to it. Besides being worried, she didn’t complain.","However, she missed him dearly today because it was snowing.","He once came to the campus when it was snowing. The two of them walked through more than half of the military school in the cold wind. They were so cold that their noses were red, but they couldn’t bear to part.","For the first snowfall of the year, she walked around the campus alone.","The first heavy snowfall in Xiang City came late. Three days before the winter vacation, heavy snow fell overnight. The entire campus was white and beautiful.","The usually solemn campus was filled with laughter. It was the students who were shoveling snow to entertain themselves and avoid the inspectors.","As the sound of running was heard, all the students gathered and started their morning exercise. No matter how warm their blankets were, they couldn’t keep the students who needed to get up.","Xu Wen hugged a pile of books and looked at the students who were running in the morning. She sighed with emotion and said to Ye Jian and He Jing, \"Were the fourth-year seniors like us today, standing here and looking at the first-year students?\"","\"Of course.\" He Jing nodded and replied firmly, \"But they were definitely not as stupid as the three of us. We’ve been standing and watching for more than ten minutes! If we don’t leave now, they’ll think that the three of us are peeping at them.\"","They had been standing in the cold wind for more than ten minutes. They looked like fools for sure. Ye Jian looked up from her documents and smiled. \"Not me. It’s you two.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she saw a tall figure walking over. It was obvious that the person was looking for someone.","Ye Jian nudged He Jing’s arm and smiled. \"He’s here again. He’s been bolder lately.\"","He Jing looked up. Yes, he had gotten bolder.","It was almost the holidays. Student Song Zhiqiu was no longer as reserved as before. Instead, he came to look for her openly. It was the same today.","\"Go to the classroom first. I still need some topographic information. I’ll look for you when I find it.\" Ye Jian was the first to speak. She had a good reason to leave. Indeed, she hadn’t found a military topographic information book that she needed.","The first three days of winter vacation were the time for all kinds of exams. Even someone like Ye Jian, who was best at arranging her time, was a little flustered.","Xu Wen, whose nose was red from the wind, didn’t notice her boyfriend walking over. She rubbed her nose and said in a hoarse voice, \"Okay, Jing and I will go over and get seats first.\"","She caught a cold a few days ago. Her voice was hoarse and her nose was blocked. Until today, she still had some mild symptoms."]},{"number":4650,"title":"Chapter 4650: Sweet Love","paragraphs":["When the girlfriend caught a cold, the boyfriend would naturally take care of her. However, Song Zhiqiu’s reconnaissance skills were not bad. Besides Ye Jian and He Jing, no one else knew about their relationship.","The secret had to be kept to the end!","Since the boyfriend, who wanted to take care of his girlfriend, was here, He Jing naturally wouldn’t accompany them. The two of them would be flirting with each other. She didn’t want to be a third wheel.","He Jing immediately said to Xu Wen, who had been caught up in romance, \"I’m sorry, I have to go back to the library too. You can go back to the classroom first. You don’t have to accompany us. If you accompany us every day, a certain someone will probably have something against you.\"","Only then did Xu Wen react. She turned around and saw her boyfriend walking over. She felt sweet and a little embarrassed.","Before she could say anything, Ye Jian and He Jing left tactfully.","It couldn’t be helped. Song Zhiqiu treated them to a meal last week and carefully asked if he could spend some time with Xu Wen a few days before the holidays. The two of them nodded as they ate and generously gave Xu Wen up.","That was why Song Zhiqiu dared to come and look for her every day.","\"Why are you here again? Didn’t you say you wouldn’t keep coming to look for me? Be careful not to be discovered by the instructor. At that time, we won’t be able to bear the consequences.\"","In this relationship, Xu Wen was much more careful than Song Zhiqiu.","She had to be careful. She was almost in her fourth year of university. After her tireless efforts and Ye Jian’s encouragement, she finally improved the instructor’s evaluation of her. She didn’t want to return to square one because of a relationship.","Perhaps it was because the female students in the military school were all very rational, but Xu Wen wasn’t blinded by love. She could see things clearly.","Song Zhiqiu was clear about this too. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have hidden it from his comrades in the dormitory.","If Xu Wen hadn’t caught a cold, he wouldn’t have kept looking for her.","Hearing this, he took the thick documents from Xu Wen’s hand and looked at the two figures who left without waiting for him. He smiled and said, \"I know my limits. Let’s go.\"","\"My nose is still stuffed. I didn’t sleep much last night.\"","One second ago, she was complaining about why Song Zhiqiu was here. The next second, she whined, \"I didn’t even want to get up in the morning. I have no energy.\"","\"Yet you’re standing outside in the cold wind? I’ll send you back to the classroom first. Then, I’ll go to the infirmary to get some medicine for you. You must take your medicine on time. Don’t make me keep an eye on you at all times.\"","\"I know, old man.\"","\"You don’t like me nagging? Then listen to me and don’t make me worry. You’re already sick, but you don’t know how to take care of yourself.\"","Xu Wen smiled until her eyes were filled with sweetness. \"With you watching over me and you worrying about me, why should I worry?\"","The two of them walked side by side and maintained a certain distance. It looked like an ordinary relationship, but in fact, the conversation between the two of them was as sweet as cream.","He Jing said to Ye Jian, \"I still can’t believe that the two of them are together. I never thought that they would be a couple.\"","Ye Jian didn’t expect Song Zhiqiu to say that he wanted to woo Xu Wen during the May 1st outdoor training. She was also shocked at that time.","With Song Zhiqiu’s personality, he should have found a gentle and dignified girlfriend. However, he found someone completely opposite—Xu Wen.","When he said that he wanted to woo Xu Wen, he Jing really didn’t think that he would be able to woo her. That was because Xu Wen wasn’t interested in Song Zhiqiu at all."]},{"number":4651,"title":"Chapter 4651: When Will You Give Birth","paragraphs":["In the end, Song Zhiqiu successfully wooed Xu Wen.","After interacting for half a year, their relationship got stronger and stronger. Song Zhiqiu tolerated Xu Wen because Xu Wen was smiling more than before.","\"We didn’t think of it because we didn’t understand Song Zhiqiu. He has a dull personality and needs to find a girl who likes to laugh and fool around. Xu Wen is what he needs. Meanwhile, Xu Wen needs a boyfriend who can tolerate everything about her. The steady Song Zhiqiu can tolerate everything. Hence, it’s not surprising that the two got together.\"","Ye Jian lowered her voice and said in a low voice. He Jing, who was meticulous, heard a hint of sweetness.","\"It’s the same for you and him, right? You never thought that two people who had nothing to do with each other would get together. However, one day, he really became your boyfriend.","\"You’re a little surprised and hesitant but also expectant, right?\"","After He Jing finished speaking, she saw Ye Jian’s fair face turning red. Hahaha, every time they talked about the relationship between a man and a woman, she would blush.","\"You’re blushing again. Your blushing problem... makes me want to bully you even more!\"","Ye Jian patted her face with one hand and refused to admit it. \"My face isn’t red. It’s red from the wind. Let’s hurry up and leave. The exams are important. We shouldn’t be gossiping here.\"","\"It’s not gossip. I’m just wondering whose wedding banquet I’ll attend first after graduation. Also, when you give birth to a child, I’ll be the child’s godmother!\"","The more she spoke, the more irrelevant the topic became. She was even talking about children now!","Ye Jian quickened her pace and rushed toward the library.","A child... It was probably impossible for her and Captain Xia to have a child anytime soon. Even if they got married, they wouldn’t have a child so early, right? She wondered if the elders in the family would rush them.","Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia probably wanted to hug their great-grandchild very much. Last time at the old residence, Grandma Xia even teased her, saying that she had to work hard to take care of her body so that she could carry her little great-grandchild in the future.","Old Master Xia also nodded in agreement. He said that he would take care of his body too.","It could be seen that the elders in the family wanted to see her and Captain Xia’s child as soon as possible.","She wondered what her child with Captain Xia would be like. With Captain Xia’s genes... the child shouldn’t be too bad, right?","If the girl was like her and the boy was like Captain Xia... It was a beautiful thought.","Ye Jian, who was led astray by He Jing, walked quickly while thinking about all kinds of things. When she entered the library, her face was even redder than before. She was thinking too much... How could she not blush?","He Jing thought her face was as red as a tomato.","The library became the place where Ye Jian visited the most during the first three days of her vacation. After all the exams ended, Ye Jian stood on the weight scale. In winter, she lost five kilograms.","Xu Wen stared at the numbers and held her forehead in pain. \"I don’t believe it. It’s fake. It’s fake... Why did I only lose half a kilogram?\"","\"Because Jian and I don’t have anyone to take care of us, but you do.\" He Jing, who had also lost five kilograms, smiled as she retorted to her roommate who had always wanted to lose weight but couldn’t. \"God is very fair. You can’t have the best of both worlds.\"","After putting on her shoes, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"You’ve lost half a kilo. That’s not bad. You’ll be with Song Zhiqiu for the entire winter vacation. You’ll probably get fatter.\"","This year, Xu Wen and Song Zhiqiu would be staying in school for the winter vacation. They would even spend the new year in school. After receiving the notice, Xu Wen hid under the blanket and laughed for a long time.","Song Zhiqiu was even more ridiculous. He was so happy that one could see his white teeth from afar."]},{"number":4652,"title":"Chapter 4652:Friendship","paragraphs":["According to past practices, Ye Jian should be the busiest during this winter vacation. However, this year was different from the past. She could go home early for a vacation. She had even booked a plane ticket and would fly back to the capital city at 11:00 am tomorrow.","He Jing didn’t stay in school, but she needed to go on a business trip with an instructor. She would write the report when she came back. It would probably take around ten days.","The next morning, the two of them sent Ye Jian to the school gate and watched her leave. Looking at the airport bus that was far away, Xu Wen sighed with emotion. \"This is the first time I’ve sent Ye Jian home. In the past, she always left without saying anything. I wouldn’t even know that she had left the school.","\"She’s been busy for so long. It’s time for her to have a relaxing vacation.\" He Jing, who had also sent Ye Jian home for the first time, sighed softly. She looked at the traffic coming and going. When she opened her mouth again, her voice was filled with sorrow. \"After the winter vacation, it’ll be the last semester. The final assessment in April will be followed by May 1st. After that, June will come... And the three of us will go our separate ways.\"","Xu Wen was a little down. She kicked the path with the tip of her toes. After a long time, she said in a low voice, \"Have you ever thought of taking the postgraduate entrance examination?\"","He Jing was stunned for a moment. She shook her head. \"No, my family background doesn’t allow me to continue studying. I’ll follow the arrangements immediately after graduation.\" She paused for a moment and seemed to have thought of something. She lowered her voice and asked, \"Is that your plan? Why didn’t I hear you mention it in the past?\"","\"Song Zhiqiu suggested that I take the postgraduate entrance examination until I get a PhD. My family... hopes so too. I didn’t think about it before, but now that both sides have suggested it, I’m a little tempted.\"","\"What about Song Zhiqiu? What are his plans?\"","\"He wants to go for postgraduate studies together. I’m only tempted because of this.\"","\"Then why are you still considering it? Go for it! It’s good to study for a PhD together! As long as the conditions allow it, you can continue your studies. You don’t have to consider it anymore. I think it’s very good.\" He Jing smiled. Although she usually liked to pick on Xu Wen, she was still very good to her. \"As long as your family supports you and you don’t have any worries, you should continue your studies.","\"What else do you have to worry about? Do you think that you won’t be able to get in? Are you scared of embarrassing yourself?\"","...","Xu Wen looked at her comrade silently. The resentment in her eyes made He Jing laugh unkindly. \"Hahaha, am I right? Hahaha, you’re afraid of losing your reputation too, huh? Are you worried about being despised by Song Zhiqiu, who’ll definitely be able to pass the postgraduate entrance examination and get a PhD?\"","\"Be kind, comrade. I’ve been tired enough recently, but you’re still teasing me.\" Xu Wen rolled her eyes. \"If you continue laughing, we’ll cut ties.\"","It was impossible for them to cut ties. After He Jing laughed presumptuously, she cleared her throat and raised her hand to pat her comrade’s shoulder. \"Don’t worry. With Song Zhiqiu around, you’ll definitely be able to pass the exam. Since someone like him dares to ask you to take up postgraduate studies, it means that he has a detailed plan.","\"Take care, comrade. You’re going to go for the postgraduate entrance examination. However, your decision came too late. You should’ve started preparing in your third year. Oh, right, you weren’t together at that time yet. You only decided to take the postgraduate entrance examination in your fourth year. You don’t have much time to prepare... No wonder you don’t have the confidence.","\"Just give it a try anyway. How will you know if it won’t work if you don’t try? What if you get in? Time is tight. Let Song Zhiqiu hurry up and prepare for the exam. Fortunately, Jian has been supervising you for the past few years. It’s still possible for you to give it a try.\""]},{"number":4653,"title":"Chapter 4653: Unknown","paragraphs":["This concerned Xu Wen’s future development. He Jing, who usually didn’t talk much, said a bunch of things. \"If Jian were here, she’d definitely support you! If you really can’t make up your mind, do you want to call Jian now? You should’ve told us last night. Jian could even give you some advice in person.\"","Xu Wen took it seriously. \"Since you support me, it looks like I can give it a try. I’ll ask Jian too.\"","As she spoke, she took out the phone from her pocket that she received yesterday. She called Ye Jian’s number.","She couldn’t get through in the first two calls. When Xu Wen tried again, Ye Jian’s phone was turned off.","Xu Wen looked at the time displayed on her cell phone. It was 3:20 pm. Logically speaking, Ye Jian should have already arrived in the capital city. Her cell phone should be turned on.","\"Why is her phone still switched off? Did something happen?\" she muttered in a low voice. Song Zhiqiu, who was reading at the side, didn’t look up. He said calmly, \"It’s also possible that the plane was delayed because of the weather. Try again later. Send a message and ask her to get back to you once she turns on her phone.\"","Xu Wen listened and sent a message to Ye Jian.","It was not until a few minutes past 7:00 pm that Xu Wen finally received Ye Jian’s reply. The content was very simple: [I arrived safely. I won’t be able to use my cell phone temporarily. I’ll contact you when I’m free.]","Xu Wen’s heart skipped a beat. She handed her cell phone to Song Zhiqiu. \"What does she mean? She’s already home. Why can’t she use her cell phone?\"","Song Zhiqiu, who had been revising for the postgraduate exam with his girlfriend all day long, leaned forward and finished reading the message. As he pursed his lips, a hint of darkness flashed past his eyes. He smiled and said, \"It’s no big deal. Who keeps staring at their cell phones when they go home? She must be accompanying her family. She’ll contact you when she’s free. Be good and don’t think too much. You should hurry up and study for the postgraduate exam.\"","As he spoke, he naturally reached out to confiscate Xu Wen’s phone and placed it in his pocket.","Ye Jian couldn’t use her cell phone for the time being... It seemed like Ye Jian had gone to do something unknown and dangerous.","It wasn’t a ’something’. It should be a mission.","They were still studying for the postgraduate entrance examination and wondering which unit they would go to in the future. Ye Jian, who was always ahead of all the students, had already confirmed her future path and adapted in advance.","Then, he looked at his girlfriend who was studying seriously. There was a faint smile in Song Zhiqiu’s eyes. It was all thanks to Ye Jian, who had plans for the future, that Xu Wen caught his interest. If not, he wouldn’t have suggested taking the postgraduate entrance examination together.","He hoped that Ye Jian could return safely. With her ability, she would definitely return safely.","’See you next year, comrade!’","In the quiet library, the students were writing furiously and working hard for their future. Ye Jian, who had made a call to ask for a refund and a new flight ticket, was already sitting in an inconspicuous black sedan. Besides her and the driver, there were two other people in the car.","\"This is all the information about the missing girls. They all dropped out of school early to work because they were poor. Last March, the police intercepted a batch of new drugs. That was when this group of girls disappeared...\"","The man in the back seat handed a stack of documents to Ye Jian. At the same time, he handed over a few photos. \"If it weren’t for the family of this girl who reported the case, no one would have realized that so many girls had gone missing. The investigating police didn’t think that their disappearances might be done by a multinational drug dealer. It was only last week when the narcotics police found a new clue that they connected the two.\"","When Ye Jian arrived at the airport during the day, she received a call from Major General Yang. After talking for five minutes, her schedule changed. She flew from the capital city to Yun Province."]},{"number":4654,"title":"Chapter 4654: Wall of Heroes","paragraphs":["Yun Province was the province that Ye Jian visited the most. The missions she carried out were getting more dangerous and more difficult. Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly as she walked. Her slender fingers subconsciously rubbed the corners of her clothes. Her beautiful face turned a little gloomy.","\"It’s a dangerous trip. Write a letter to whoever you want. If you can come back, tear it up. If not...\"","On the other end of the cell phone, Major General Yang spoke in a low voice. It was very, very heavy. It was like a huge rock sinking into the bottom of the sea.","If she couldn’t come back, the letter would become her will.","Her fingers touched her pocket lightly. The folded letter had sharp edges. She just needed to put it in an envelope and hand it to the Narcotics Brigade. If she couldn’t come back... This letter would be sent to her lover, who would pass it to her family.","This trip was rife with danger... This was the first time she had written a will.","Ye Jian arrived at Cheli City in Yun Province at 11:00 pm. She followed the two narcotics police officers and walked through a long corridor that was dimly lit by the lights. After turning two corners, they arrived at the three-story office of the narcotics police in Cheli City.","The office was small, but the training ground was quite big.","They walked along the long corridor. To the right, the outside was filled with training grounds. Faintly, they could hear the low growls of the sniffer dogs. This area, which was about the size of two football fields, was the training ground for the sniffer police to train the sniffer dogs.","The two narcotics officers who led the way only gave Ye Jian a simple introduction of their working environment. They talked the most about Cheli City.","Cheli City was located on both sides of the Lancang River Fracture Zone. The terrain of the mountains was high in the north and low in the south. The two sides were high and low in the middle. The mountain range was filled with ravines. The south bordered Myanmar. Cheli City was the county-level city closest to the Golden Triangle. It was also Ye Jian’s resting place tonight.","After entering the three-story office building, the most eye-catching thing was not the solemn police badge but a black and white wall. The black and white wall was filled with black and white photos. There were no names or introductions. There were only photos.","The photos were embedded in glass frames. At the bottom of each frame, there was a white strip. The moment Ye Jian entered, she felt a heavy hammer hitting her chest.","In an instant, the blood in her chest surged as layers of chills appeared on her back.","There was no name or introduction. There were only rows of black and white photos on the black and white wall. There was no need for the two narcotics officers to explain. Ye Jian understood.","There were rows and rows of photos. They were all of the police officers who were sacrificed because of narcotics cases.","In the first yellowed photo, Ye Jian saw a person wearing a police uniform from the 1980s. She slowed down her footsteps. She said to the two narcotics officers, \"Can I stop for a while?\"","After entering the office building, the two narcotics officers, who had become cold and sharp, nodded slightly. They accompanied Ye Jian to the Wall of Heroes. Ye Jian bowed deeply and didn’t straighten her back for a long time.","The two narcotics officers accompanying her also bowed and saluted their comrades who had gone far away.","Ye Jian didn’t leave immediately. From the first photo onward, she looked at every one until she reached the last black and white photo. There were a total of 153 black and white photos. The last photo was obviously placed recently. He had a young face, but his eyes were filled with a sharpness that would make drug dealers unable to hide.","\"He died in December. He was only married for less than half a year, and his wife is four months pregnant. The first night, he told us happily that he was going to be a father. The next day, he was gone at six in the evening.\""]},{"number":4655,"title":"Chapter 4655: Heroic Spirits Everywhere On Green Mountain","paragraphs":["The narcotics officer standing on Ye Jian’s left spoke in a low voice. In the empty hall, Ye Jian could feel the sorrow in his voice. It came from the depths of his soul. It was indelible and couldn’t be healed. It had become a wound that was engraved in his soul. It would be there for the rest of his life. It was impossible for it to heal.","\"Last year, a total of 18 people died in our team. It happens every month. Every month, there would be a few days when it rains. Some will be shot to death, some will be stabbed in the back, and some will be reported by drug addicts and killed by drug dealers... It often happens here.\"","\"The photos displayed here are just the comrades who died in our team. The photo wall is a little small.\"","The last sentence, ’The photo wall is a little small’, made Ye Jian’s eyes tear up. If it was small... it meant that there would be more sacrifices in the future. There would be more black and white photos placed on the black and white wall.","Ye Jian saluted all the martyrs on the wall. She pursed her lips and followed the two narcotics officers to the second floor.","The office building was a little dark. Besides a set of lights on the photo wall, only two spotlights were on the left side of the lobby.","A spotlight was lit near the stairway, and a spotlight was lit near the left of the corridor. The hall was in the middle, and the stairs were on both sides.","The hall, which was lit up by only two spotlights, was dark. If a timid person walked through the hall alone, they would probably feel frightened.","The hall was very quiet. It was so quiet that she could hear the footsteps of the three of them echoing. Ye Jian, who was following the two narcotics officers, clasped her fingers slightly. For some reason... she felt that someone was secretly watching her.","The person didn’t mean any harm. It felt like she was just being sized up.","They passed through the hall and went to the staircase on the left. The two narcotics officers who were leading the way in front asked Ye Jian to go upstairs first. Ye Jian, who was already feeling strange, suddenly tilted her body. Right on the heels of that, a black shadow at the entrance of the dark staircase rushed toward Ye Jian with a violent wind.","The moment the black shadow appeared, the two narcotics officers pushed open the office door beside the entrance to the stairs. The two of them entered and locked the door.","Without any warning, the sudden attack made Ye Jian realize that the Narcotics Brigade was testing her.","The more cautious she was, the more it meant that this mission was extraordinarily dangerous. The will, probing, and Wall of Heroes told Ye Jian that she might not be able to return.","The two spotlights in the hall were also extinguished. Besides the lights on the Wall of Heroes, the entire hall was pitch-black. It was so dark that she couldn’t see her fingers. Ye Jian leaned against the cold wall. She couldn’t use her gaze to spot the danger anymore. She calmed down and used her ears to listen to her surroundings. She listened to the sounds of breathing.","Her hand went to her waist. The sound of a metal clasp being undone was heard. Ye Jian quickly took out her belt and used it as a weapon. She pinpointed where the breathing sound came from.","Smack!","The belt was like a sword that tore through the air. It hit a black shadow that was hiding under the stairway and slowly approaching Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t know which part of the black shadow she had hit. She only knew that she successfully heard a cry of pain.","The black shadow that was hit by the belt was in so much pain that he gritted his teeth. His facial features were distorted. This female soldier... reacted much faster than the seven female soldiers and the policewoman!","Although it was painful, the black shadow smiled excitedly."]},{"number":4656,"title":"Chapter 4656: Choose Cautiously","paragraphs":["They needed a female soldier with high intelligence, stamina, and brainpower. They had been looking for someone for half a year. They chose a total of seven suitable female soldiers and female police officers to come to Cheli City. Although they were indeed outstanding, they still didn’t pass the initial assessment.","There was a female police officer who just came back from overseas. She was outstanding in all aspects. She could fight and was smart. In the end, she lost because she didn’t know how to act.","No matter how she disguised herself, her temperament couldn’t deceive anyone. The veteran drug dealers would know right away that she was a narcotics officer.","There was only one last stage left. After passing the ’disguise’ stage, the cute female SWAT officer, who even had a cute name, would have become the only undercover agent for this mission.","Yet, she lost this round. They said that her disguise was lacking.","She couldn’t have any flaws. She had to be perfect.","In the end, this female SWAT officer from the capital city, Zhou Niannian, failed the assessment and was still recuperating in the Narcotics Brigade with regrets.","The figure licked the tip of his teeth and rubbed his arm that was hurting from getting smacked by the belt. He held his breath and quickly pushed open the office door. After flashing in, he immediately locked the door.","He was just testing the water first. He was very satisfied with the female soldier’s quick reaction.","Although Zhou Niannian, the female SWAT officer who almost became an undercover agent, reacted quite quickly as well, she was still inferior to the military school student. Zhou Niannian’s reaction was about a beat slower.","\"Boss, there’s probably some hope. I was whipped by her. No, I was whipped by her belt.\"","Besides the figure that had just entered the office, there was another figure leaning against the desk. There was a hint of red flickering between his fingers. It was a lit cigarette that was slowly burning between his fingers.","\"There’s no hurry. We have to see whether she’ll pass the final stage first,\" said the figure with a hoarse voice. Right on the heels of that, he took a deep puff of the cigarette. The red spot that was lit up flickered continuously before extinguishing abruptly.","\"Don’t smoke so much. Your voice is already hoarse.\" The other figure reminded him softly. He walked to the desk and turned on the desk lamp. Then, he dimmed it down slightly. It couldn’t illuminate the faces of the two figures.","The figure who turned on the light took off his jacket, revealing his strong upper body. He stretched out his arm and shone it under the desk lamp. It was already swollen!","The figure who was smoking turned around and exclaimed. He extinguished his cigarette and stared at his subordinate’s red and swollen arm for a few seconds. Then, he smiled and said, \"It looks like we have a ruthless female soldier. Not bad. I’m just afraid that she’s not ruthless enough. After this, take a bottle of saffron oil and massage it.\"","\"I didn’t even have the time to hide when she came over. I was beaten up directly. It’s my first time getting injured the moment I appeared. No matter how powerful Zhou Niannian was, she only made a move at the back. This student that the military school sent personally has potential.","\"We can’t be picky anymore. If we continue, when will the case be closed? How many girls from the village will go missing? This is enough. If this candidate won’t do, let’s look for Zhou Niannian.","\"If she doesn’t know how to disguise herself, she can learn to do it. If you force her to train for about three days, she’ll definitely pass with her comprehension. When we went to see her today, she even suggested letting her try again. We mentioned that there would be another female soldier tonight. Zhou Niannian didn’t say much, but she looked quite disappointed.\""]},{"number":4657,"title":"Chapter 4657: What Skills","paragraphs":["The head was Captain Deng of Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade. The unit he led was in charge of the narcotics from Cheli City to Nan San, which was closest to the Golden Triangle. They cooperated with the border defense narcotics police and guarded the country’s entrance to prevent the drugs from flowing out.","His head was worth one million USD on the black market. Since October last year, it had risen by another 500,000 USD. Now, it had reached 1.5 million USD.","There were countless drug dealers who wanted to kill him, and there were countless drug dealers he wanted to kill.","Captain Deng was only 45 years old. When he graduated from the police academy at the age of 21, he was assigned to Yun Province to become a narcotics police officer. He had been working here for 24 years.","He didn’t know how much drugs he had confiscated. He didn’t know how many drug dealers he had caught. He didn’t know how many drug dealers wanted him to die.","No matter how dangerous it was, Captain Deng had never thought of leaving his current position. In his words, even if he died, he would drag a few drug dealers down with him.","Captain Deng, whom the drug dealers hated to the core, pulled out a chair and sat down with a tired expression. He reached out his hand and wanted to pick up the cigarette box that was placed on the desk, but his injured subordinate took it away. \"The day is over. Captain, your wife told us that you can only smoke three cigarettes a day.\"","Captain Deng wasn’t addicted to smoking. He just smoked when he wasn’t in a good mood. Hearing that, he retracted his hand and crossed his arms. He raised his head and leaned back in his chair. He said slowly, \"We can’t take any risks. We’ve already learned our lesson. We can’t take risks anymore. We must find the most suitable person.\"","The subordinate who started putting on his shirt again fell silent. The lesson he mentioned... It referred to a female police officer who went undercover two years ago. In the end, she was accidentally discovered and brutally killed by a drug dealer. The brigade received a set of bloodstained clothes with no sleeves on either side and a pair of pants that had turned into shorts. There was also hair stuck to her skull.","It meant that they had cut off her hands, legs, and head.","The cruelty made all the narcotics officers’ eyes turn red as they cried.","This time, they needed to send another undercover agent. The tragedy two years ago couldn’t be repeated, so it had to be perfect.","Outside, Ye Jian, who was undergoing the test, stood on the stairs to the second floor for a long time without taking another step. There was an ambush at the top of the stairs and around the staircase. She couldn’t go up or down...","There was more than one figure. There were six of them.","They were all narcotics police officers who practiced combat. They would test the capabilities of the female soldier they hired this time and see if she could take on this undercover mission.","\"Go!\"","A figure said in a low voice. His voice cut across the air and entered Ye Jian’s ears with a sharp edge that could make people bleed.","Ye Jian, who was planning to rush to the second floor, was forced to retreat by the figures. There were also figures closing in on her path of retreat. All of them had cold glints in their hands. Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly. In the end, she chose to hold the railing of the stairs with one hand and jump out...","The figures who launched the sneak attack all had daggers in their hands. She only had one belt in her hand. She had to take it easy. She couldn’t let them cut her belt into pieces.","There was already a figure lying in ambush at the corner of the stairs. Ye Jian jumped over the handrail. The figure holding the knife in one hand didn’t hesitate at all. With the intention to kill, he stabbed it toward Ye Jian.","Ye Jian could hear six sets of breathing, but she couldn’t tell that there was another figure at the bottom of the stairs."]},{"number":4658,"title":"Chapter 4658: Barehanded","paragraphs":["The figure rushed out. Even if she realized it now, it was too late. She couldn’t avoid him. She could only try her best to avoid getting stabbed in her vital points. Ye Jian, who had already jumped over the railing, reached out her hand and grabbed the iron railing. She used the strength of her arm to support her entire body. She hooked her slender and straight legs and kicked the figure hard.","Hiss!","Even though Ye Jian reacted in time and was already prepared, the figure, who had been waiting for an opportunity to launch a sneak attack, still slashed Ye Jian’s pants and calf with the dagger in his hand.","The pain came instantly. Ye Jian even felt a warm liquid seeping into her leggings.","This time she needs to go to an area that was underdeveloped in all areas. She would have very little contact with the country. She would be heading to the Golden Triangle, one of the three major drug sources in the world.","She would be going alone. When she came back would depend on when she figured out the drug trafficking route that had to do with the missing girls. Whether she could come back alive depended on her.","Hence, the Narcotics Brigade came up with this assessment so that the spy they sent could come back alive.","Many people had already been assessed, including Zhou Niannian, who had gone overseas for a year. However, she didn’t pass Captain Deng’s assessment.","Now, it was Ye Jian’s turn.","The figures encircled Ye Jian. The three of them forced Ye Jian to retreat step by step. Then, three more people came out and slashed at Ye Jian. Although it was an assessment, it was a real assessment. It was normal to be injured.","Ye Jian didn’t allow them to force her into the narrow aisle. She tightened her belt and slammed forward. As two of them fell, Ye Jian pressed her elbow against the chest of a narcotics officer. The moment she fell to the ground, she exerted strength and quickly flipped over the narcotics officer’s head. She pushed herself out of the encirclement and retreated into the wide hall.","The consequence of this method of breaking out of the encirclement was that the only weapon in her hand, her belt, was gone. It was wrapped around the narcotics officer’s arm and could not be retrieved.","When she entered the Yun Province, Ye Jian kept her silver wire in her luggage just in case. The luggage... was with the two narcotics officers who led the way earlier. She couldn’t retrieve it.","Facing the narcotics police who were holding daggers in the dark, Ye Jian fought six people alone with her bare hands.","It wasn’t an easy job to fight six people alone. Moreover, the other party had daggers with them. They didn’t go easy at all and stabbed Ye Jian as though she was a drug dealer.","Without her belt, Ye Jian took off her jacket and wrapped it around her hand to face the attacks of the six figures.","From time to time, the fighting figures would flash past the Wall of Heroes. The figures moved, and the 150-odd narcotics martyrs who were sacrificed watched silently. They seemed to be protecting them and looking forward to the outcome...","A narcotics police officer was knocked down by Ye Jian. At the same time, she snatched the dagger and pressed it against his neck. Because she used too much strength, the sharp edge of the dagger cut through his skin. Blood flowed out.","Before Ye Jian could catch her breath, another narcotics officer stabbed her. His actions were so fierce that Ye Jian narrowed her eyes. She retracted her dagger and hurriedly avoided him.","The narcotics officer, whose dagger was snatched away by Ye Jian, got up and retreated to the side. He didn’t have the right to participate in the female soldier’s assessment anymore.","There were still five people left.","Ye Jian needed to defeat all five of them to pass the first round of combat assessment.","There were no guns or ammunition. It was a pure life-or-death battle. It was quite difficult for Ye Jian, but she could handle it."]},{"number":4659,"title":"Chapter 4659: Sweep","paragraphs":["The narcotics officers who fought with Ye Jian were not ordinary narcotics officers. They were all narcotics officers who went to the most dangerous frontlines and chased after drug dealers. They had made countless contributions and were all capable.","Every time they were punched or kicked, they would be in so much pain that their facial features would turn hideous. Ye Jian was no exception. Her back was kicked by a narcotics officer behind her. Ye Jian let out a low groan and fell forward.","The narcotics police officer in front moved at lightning speed. He raised his long leg and kicked Ye Jian, who was falling forward.","If she was kicked this time, Ye Jian would definitely be kicked back and be beaten to death by the narcotics officers behind her.","They were really hitting Ye Jian to death. They didn’t show any mercy and weren’t putting on a show. They were as vicious as when facing drug dealers.","They had to do this. They had to find out if the female soldier was good enough before deciding if they should continue.","They couldn’t do it casually.","If they made do with the past, the tragedy from two years ago might repeat itself. Hence, they could not let the tragedy repeat itself!","Ye Jian, whose back was hurting and whose chest was surging with blood, saw that her chest was about to be kicked. In an instant, she suddenly grabbed the long leg that was kicking her. A vicious look surged in her dark eyes. She, who was staggering under the first kick, finally found her focus again. She grabbed the leg that was kicking her and stabilized her body. At the same time, she walked forward quickly and bumped into the officer...","One of his legs was restrained by Ye Jian. The narcotics officer’s expression changed. How could he win against Ye Jian? He was overturned by Ye Jian.","Bang!","The overturned narcotics officer fell to the ground. Ye Jian didn’t let go of his leg. Her eyes were bloodshot. She turned around and sat on the narcotics officer’s knee. She used her hands to push his long legs outward...","Hiss!","This was not an ordinary pain. It was so painful that the narcotics officer growled. It was really painful.","\"I admit defeat! If you keep pulling, my right leg will be crippled for three months.\" The narcotics officer didn’t want to break a bone, so he admitted defeat immediately. He was afraid that if he spoke a second later, the military school student would really cripple his right leg.","Ye Jian let go and stood up vigorously. The sharp blade of the dagger in her hand was facing outward. The tip of the dagger was facing her elbow and parallel to her wrist. She stared at the other four narcotics officers with a fierce gaze. Suddenly, she moved forward with her footsteps. Just as the four narcotics officers thought that she would attack, Ye Jian suddenly made a big turn and ran toward the entrance of the stairs that led to the second floor.","She needed to go up to the second floor, and these narcotics officers were stopping her from going up to the second floor. In that case, would she be able to pass as long as she went up to the second floor?","As this thought flashed past her mind, Ye Jian immediately acted. She used a fake attack to distract the four narcotics officers. Then, she caught the four narcotics officers off guard to achieve her true goal.","She rushed out very quickly. The four narcotics officers only saw a blur in front of them. The military school student who was standing in front of them just now was already rushing toward the entrance of the stairs.","\"Stop her!\"","The sudden twist was really hard to guard against. The four narcotics officers, who were a little stunned, quickly chased after her!","\"She’s like a rabbit. She’s really fast!\"","\"Her skills are not bad. She’s better than Zhou Niannian.\""]},{"number":4660,"title":"Chapter 4660: Dawn","paragraphs":["The two narcotics officers laughed softly and started chatting. Although they had been beaten up, they were really happy.","The narcotics officer who had a dagger pressed to him by Ye Jian and had his neck slashed, raised his hand and touched his neck that was still hurting slightly. He whispered to his colleague, \"I have a feeling that we’ve found the right person this time.\"","\"She’s very strong. She only took a short time to deal with us. She’s very agile and has sharp judgment... She’s indeed better than the previous few people.\" The narcotics police officer who almost lost his right leg to Ye Jian wasn’t as optimistic as his colleague. He frowned as he listened to the messy footsteps and the sounds of another fight. He lowered his voice and said in a deep voice, \"We’ll only know if she passes the last stage.\"","\"I hope she passes. I hope her performance will satisfy the captain.\"","After he finished speaking, his gaze landed on the Wall of Heroes. There was no need to look for the photo he was searching for. The first thing he saw was a black and white photo of a policewoman.","The facial expression of the policewoman in the photos was as serious as the expression of her comrades who had sacrificed themselves. She pursed her lips slightly and looked straight ahead with a sharp gaze. She was... the policewoman who had sacrificed herself two years ago. Until now, her body had not been found.","There was a rumor that her body had been eaten by the tigers fed by the drug lords.","She was the 16th martyr whose body couldn’t be found. She was also the martyr whose sacrifice was the most tragic in recent years. She became the sore spot of the entire Narcotics Brigade and their leader, Captain Deng.","The other narcotics officer also looked at the Wall of Heroes. The two of them stood quietly and stared at the will. Sorrow filled them up, causing faint tears to flicker in the corners of their eyes.","All the black and white photos on the wall were taken on their first day of work. Hence, everyone’s expressions were the same. They all looked serious.","On their first day in the Narcotics Brigade, the first thing they did was take photos. They had to wear police uniforms and caps. They had to be serious and not smile.","In fact, no matter how good their mood was at that time, when they took photos on their first day of work, they would become silent and serious after hearing the reason.","That was because this photo was their admission document and would one day become their last photo.","No one could smile. They took the admission photo with mixed feelings and awe.","Quietly, the narcotics officers looked at their comrades who once fought side by side with them. Now, there were only photos left of them. The two narcotics officers just stood there. If no one disturbed them, they would probably stand until dawn.","The moment Ye Jian rushed to the second floor and kicked a narcotics officer who was chasing after her down the stairs, the pitch-black office building was lit up. All the lights were turned on. The snow-white lights illuminated the entire hall until there was no dark corner.","The narcotics officer, who was kicked down by Ye Jian, grabbed the railing with one hand. Only then did he manage to stabilize his body and not fall. If not, he would have fallen.","Captain Deng of Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade picked up his police uniform and put it on. He said to his subordinate who was attacked by Ye Jian, \"Let’s go and take a look.\"","\"It ended way earlier than expected. It looks like the results will be out tonight.\"","The door was pulled open. At the same time, the office door opposite was pulled open too. Two narcotics officers walked out. When they saw Captain Deng, they said in unison, \"Boss, she’s on the second floor.\"","Captain Deng raised his head and nodded slightly. \"Yes, I’m going up. Come, let’s go take a look.\""]},{"number":4661,"title":"Chapter 4661: Can’t Bear To","paragraphs":["The snow-white light shone into Captain Deng’s eyes. It was like a scorching fire that lit up his eyes. Captain Deng, who had been walking to the abyss for a long time, finally saw hope. The two narcotics officers exchanged glances. This meant that... there was hope!","\"Why are your clothes and caps crooked? Go, look in the mirror and tidy up.\" Captain Deng reminded his subordinates to pay attention to their image. He buttoned the top button of his police uniform and pulled the hem of his shirt. Just as he was thinking if he had missed something, his subordinate ran over and handed him his police cap. \"Captain, you’re not wearing your cap!\"","Yes!","He missed his police cap.","Captain Deng put on his cap and strode up the stairs.","\"Captain!\"","\"Captain!\"","A few narcotics officers stood in the stairwell one after another. When they saw their captain coming over, they restrained their excitement and raised their voices to greet him.","Ye Jian stood on the second floor and lowered her head slightly to look in the direction of the voices in the corridor. She saw Captain Deng from the Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade striding over. Ye Jian hurriedly went downstairs.","\"No need, no need.\"","Captain Deng immediately stopped her. His mellow voice was filled with joy. \"The conference room is on the second floor. You don’t have to come down.\"","In 15 minutes, she took down the six narcotics officers he sent out. It was over twice as fast as he expected. She was ten minutes faster than Zhou Niannian, who had the best results before her. Captain Deng, who suppressed the excitement in the depths of his eyes, rushed in front of Ye Jian and apologized first. \"I’m sorry about tonight. I didn’t inform you about the test in advance, but there’s a reason for this. Please forgive me.\"","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Captain Deng, you’re being too polite. You’re only doing this because you want to take responsibility for me. There’s no need to apologize. I understand.\"","\"That’s good, that’s good. This way to the conference room!\" She was quick to understand the situation. Captain Deng felt relieved.","He hoped that she could persevere until the end. He hoped that she could pass all the tests... Since he hoped so, his heart felt a little heavy.","The path ahead was filled with danger. If she could successfully pass all the assessments and infiltrate the core area of the Golden Triangle, would she be able to complete her mission and come back successfully?","Captain Deng, who had mixed feelings, had a dark look in his eyes. When he took another step, his expression turned heavy.","The conference room door was pushed open. Ye Jian shook hands with a few narcotics officers before sitting down to start the meeting.","Captain Deng, who had a thin face and eyes like a hawk, told Ye Jian in advance what she was facing, where she would go, and what she needed to do. He spoke very slowly as if he was afraid that Ye Jian wouldn’t hear him clearly. He enunciated every word clearly and asked Ye Jian from time to time, \"Do you have any questions? Is there anything you don’t understand? Is there anything you want to ask?\"","Every time, Ye Jian replied, \"There’s no problem. Please continue.\" A smile flashed past Captain Deng’s eyes. The hope in the depths of his eyes lit up.","This was the eighth female soldier they had searched for. The first seven were police officers and female soldiers. They were all very outstanding. In the end, however, they didn’t manage to pass their assessment. Since this military school student with the surname Ye could remember the information they provided in a limited time, she could enter the last round of the assessment, which was a disguise test.","After passing the disguise test, she would be the undercover agent who would eventually enter the core of the Golden Triangle.","She would be kidnapped by the drug dealers who pretended to be looking for workers. After she was kidnapped, she would face the danger of being lured into doing drugs, the danger of being beaten up, the danger of being illegally imprisoned, and even... the danger of being humiliated by the drug dealers."]},{"number":4662,"title":"Chapter 4662: Last","paragraphs":["The responsibility on her shoulders was too great. While facing many dangers alone, she needed to find out where the missing girls had gone to, the trading point of the new drug chain, the people who did the transactions, the time of the transactions... She had to report everything to the outside world. Only by reporting to the outside world could the narcotics police quickly destroy this drug chain that was responsible for the missing girls.","She would have to fight alone the entire time. Once her identity was exposed, she had to think of a way to leave alone as well. As for whether there were any reinforcements... she needed to see if there were any spies sent to investigate at the place she entered.","Captain Deng told Ye Jian almost all the dangers that she would face. He also showed her many hair-raising photos of the crimes the drug dealers had committed. He wanted to see if Ye Jian would become afraid or remain calm.","From the first to the last of the tragic photos, Captain Deng didn’t see any fear in the military school student sitting opposite him. Besides a serious expression, there were no other changes in her expression.","There was no fear or panic. She didn’t even frown. No one could tell what she was thinking.","\"Little Ye, do you have any problems? If not, let’s hurry up and move on to the next step.\" After moving past the last tragic photo from the projection screen, Captain Deng stared at the military school student that he couldn’t see through. Even his voice became softer, as if he was afraid of disturbing Ye Jian.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze. Her expression didn’t change. She nodded and said seriously, \"No problem. Please enter the next segment.\"","\"Do you really have no problems? These photos...\" Suddenly, Captain Deng raised his hand. The projection screen that wasn’t displaying anything now showed the most tragic photo...","In the photo, the drug dealer had thrown the victim into a water cage. Only the person’s head was allowed to come out of the water. Underwater, there were snakes, leeches, and piranhas. They swarmed up to bite all the parts below the person’s head.","What was even more shocking was that the photographer deliberately took photos of the expression on the victim’s face. The despair on the victim’s face was obvious.","Ye Jian took a look and retracted her gaze. She had seen even more tragic photos in the Xueyu unit. She had personally experienced even more tragic scenes.","Hence, Ye Jian said calmly, \"Let’s continue. These photos can’t affect me.\"","That photo... Even Zhou Niannian, who had the strongest mental fortitude, gasped in shock upon seeing it.","The nine narcotics officers who were accompanying them looked at Ye Jian and then at their leader. There was a dark glint in their eyes.","\"Captain, there’s a chance! Seize it!\"","Captain Deng kept staring at Ye Jian until she closed her eyes gently. He placed his left hand on the stack of documents that was about half the height of an adult’s arm. \"This is all the information, photos, and code words. The entire topographic map of the Golden Triangle and the photos of the villages were sent back through satellite. You only have three hours. You need to remember all the information here within three hours. Three hours later, you’ll have to answer our questions.","\"The nine of them will stay. If you have any questions, you can ask any of them immediately.\"","That night, Ye Jian sat in the conference room in Cheli City. Nine experienced police officers accompanied her to remember the information on the drug chain business. At the same time, she needed to remember a large number of suspicious people and be able to identify the person in the photo immediately... She had to remember all this in a short amount of time."]},{"number":4663,"title":"Chapter 4663: Comrade Xia","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was currently studying important information in Cheli city of Yun Province. After completing his mission, Xia Jinyuan found out that his girlfriend was sent by Major General Yang to Yun Province for a mission.","Xia Jinyuan, whose eyes were bloodshot, sat in Major General Yang’s office in casual clothes and waited for him to come back.","His mission this time was to join forces with the Russian special forces, the Signal Flag. The person he worked with was none other than Luke, who had destroyed Cobra with him. The two of them once again joined forces to blow up an underground nuclear bomb in a certain Western country. After the bomb was blown up, the two of them immediately left and went home.","The first thing Xia Jinyuan did when he returned to the country was not to return to the military unit. He had gotten some information and needed to submit it to the military. Then, the military would pass it to the relevant research department to see if they could extract any useful information from this information.","Major General Yang was having a video conference with an armored regiment of the army. When he knew that Xia Jinyuan, who was supposed to return to the base, was waiting for him in his office, he immediately knew that his proudest subordinate must have something important to report to him.","The meeting started at 1:30 pm and ended at 4:00 pm. Major General Yang packed the information on his desk and hurriedly said a few words to the general who participated in the meeting. Then, he rushed to his office.","Xia Jinyuan, who arrived at the military headquarters at around 2:00 pm, was too tired. As he waited, he simply lay on the couch in the office to rest. He slept until Major General Yang’s meeting ended.","The lock of the door was twisted. The young soldier sleeping on the couch opened his eyes. A cold and sharp look flashed past his eyes. When he got up, the cold and sharp look disappeared into the depths of his eyes.","\"Are you asleep?\"","Major General Yang pushed the door open and saw Xia Jinyuan’s bloodshot eyes. Smiling, he walked in. \"Do you want to continue sleeping? I still have a few documents to deal with.\"","He wasn’t teasing Xia Jinyuan. He was suggesting that Xia Jinyuan sleep for a while more.","When they went overseas for high-risk missions, they would have to be vigilant 24/7. They wouldn’t let themselves fall asleep easily.","Xia Jinyuan’s mission this time was special. It was impossible for him to have a good rest.","Xia Jinyuan, who had sat up, stood up and poured himself a glass of cold water. The cold water flowed into his throat, and the cold touch cleared his mind.","\"I slept for two hours. It’s about time,\" he replied in a hoarse voice. \"I got some information from the underground database, and it’s all related to big bombs. I took it out to see if it’s useful to our country.\"","Some developed countries in the West had military reserves that were far stronger than China’s. It was the same for firearms and weapons. If not, how could they be called developed countries? China was still a developing country.","Major General Yang’s expression turned serious. \"Was there a problem?\"","\"No.\" Xia Jinyuan took off his jacket and tore open the inside. The information he took back from the underground warehouse was all in a small chip he took out. \"Let the relevant departments take a look. It’ll probably be useful.\"","Major General Yang took the chip and nodded solemnly. \"Okay, thank you for your hard work.\"","\"It was a little tough, but since you agreed to my request, it was still worth it.\" Xia Jinyuan yawned without caring about his image. He saw the stiffness on Major General Yang’s face. He was only halfway through his yawn when he held himself back. \"Your expression tells me that the matter I needed you to do... has fallen through?\"","It wasn’t a question. It was an affirmative statement."]},{"number":4664,"title":"Chapter 4664: Pass","paragraphs":["Facing his subordinate’s cold gaze, Major General Yang sat down and opened the thermos beside the table. He took a sip of warm water to calm himself down. Then, he said calmly, \"I wanted Little Ye to spend her winter vacation at home this year too, but she’s needed on a mission.\"","\"What mission?\" Xia Jinyuan frowned. His handsome face darkened. He had never made any requests to the military. This time, he just hoped that his little fox could accompany Old Master Fu during her last winter vacation before joining the Xueyu unit.","Before he left, Major General Yang nodded and agreed. In the end, he said that the little fox went on a mission.","His hoarse voice was like thick ice cutting across the ground, bringing with it waves of chill. \"What mission does she need to do? Our team’s mission?\"","\"This is a secret. You don’t have the right to know. Also, Little Ye isn’t an official member of the Xueyu unit. You don’t have the right to know where she went.","\"Alright, I’ll pass the chip to the relevant departments immediately. You look tired. Go back and rest first. I still have things to deal with. If you’re fine...\"","Opening the drawer, Major General Yang took out his car keys and threw them on his desk. \"These are my car keys. Help yourself.\"","He was in a hurry to send Xia Jinyuan away.","It couldn’t be helped!","How could he not understand the Xia family’s brat and his soldiers?","If Xia Jinyuan continued asking, Major General Yang might not be able to win against this soldier!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t take his car keys immediately. He placed his hands on the side of the desk and slowly leaned toward Major General Yang. He looked at his old leader with a sharp gaze. His dark eyes were filled with a coldness that made Major General Yang’s heart tremble.","Jingle!","The sound of the car keys dragging across the desk made Major General Yang’s eyelids jump. Before he could say anything rude, the young man finally picked up the car keys and left with a faint smile.","Major General Yang didn’t tell him what the mission was, so Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the right to ask. Major General Yang also said that Ye Jian hadn’t officially become a member of the Xueyu unit. He didn’t have the right to know where she went, and that wasn’t wrong.","Hence, Xia Jinyuan, who knew that it was the duty of soldiers to obey orders, didn’t probe further even though he found Major General Yang’s words stifling.","He wasn’t her captain?","When June came next year, he would not only be her captain but also her man!","Xia Jinyuan had handed over the information in his hand. He didn’t even sleep when he was doing the mission outside. He drove Major General Yang’s personal car to his bachelor apartment in the capital city to replenish his sleep. As for where his little fox went... he would find out soon.","The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit often went out for high-intensity missions. After they came back, if they didn’t have any other missions to take on or important things to deal with, they would usually have three days of adjustment leave to ensure that the soldiers could relax and return to their usual state.","Xia Jinyuan was indeed very tired. He fell onto the bed that he hadn’t slept in for a long time. Within three minutes, the young soldier fell asleep.","Ye Jian, who was far away in Yun Province, had completed her last disguise test. From the Cheli City bus station onward, she met three waves of narcotics police officers checking cars. No one recognized her as a military school student. They just thought she was a girl who was dressed refreshingly, spoke gently, and even had a clean temperament."]},{"number":4665,"title":"Chapter 4665: Half Sad And Half Happiness","paragraphs":["The bus passed through the checkpoint and slowly drove out of Cheli City to the border of the two countries. After driving for about 500 meters, Ye Jian asked the driver to stop the car. She said that she needed to fetch her passport from the hotel. The driver used the excuse that the bus wouldn’t wait for anyone and stepped on the accelerator after letting her off.","Ye Jian slowly walked toward the checkpoint. On the other hand, Captain Deng’s expression was dark as he stared coldly at the two narcotics officers who got onto the bus to check just now. He stared until the legs of the two narcotics officers trembled. \"Just now, did you confirm that there were no suspicious people or items on the bus?\"","There were three consecutive waves of narcotics police officers, but they didn’t manage to find the military school student who was disguised and hiding drugs on the bus. It would be strange if Captain Deng’s expression was normal!","Today, Captain Deng seriously suspected that his subordinates weren’t in the right state of mind. Or rather, they just passed their time casually when they saw that the other party was beautiful!","Ye Jian didn’t stop when she walked past the checkpoint. She only glanced at Captain Deng from the corners of her eyes. He was reprimanding someone. Her footsteps were a little hurried, but her expression was calm as she walked past the checkpoint.","It was definitely inconvenient for her to interact with Captain Deng outside. She walked for about 500 meters and reached a cafe that Captain Deng had designated. She ate some cake while waiting for Captain Deng and the rest to come over.","The two narcotics officers at the checkpoint who didn’t find anything suspicious were reprimanded by their captain until they couldn’t even raise their heads. They really didn’t notice that there was a beautiful young lady on the bus. They also searched carefully and didn’t notice any passengers with strange facial expressions. They checked the luggage that they thought was suspicious as well. The sniffer dog didn’t find anything wrong either. Why did their captain insist that there was someone suspicious on the bus?","\"Captain, continuing to scold us like this isn’t a solution. Let us chase after the bus and check again to find the suspicious person.\"","The squad leader at the checkpoint reminded the captain softly. Since they knew that there was a suspicious person on the bus, what was the use of scolding them here?","They should run over and catch the suspicious person first before getting reprimanded.","Captain Deng snorted heavily. What was there to chase after? She had already gotten off the bus!","His cold gaze swept past the several narcotics police officers standing in front of him. He said in a deep voice, \"This is the last border checkpoint for drug dealers who leave our country. If you’re lax with your work, you’ll be giving them a chance to bring drugs into our country! All of you must check carefully. You must not let go of any suspicious targets, and you can’t let them in casually! Do you hear me?!\"","\"Yes!\"","Several narcotics police officers straightened their backs as they were criticized by their captain. They were the last guards at the border of the country. It was their job to not let go of any suspicious targets!","Captain Deng didn’t say anything else. He glanced in the direction of the cafe and turned to his subordinates who had been reprimanded by him. \"There was a comrade in disguise on the bus just now. She had suspicious items on her. No one noticed her or suspected her identity. Our reconnaissance ability needs to be strengthened!\"","They weren’t the only ones who didn’t notice her. The two groups of narcotics officers from before didn’t notice her either. Captain Deng felt uncomfortable when he thought about how the three groups of people didn’t notice Ye Jian.","He was both happy and worried.","He was happy that... a female soldier had finally passed all the assessments. They had finally found a spy who was most suitable to enter the core area of the Golden Triangle. He was worried since the three groups of narcotics police officers didn’t find anything suspicious about her. Could it be that many more suspicious targets had escaped under their eyes?"]},{"number":4666,"title":"Chapter 4666: Wait For My Good News","paragraphs":["Due to Ye Jian’s successful disguise, the narcotics police’s assessment and training were strengthened again. It was more difficult than before. Of course, their skills improved by leaps and bounds. Later on,drug dealers no longer dared to transport drugs through Cheli City.","Captain Deng saw Ye Jian in the cafe. He looked at the military school student who was eating cake pastries leisurely with mixed feelings. He suppressed his complicated emotions and walked in.","When the waiter inside saw this, he retracted his gaze slightly and nodded at the captain as a greeting.","The cafe was a secret spot of the narcotics police in Celi City. If there was any news, the informant would first pass it to the narcotics police through the cafe. This would ensure the safety of the informant and allow the narcotics police to collect the news as soon as possible.","\"You’re very impressive. You successfully disguised yourself under the eyes of three groups of officers,\" Captain Deng sat down and said. There was admiration in his eyes. \"Little Ye, you’ve passed our assessment. Tonight, we’ll send you to a place. Whether you can be targeted by the drug dealers depends on you.","\"We’ll wait for your good news outside.\"","Ye Jian put down her spoon and wiped the corners of her mouth with a tissue. She smiled and said, \"Captain Deng, wait for my good news.\"","\"Yes, I think we’ll definitely be able to hear good news from you. After all, you’re much more outstanding than the previous few. To be honest, a female SWAT officer came from the capital city the day before yesterday. She’s already the most outstanding policewoman I’ve seen, but she didn’t pass the disguise test. Hence, before you came, I didn’t have any hope. I almost rejected you.\"","Captain Deng spoke in a low voice. There was a faint smile in his voice. He seemed to be comforting himself and Ye Jian.","\"Let’s go. We’ll go back to the team and prepare. I can send you off tonight.\"","He stood up. Without waiting for Ye Jian, he pushed the door open and left.","He was afraid that if he chatted with her for a while longer, he... would make the decision not to let her go over.","Ye Jian was stunned for a moment as she looked at the back view of the person who left quickly. Then, she reacted. A faint smile appeared on her face.","Captain Deng was a soft-hearted narcotics captain.","When she reached the brigade and walked past the corridor that she walked through last night, Ye Jian suddenly stopped in her tracks. She looked at the woman walking toward her with surprise in her eyes.","Zhou Niannian!","She actually met Zhou Niannian, whom she had not seen for a long time.","Could it be...","Ye Jian widened her eyes slightly. She looked at Captain Deng beside her and then at Zhou Niannian, who had also stopped in her tracks. He obviously recognized her too. Could it be that... the female SWAT officer Captain Deng mentioned was Zhou Niannian?","\"Do you know each other?\"","How could Captain Deng not notice something amiss? He even got to the main point.","\"Yes, she’s an acquaintance.\" Ye Jian nodded. The surprise in her eyes turned into a smile. \"She’s indeed a very powerful female SWAT officer. She fights well.\"","Captain Deng, who received confirmation, smiled too. \"Birds of a feather flock together. Both of you are amazing. We admire you.\"","Zhou Niannian, who recognized Ye Jian, blinked and walked over quickly.","As it turned out, the more powerful female soldier they mentioned was Ye Jian. Hahahaha, Ye Jian was indeed better than her. It was normal for her to lose to her!","Ye Jian also walked toward her quickly. The two women, who had only met once but inexplicably hit it off, reunited in a distant border city. Even though they had not seen each other for more than a year, they could recognize each other immediately and remember each other’s names."]},{"number":4667,"title":"Chapter 4667: Their Regiments’ Favorites","paragraphs":["Captain Deng and his colleagues didn’t expect the two girls who they thought highly of to know each other. But they had given up on one and chosen another. Captain Deng and the rest felt a little awkward.","Fortunately, Zhou Niannian and Ye Jian were magnanimous and didn’t notice Captain Deng’s awkwardness. The two of them hugged each other warmly. There was no unfamiliarity at all. It was as if they were best friends who had reunited after so many years. They were very excited.","Ye Jian would leave Cheli City tonight. Although she had passed all the assessments of the Narcotics Brigade, Captain Deng was still worried. He was afraid that Ye Jian would feel burdened. Now that he saw that the two girls were on good terms, he might as well let them go to the side and have a private conversation.","He smiled at Zhou Niannian and said, \"Little Zhou, accompany Little Ye. She arrived in Yun Province yesterday and hasn’t rested until now. Accompany her and let her sleep for a while if necessary.\"","It was already five o’clock in the evening of the next day. It was time to rest. However, Little Ye, who had passed the assessment, didn’t look tired at all. She was so energetic that he wondered if he was getting old and not as energetic as before.","After staying up for a day and a night, he wanted to go back to his office and lie down.","Zhou Niannian held Ye Jian’s arm and smiled sweetly. \"Captain Deng, don’t worry. Leave it to me. I’ll accompany her and let her have a good sleep.\"","Ye Jian looked at the bruise on Zhou Niannian’s face that hadn’t dissipated. The bruise on her left cheek was swollen. Seeing this, Ye Jian’s heart ached.","Zhou Niannian wasn’t as lucky as Ye Jian. Although she passed the combat assessment, her face was bruised and swollen. Two days ago, she couldn’t even speak properly. The corner of her mouth was so swollen that she looked like a hamster hiding food in its cheeks. It was a little difficult for her to speak.","She didn’t dare to show her face until today. Before, her face was so swollen that she was too embarrassed to go out.","The few narcotics officers who participated in the assessment saw later on that she was a pretty girl. However, they had caused her pretty face to be bruised and swollen. They felt very bad and took turns to take care of her to reduce the guilt in their hearts.","There was nothing they could do. They had to beat her up. If they went easy on her, they would feel sorry for the policewoman who came all the way here to support them.","Zhou Niannian, who was lying on the bed, smiled and said, \"They might look fierce, but they’re actually quite cute. When they saw that I was beaten up, they lined up and took turns apologizing to me. Later on, Captain Deng appeared and scolded everyone he saw.","\"Tsk, Captain Deng is really protective. I was already beaten up by them, but he quickly took the initiative to reprimand them as he was worried that I’d make things difficult for his people.","\"But I won’t expose them. How can I blame them for this? It’s a matter of life and death. Who would dare to joke about it? Even if they play tricks, I can’t blame them.","\"I was sent by the team to provide support. I’m not going on a sightseeing trip. I only have one life. How can I treat it casually?\"","Zhou Niannian was a chatterbox. She was good at fighting and resisting, and she was the only policewoman who followed the male SWAT team on city missions. Hence, she was quite favored in the team.","Her situation was similar to Ye Jian. They were both their regiment’s favorites.","Zhou Niannian was outgoing, eloquent, smart, and likable. Who wouldn’t like such a girl?","Ye Jian liked her very much.","\"Yesterday afternoon, I even asked to try again. The comrade who brought me food stammered and told me that the military sent a female soldier over.","\"But I didn’t expect it to be you. At that time, I felt a little regretful and wanted to give it a try. Now that I’ve seen you, I’ve completely given up. I can’t compare to you.\"","Zhou Niannian spoke softly. Ye Jian, who was lying on the same bed, closed her eyes and listened quietly."]},{"number":4668,"title":"Chapter 4668: Little Plan","paragraphs":["Zhou Niannian’s voice was different from Ye Jian’s. Ye Jian’s voice was clear and cold. It made people feel that she was a cold girl.","Zhou Niannian was different. Her voice was like a bell, like a cool autumn wind. It was very comfortable to listen to. Others didn’t dislike her for talking too much. Instead, they hoped that she could say more as she had the ability to make people feel more comfortable.","Ye Jian liked to hear her voice. It contained a kind of happiness that was contagious. It was the power of a child who grew up in a happy family. It made the people around her unable to help but get close to her.","If her cousin had such a girl by his side, his life would definitely not be as cold.","The reason why Old Master Fu liked Niannian at a glance and told her that he hoped that she would become his granddaughter-in-law was probably because he hoped that Niannian’s happiness would infect Li Jinnian.","However, how could they let the two of them, who had no contact with each other, work together and spend the rest of their lives together?","Ye Jian listened quietly and kept thinking about it. Although she felt that her cousin, Li Jinnian, was very compatible with Zhou Niannian, she wasn’t unreasonable just because she liked her.","If the two of them could get together, everyone would be happy. If they couldn’t get together, it could only mean that they weren’t fated. The other half of their lives didn’t belong to each other.","She would ask her cousin for his opinion first before asking Niannian. She needed to know if the two of them had any impression of each other.","They should have an impression of each other. After all, Zhou Niannian was the first policewoman who treated Li Jinnian as a suspicious person and even searched his body forcefully.","There was such a huge misunderstanding before. It was impossible that they didn’t have any impression of it.","She kept thinking about it and got lost in her thoughts. She didn’t even notice that Zhou Niannian was asking her questions. She only came back to her senses when Zhou Niannian touched her.","\"Do you want to sleep? Why don’t you sleep for a while?\" Zhou Niannian, who wasn’t sleepy, saw that Ye Jian hadn’t replied to her for a long time. After nudging her, she regretted disturbing Ye Jian’s sleep. \"Hurry up and sleep. I’m afraid you’ll have to leave at night.\"","She passed the assessment too. In the end, she lost in the disguise test. Hence, Zhou Niannian knew very well where Ye Jian would go next. She also knew what danger Ye Jian would face next. That was why she asked Ye Jian if she was afraid.","Ye Jian, who didn’t hear her question clearly, opened her eyes. She, who was lying flat, turned her head and turned to Zhou Niannian, who was also lying flat. She said, \"I’m sorry. I was thinking about something just now. I don’t want to sleep. What did you ask me?\"","\"You don’t want to sleep?\" Zhou Niannian turned her head too. Then, she tilted her body toward Ye Jian. The two of them looked at each other at a close distance without any awkwardness. \"Don’t lie to me. Captain Deng told me to let you sleep.\"","Ye Jian laughed. \"I’m not lying to you. I’m not sleepy for the time being. At the very least, I’ll answer your questions before sleeping.\"","\"That’s fine too.\" Zhou Niannian smiled. Her beautiful eyes were bright, and there was no gloominess in them as she stared at Ye Jian. The smile on her face disappeared quietly. \"Ye Jian, are you afraid? If you go to such a place, you might never come back. Aren’t you afraid?\"","When she asked this, her expression was especially serious. There was deep worry in her eyes. She didn’t want to see her good friend in danger.","Ye Jian couldn’t answer immediately.","After thinking for a while, Ye Jian replied in a low voice, \"Even if I say that I’m not afraid, you wouldn’t believe me. How can I not be afraid? Fear is the most normal reaction in a person. I’m no exception.\""]},{"number":4669,"title":"Chapter 4669: Friend","paragraphs":["Zhou Niannian, who was waiting for her reply, stood up immediately. She said anxiously, \"Then you—\"","Ye Jian didn’t let her continue. She raised her hand and patted her shoulder lightly. \"Don’t be agitated. Lie down and listen to me.\"","Ye Jian’s words made Zhou Niannian want to say something, but she should lie down obediently and listen to Ye Jian first.","\"What’s the use of being afraid? If I were afraid, I wouldn’t have come. Niannian, did you see the Wall of Heroes?\"","The Wall of Heroes... Zhou Niannian’s pupils constricted slightly. Then, she nodded slowly.","She saw it. The first time she saw it, she couldn’t move her feet. Those black and white photos were the strongest resistance against the darkness. Countless seniors sacrificed their lives to fight against the darkness to resist its invasion. Even if they weren’t around anymore, their fighting spirit and determination were passed down.","The living narcotics police officers were stepping into the shoes of those who had passed.","\"This is a long and endless journey. You and I are the same. When we stepped on this path, we were destined to fight and be brave. There’s no turning back.","\"I’m afraid too. I’m afraid that I’ll fall behind on the journey. I’m afraid that I’ll lose the chance to fight alongside my comrades. I’m afraid that I’ll completely disappear before I even start clearing any obstacles.","\"Niannian, I have to be afraid. Only by being afraid will I know how precious my life is. Only by being afraid will I know that I have to come back alive. I don’t want to fall behind halfway. I don’t want to only have a photo to tell others what my journey was.","\"I want to continue walking until I can’t carry a gun anymore. If we don’t attack the enemy, we’ll really reach the end of our lives.\"","Her hand was held by another hand that was not soft but powerful. Ye Jian held her hand back. The two hands, which were smaller than a man’s, held each other tightly. Their fingers were slender, but they contained a power that many men couldn’t muster.","Zhou Niannian could relate to what Ye Jian said. Yes, she was afraid of danger too. However, just like what Ye Jian said, she was even more afraid of falling behind halfway. She was more afraid of not being able to fight through all the obstacles with her comrades. She didn’t want the darkness to destroy the peace of society.","She would always remember the oath she took on the first day she entered the police academy and the first day she was assigned to the SWAT team.","\"I swear that I’m willing to become a police officer of China. I will devote myself to the noble cause of public security for the people. I will firmly be loyal to the party, serve the people, enforce the law justly, and be disciplined. I will always be the builder and defender of the socialist cause with Chinese characteristics. I will work hard to maintain the stability of society, promote social justice, and ensure that the people live and work in peace!\"","Her goal and direction had already been decided. The journey was still ongoing. How could she fall behind?","Under the slightly thick cotton blanket, two slender hands held each other tightly. They had a common language, a common goal, and a common direction. That was why they could lie on the same bed without any sense of unfamiliarity after meeting just twice.","Ye Jian smiled as she looked at the girl with a solemn facial expression. Her clear voice was frighteningly calm. Slowly, she continued, \"It’s not a bad thing to be afraid. On the contrary, it’s a good thing. Think about it. Because we’re afraid, we won’t go astray, and we won’t lose ourselves.\""]},{"number":4670,"title":"Chapter 4670: Whetstone","paragraphs":["Zhou Niannian could already hear blood coursing through her body. Her eyes were shining like the stars in the sky.","\"This is the first time I’ve heard such an explanation of ’fear’. There’s no contradiction at all. That’s because you’re right. Sometimes, fear is a good thing. It won’t let us go astray or lose ourselves. That’s why we’re loyal.\"","She spoke in a low voice. She could deeply relate to Ye Jian’s words.","After saying the most important thing, Ye Jian relaxed her breathing and slowly closed her eyes. Her voice gradually softened. \"To me, even if I’m afraid, it’s not a big deal. Fear allows us to find a powerful whetstone in danger. It’s a cornerstone to train us to become stronger day by day. We can’t lose the cornerstone. With it, our foundation will be more stable.","\"There’s nothing to be afraid of. The people who should really be afraid are those evil ones who do no good and only bring harm to the people around them.\"","After saying so much, she seemed a little tired and sleepy.","\"Our defeat isn’t caused by an external factor. What really defeats us is fear. If you want to win, you have to use your tenacious willpower and powerful self to defeat fear.","\"I want to sleep for a while. Niannian, it was very fun chatting with you. It made me very relaxed. I’ll sleep first... Good night.\"","The sky outside had already darkened. Although the winter in Yun Province was warmer than in the mainland, winter was winter. The sun shone for a shorter time, and the temperature was much lower. Lying on the warm bed and chatting with a like-minded friend, the moment was beautiful enough to isolate them from all the troubles outside. There was peace now.","Ye Jian’s breathing gradually evened out. Zhou Niannian gradually closed her eyes. She wasn’t sleepy. She just wanted to sleep with Ye Jian for a while.","They were walking on an endless path that was filled with thorns. It was a path that could only be split open with a weapon in their hands. They never thought of turning back. They only wanted to continue walking. Even if they died early, they would have no regrets.","The room that wasn’t lit up became darker. Zhou Niannian, who was thinking about something, fell asleep too. A narcotics officer stopped outside the door. He wanted to raise his hand and knock on the door to send the food in, but he was stopped by Captain Deng. Captain Deng waved his hand, indicating that he didn’t have to worry about the girls who never come out.","He wanted to let them talk and sleep for a while. In a few hours, it would be time for the two of them to separate.","Time ticked by, and the sky got darker. The clock was pointing at eight o’clock. The alarm that was set rang. The man on the bed stretched out his beautiful and sexy arm from under the blanket to turn off the alarm. Then, he got up from the bed and walked toward the bathroom in his slippers.","From washing up to changing clothes, he did them according to the military unit’s standards as that had become a habit. Within three minutes, Xia Jinyuan was done tidying up. He was already standing by the shoe cabinet at the entrance and changing his shoes.","He needed to go out and find something to eat. He was hungry.","He wore a medium-length coat and changed into black casual leather shoes. A man who rarely wore casual clothes walked out in casual clothes. He was tall and handsome. The moment he entered the elevator, the young woman inside couldn’t control her gaze and kept glancing at him.","He had a good figure and was tall. In addition, his face was extremely handsome. He was wearing a very selective but elegant mid-length coat. Of course, she had to admire him!"]},{"number":4671,"title":"Chapter 4671: Worry","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan rarely wore casual clothes. Usually, as long as he wore casual clothes, many would turn their gaze to him regardless if they were men or women.","When the elevator descended to the sixth floor, two young girls entered. The expressionless Xia Jinyuan pursed his lips.","He felt that the four girls in the elevator kept glancing at him like X-rays. When did so many young girls live in this most expensive studio apartment building in the capital city?","Was it because... it was close to the college town?","After taking one ride in the elevator, Comrade Xia Jinyuan planned to sell his bachelor pad.","The two girls standing at the farthest end pushed each other. Just as the two girls who came in from the sixth floor were about to take action, one of the girls bit her lower lip and walked to Xia Jinyuan’s side from the back. She revealed her most beautiful smile and started hitting on him. \"Hey, handsome. Do you recognize me?\"","Xia Jinyuan took a step back. With a cold facial expression, he looked arrogant. He glanced coldly at the young lady whose face was covered with many layers of foundation. His thin lips moved slightly. \"I’m not interested.\"","\"Pfft...\"","The two girls at the back laughed out loud without reservation. It was so funny? The girl was worried that others would hit on him first, so she quickly beat them to it.","In the end...","How embarrassing!","The girl who hit on him was so embarrassed that her face turned pale. When she heard people laughing at her, she glared at the guy who was merciless. Then, she glared at the two girls who were laughing at her.","Although her companion was also embarrassed, she was worried that an even more awkward scene would take place. She quickly pulled her companion away. The girl who was about to flare up snorted coldly. \"You’re not gentlemanly at all. So what if you’re handsome?\"","When the elevator reached the first floor, Xia Jinyuan walked out as if he didn’t hear anything. Did he need to be gentlemanly to someone with such obvious intentions?","Pfft.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t expect to get hit on in the elevator. He also didn’t expect to face Madam Xiao after leaving the elevator. By then, it was too late for him to turn around and avoid her.","Madam Xiao, who was holding a thermos in her hand, saw Xia Jinyuan too. She was pleasantly surprised, as if she couldn’t believe that she would meet her only son here.","\"Yuan!\"","Madam Xiao, who was walking over in her high heels, had a look of disbelief on her face. At first, she was walking elegantly and slowly. Now, she was walking quickly. She was surprised and happy. Her emotions showed on her face.","Compared to the surprise on her face, Xia Jinyuan seemed exceptionally calm. \"Hello.\"","He was polite and distant. Madam Xiao’s expression darkened. Even the smile on her face became forced.","\"Do you live here?\" she asked carefully. She wanted Xia Jinyuan to talk to her, but she was afraid that her only son would not give her the chance and leave.","She hadn’t seen her son for a long time. There wasn’t even any news of him. When she contacted Old Xia, she only ever got one answer—he was busy. Her son was very busy and didn’t have time to come out.","Just like a long time ago, her former husband was also always very busy and couldn’t come back. He was so busy that she received very few letters and phone calls.","\"Do you have anything to do now? Can you accompany me?\" Madam Xiao, who didn’t receive an answer, asked timidly. \"I haven’t seen you in a long time. I want to spend some time with you. Is that okay?\"","This time, they met unintentionally. But what about the next time? Wouldn’t it take another year or two for them to meet again?"]},{"number":4672,"title":"Chapter 4672: Close","paragraphs":["Madam Xiao looked at her son, who was already a head taller than her and had a handsome face. Her heart was already filled with bitterness. In her life... she owed a lot to her only son.","When she came back to her senses and wanted to make it up to him, she suddenly realized that the son she abandoned no longer needed her concern, let alone motherly love.","However... she couldn’t help but want to care about him. She wanted to try her best to make up for her mistake.","\"Yuan...\"","With tears in her eyes, Madam Xiao opened her mouth again.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the time and then at Madam Xiao, who was about to cry. He frowned slightly and said calmly, \"I’m going out to eat now. I have half an hour to spare.\"","\"Alright, alright. Half an hour! Half an hour is fine. I know a good restaurant outside. The environment is very quiet, and the dishes are very good. Let’s eat there.\" She was afraid that Xia Jinyuan would find it troublesome, so she immediately explained, \"It’s really not far. It’s a five-minute walk. I’m a frequent customer there. I can ask them to serve the dishes in advance. It won’t take up your time.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s agreement made Madam Xiao so happy that tears flowed out of her eyes. This was her son. He was her only concern for the rest of her life. She made so many mistakes when she was young. Now, she just wanted to make it up to him.","In the past, he always ignored her. Now, he had agreed to have a meal with her. Did this mean that her son was gradually accepting her care?","Madam Xiao raised her head and gently wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes. There was a deep look on her face. Other than getting her son’s forgiveness as soon as possible, she had no other wishes.","The restaurant she mentioned was indeed not far away. Before Xia Jinyuan could sit down, Madam Xiao was already placing the order. After listing four to five dishes, Xia Jinyuan, who had a calm facial expression, knocked on the table with his slender fingers. \"There’s no need for so much.\"","\"These are all the signature dishes of the restaurant. They’re delicious. You can try them all. It doesn’t matter if you can’t finish them. They’re all—\"","\"Madam Xiao.\"","Before she could finish, Xia Jinyuan interrupted her unhurriedly, \"I don’t have much time.\"","His voice was very cold. It was like a bucket of cold water that was poured on Madam Xiao. Madam Xiao, who was overjoyed just a moment ago, froze bit by bit. In the end, her expression turned dark.","\"Okay, it’s only five dishes. I won’t order any more.\" After closing the menu, Madam Xiao asked the waiter to serve her the dishes as soon as possible. Her excited mood gradually became heavy. After sitting down, Madam Xiao saw the thermos that she had just placed on the dining table. A gentle and solemn smile appeared on her face again. \"Do you want to try my soup first? It’s still hot. Try it first to fill your stomach.\"","As she spoke, she opened the thermos. The smell of chicken soup floated over. Xia Jinyuan glanced at it without interest. \"No need. I don’t have the habit of drinking soup. Keep it for yourself.\"","It was a straightforward rejection. Madam Xiao, who froze, silently tightened the thermos lid again. Her son didn’t like the chicken soup she made either...","Just as she was about to say something, the phone in her handbag rang. Madam Xiao said softly, \"I’ll take this call.\" She lowered her head and silently wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes.","She thought that this meal could help them repair their mother-son relationship. Unexpectedly... she was thinking too much.","She took out her phone from her bag and saw who the caller was. Madam Xiao glanced at Xia Jinyuan and hesitated to answer."]},{"number":4673,"title":"Chapter 4673: Shameless","paragraphs":["\"Is it inconvenient to answer? Then I’ll go out first.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting three empty chairs away, pretended to get up. Madam Xiao panicked and hurriedly said, \"No, no. I’ll take it now. I’ll take it now.\"","She hurriedly picked up the call. A beautiful woman’s voice sounded from the other end. \"Aunt Xiao, why aren’t you here yet? Are you lost? I’ll come and fetch you now.\"","\"Jiayi, I have something urgent to attend to and can’t come over for the time being. Don’t wait for me.\"","It was Du Jiayi, who had returned to the capital city. She couldn’t stand Madam Li’s nagging every day and moved back to the bachelor apartment she bought when she was studying in university. When she returned to the country a few days ago, she only stayed at the Du family’s house for two nights. She was annoyed by Madam Li, so she used work as an excuse to escape again.","The soup Madam Xiao wanted to serve Xia Jinyuan was actually for Du Jiayi. It was indeed not meant for Xia Jinyuan.","The private room was very quiet. The voice from the cell phone could be heard faintly. Xia Jinyuan smiled slightly, and a hint of mockery flashed past his eyes.","Madam Xiao was still ’kind’ and considerate. Of course, she was only like this with other people.","\"Jiayi, be good. I’ll come and see you later. I’ll make you whatever you want to eat. If you’re uncomfortable, lie on the bed. Don’t force yourself to work anymore. No matter how busy you are with work, you have to take good care of yourself.\"","Du Jiayi, who didn’t get any chicken soup, didn’t throw a tantrum and said sweetly, \"Alright, Aunt Xiao. I forgive you. Remember to call me when you’re done. I’ll come and pick you up. If it’s too late, you don’t have to come over, or I’ll get worried.\"","\"Okay, I understand. I’ll hang up first.\"","Madam Xiao spoke gently. Those who didn’t know better would think that the person on the other end of the cell phone was her biological daughter.","Although they were not biologically related, they were not much different, especially in the past two years. She took care of Du Jiayi even more than Madam Li, her biological mother.","Xia Jinyuan was very calm. He always knew that the Madam Xiao in front of him was the most concerned about others. However, she didn’t care much about her own family.","In the past, he would still be sad and resentful. Now, he didn’t feel anything.","They were just strangers. There was no need for him to care.","After ending the call, Madam Xiao put down her phone and explained apologetically, \"I’m sorry, Yuan. Jiayi isn’t feeling well, and I’m a little worried about her.\"","Xia Jinyuan only nodded slightly without expressing any opinion.","It was fine as long as she was happy. Who she was worried about had nothing to do with him.","She probably knew that she shouldn’t mention outsiders. Seeing that Xia Jinyuan’s expression was cold, Madam Xiao forced a smile and tried her best to look natural. \"Her parents are worried since she’s a girl living alone, so they asked me to take care of her. Don’t be angry...\"","\"It’s only right that you do that.\"","In the end, Xia Jinyuan replied politely. After saying that, he poured some tea and drank it slowly.","\"Your father told me that you’re very busy. Yuan, no matter how busy you are, you have to take good care of yourself. You can’t ruin your body just because you’re young.","\"You’re already 28 years old. You should consider finding a girlfriend to take care of you. Find someone with a gentle and demure personality. I think dating a teacher is not bad. She’ll have lots of time. She can go to the military unit to take care of you during the summer and winter holidays.","\"You can’t look for someone too busy. You can’t look for someone in the military unit. Otherwise, in the future, the two of you will be on your own. No matter how strong your relationship is, it’ll fade. Find someone who can spend more time with you.\""]},{"number":4674,"title":"Chapter 4674: Troublesome","paragraphs":["Madam Xiao’s voice was the only sound in the quiet private room. Xia Jinyuan drank his tea and didn’t take her words to heart.","As for finding a girlfriend, heh, there was no need for Madam Xiao to worry.","\"I’m most worried about you exhausting yourself in the military unit. I’ll only feel at ease if someone is around to take care of you. I have to find some time to talk to your father. Let the old madam oversee this. The old madam knows how to read people.","\"If the old madam doesn’t know any good ladies around her, I... I’ll introduce someone to you, okay? I know a few gentle women. I’ll... introduce them to you, okay?\"","At this point, Xia Jinyuan really wanted to laugh, and he did. It was cold and bone-chilling. \"Madam Xiao, you’re worrying too much. In my eyes, you’re just a stranger. Do you think I’ll accept the kindness of a stranger?","\"I’m sorry, but I suspect that you have ulterior motives. I think we should forget about this meal. Enjoy your meal. Excuse me.\"","After he finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan stood up and pushed out the chair. He really didn’t want to eat with Madam Xiao anymore. He couldn’t bear it even if it was half an hour.","He really didn’t understand how Madam Xiao had the audacity to interfere with his marriage in front of him.","Madam Xiao, who was dealt a heavy blow by his words, stood up abruptly with a pained expression. She started to get agitated. \"Yuan, you’re cutting out my heart by saying this! How can you hurt me like this? Yuan, you still haven’t forgiven me, and you still hate me, right?","\"Tell me, what should I do to get your forgiveness? What can I do for you to forgive me and accept me? I know my mistake. I did something stupid when I was young and owe you. Can you give me a chance to fix things?\"","Xia Jinyuan’s expression was a little cold and sharp. However, he endured it and said coldly, \"I thought I had made it clear last time. Madam Xiao, do you really not understand? Or are you faking it?\"","\"Yuan!\"","Her voice sounded broken, filling the room with sorrow.","What did he say the last time? The last time, he said that she shouldn’t disturb him anymore. He didn’t need the concern of a stranger. He didn’t need it anymore.","\"Yuan, I’m your mother. I gave birth to you after ten months of pregnancy. You’re my flesh and blood. How can you be a stranger?","\"I really know her mistake. Tell me what to do to get your forgiveness. Tell me, okay?\"","In the past, Madam Xiao, who was neglected because of her husband’s work, abandoned her young son for love. Now, half of her life had passed in the blink of an eye. When she looked back and realized the mistake she made when she was young, she wanted to fix their broken mother-son relationship. Now, she realized that... it was too difficult.","It was so difficult that she didn’t know how to make things up.","\"I know I’m in the wrong. I really know my mistake now. Yuan, forgive me.\" In the private room, Madam Xiao cried as she spoke heart-wrenchingly. She really knew her mistake, but why... Why was it so difficult for him to forgive her?","This was her son, not her enemy!","Why did he have to be so cruel to her? Why?","Xia Jinyuan left the private room from the other side. Madam Xiao wanted to block him again, but the veins on Xia Jinyuan’s forehead throbbed. He took a deep breath and slowly exhaled. \"Madam Xiao, I didn’t agree to come out for a meal with you to hear these words from you. I just want to tell you to not disturb my life anymore, okay?\""]},{"number":4675,"title":"Chapter 4675: Best Cruelty","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan was cruel. This woman had unrealistic thoughts and even tried to interfere with his personal life... Even if it were a family member, he wouldn’t tolerate it and deal with it.","He would tell the other party clearly that he would be responsible for his life and the path he walked on. He didn’t need anyone to tell him what to do.","He had always known what he wanted to do. He would never allow himself to deviate by half a step. He had his own arrangements and plans. No one could interfere in his future. He would always know what he needed and what he needed to do. He would be responsible for himself.","There was no need for others to guide him and interfere.","Especially Madam Xiao. When she was young, she felt that she had suffered grievances and was neglected by her husband. After giving birth, she lost her freedom and could only focus on raising her child.","She felt like a canary in a golden cage. From the outside, she looked glorious and glamorous, but in reality, she didn’t have any freedom.","Hence, for the sake of freedom, she gave up her identity as a ’canary’ and abandoned her son and husband with a decisive attitude. She threw herself into the so-called embrace of freedom she found with the greatest enthusiasm.","Later on, half of her life was over. The years had gone by, and her freedom gradually lost its luster. The lover who once ignited her passion again was getting further and further away from her. One day, she found a young lover who could bring waves to her peaceful life again...","Finally, the couple who once searched for freedom together and thought that they had found their soulmates, got a divorce certificate and went their separate ways.","Finally, Madam Xiao came back to her senses. She regretted her decision and remembered that she had a son in her country. She felt that she needed to make up for the mistakes she made when she was young, which was why she returned to the country.","She thought that she would definitely be able to make up for the mistakes she made in the past. Just like what Madam Li said when she persuaded her to return to the country, ’The blood between mother and son is thicker than water. How can a son not acknowledge his mother?’","Blood was thicker than water. Who wouldn’t acknowledge their mother... Xia Jinyuan snorted softly and looked at Madam Xiao, whose face was filled with despair. He moved his long legs and left her with the sight of his back view.","As a mother, she could abandon her biological son. Could it be that she expected her son to welcome her back without any grudges?","One day, a three to four-year-old child woke up and realized that he was sleeping in the closet. His mother, whom he loved the most, was having an affair with another man in bed. His mother, whom he loved the most, even abandoned him and ran away later on. At that time, although he was young, he knew that his mother would never come back.","Later on, the grown-up child saw his mother again. He thought that she would run away and never return. He saw her being intimate with another young lady like a mother and daughter. When she saw her real son, she looked at him as if he were a good-for-nothing. She even said those harsh words to him. It was like pail after pail of cold water had poured into the child’s heart. It completely extinguished the last flame of a child’s love for their mother.","From feeling bitter to relieved, it didn’t take much time. It only took about five or six years. Now, it had been more than ten years. That child had already found a partner in life. Motherly love? Heh, there was really no need for that.","Xia Jinyuan, who was striding away, didn’t look back. Even if Madam Xiao fell to the ground and cried until she was sad and desperate, it wouldn’t evoke any pity in him.","If he were to see a stranger cry, he would go and ask if they needed help. To him, Madam Xiao was worse than a stranger."]},{"number":4676,"title":"Chapter 4676: Heartbroken","paragraphs":["Madam Xiao’s cries didn’t bring Xia Jinyuan back to the private room. The waiter who brought the dishes stood at the side in a dilemma. In the end, the manager helped Madam Xiao up from the chair and asked Du Jiayi to bring Madam Xiao home.","The moment Du Jiayi walked out of the elevator and saw the young man standing outside, her pretty face changed drastically, and panic flashed across her eyes.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at her calmly and walked straight into the elevator. When he moved, Du Jiayi, who was standing in the middle of the elevator, subconsciously took a step back. Realizing what she had done, she bit her lower lip in frustration and held her breath as she walked out quickly.","The elevator door closed behind her. Du Jiayi’s gaze landed on the smooth marble floor. She seemed to have thought of something and suddenly turned to look at the closed elevator door.","Xia Jinyuan... Why was he here?","Aunt Xiao said that she had something urgent to attend to. Could it be that... the urgent matter Aunt Xiao mentioned was to meet Xia Jinyuan?","It had only been 15 minutes since she received Aunt Xiao’s call saying that she had something urgent to attend to. The last time, Aunt Xiao said that she hadn’t seen Xia Jinyuan for a long time. She didn’t know where he went. If she saw him just now... why did they only talk for ten minutes?","Du Jiayi met up with Madam Xiao. Before she could ask, she was shocked by the haggard look on Madam Xiao’s face and walked over quickly. \"Aunt Xiao, what’s wrong? Why are you crying?","Madam Xiao, who had been dealt a blow, saw that the young girl in front of her was worried about her. She suddenly raised her hand and gently touched Du Jiayi’s face, revealing a smile that was uglier than her crying face. \"Jiayi, why aren’t you my daughter?\"","\"They’re right. Daughters are their parents’ sweethearts. Even you know how to care about me and worry about me, but...\"","Tears flowed out of her eyes. Madam Xiao was crying and laughing at the same time. Du Jiayi was so anxious that she held the hand that was stroking her face. \"Aunt Xiao, stop crying. What happened? Tell me quickly.\"","She glanced at the dining table from the corner of her eye. The untouched food confirmed her thoughts. She frowned and swallowed her saliva before daring to ask softly, \"Did you meet him? Did he make you angry again?","\"Don’t be angry, Aunt Xiao. He’s not worth your anger.\"","Du Jiayi was deeply afraid of Xia Jinyuan. She was so afraid that she didn’t dare to name him. She only dared to refer to him by ’him’.","Madam Xiao cried and smiled. Her elegant demeanor was gone. \"Even you know that I’m angry, but my son doesn’t. He clearly heard me crying, but he was so heartless that he didn’t even turn around to look at me. Why is he so ruthless?","\"How good would it be if I had a daughter instead? How good would it be if I had a daughter like you, Jiayi? My daughter would definitely be soft-hearted and forgive me, right?","\"How good would it be if he was a daughter? I want a daughter.\"","Madam Xiao, who was over 50 years old, cried like a helpless child. Du Jiayi kept coaxing her, but it was useless. In the end, Du Jiayi had no choice but to ask Madam Li to help.","Madam Li rushed over just as Xia Jinyuan was knocking on Major General Yang’s door. At 10:00 pm, the vibrance of the day gradually dissipated. The silence of the night arrived quietly. The military compound was quieter than anywhere else. There weren’t even any night insects. There was only the sound of the north wind."]},{"number":4677,"title":"Chapter 4677: Finding Her","paragraphs":["The knock on the door at 10:00 pm was especially abrupt. The sentinel checked Xia Jinyuan’s identification document before letting him in. Xia Jinyuan didn’t press the doorbell and just knocked. Major General Yang, who was talking to his son in the room, was stunned.","\"Why didn’t you ring the doorbell?\"","The only son of Major General Yang, who was in his first year of university, stood up to open the door. Mrs. Yang, who was cleaning up in the kitchen, wiped her hands and came out. She smiled and said, \"I’ll open the door. You can chat with your father. You father and son haven’t seen each other for a long time. If you don’t talk now, when will you find your next chance?\"","When he heard the knock on the door again, Major General Yang’s expression changed slightly. He stood up and said to his only son, \"I’ll go get it. Help your mom clean up the kitchen.\"","He had probably guessed who it was.","\"Is it a soldier of yours?\" Mrs. Yang stood still and turned to her only son. \"Go back to your room. Don’t disturb your father.\"","Major General Yang, who was walking toward the door, waved his hand. \"No need. I’ll take a walk outside with him. He won’t be entering the house. You guys rest early.\"","He was a little afraid of letting that brat enter his house.","If Little Ye hadn’t been sent on a mission, it wouldn’t have mattered if Xia Jinyuan entered the house to chat with him.","However...","Mrs. Yang never made any decisions regarding Major General Yang’s matters. Hence, when she heard this, she didn’t say much. She only said, \"I wonder how your soldiers can bear with your bad temper.\" Then, she said to her only son, \"Don’t learn from your father in the future.\"","Major General Yang’s only son was 19 years old this year. His name was Yu. He was cultured and refined.","Hearing this, the 19-year-old Yang Yu raised his eyebrows and smiled brightly. \"With my father’s temper, only you and his soldiers can endure it. I can occasionally endure it.\"","He turned and said to Major General Yang, who was about to walk out, \"Dad, wear a coat when you go out. It’s cold. You’re already old. Don’t pretend to be strong of your young soldiers. My mother will be the one who suffers the most if you fall sick.\"","Major General Yang’s expression turned gloomy. Mrs. Yang suppressed her laughter and took a coat from the room. She chased after him. \"Yu is right. You should admit that you’re old. Do you really think that you’re still in your 20s?\"","Major General Yang’s expression darkened. He didn’t want to take the coat. But thinking about it... It was quite cold to walk outside in the middle of the winter. He took the coat. \"Rest early. You don’t have to wait for me.\"","\"Alright, alright. Hurry up and come back.\"","Just like that, Major General Yang was pushed out by his wife.","Since Major General Yang didn’t plan to invite the soldier into his house, Mrs. Yang didn’t open the door personally. She pushed Major General Yang to the entrance and turned around to return to the living room.","The door opened. Major General Yang said directly, \"Did you bring the car here? Leave your keys. You can leave now.\"","In the end, the keys were left behind, but he didn’t leave.","Two hours later, Major General Yang, who was so cold that he was shivering, returned home. When Mrs. Yang heard the door opening, she quickly prepared a cup of ginger tea. When the hot ginger tea entered his stomach, Major General Yang felt his body gradually warming up.","Mrs. Yang’s heart ached when she saw that her husband’s lips had turned purple from the cold. After some time, they finally returned to normal. \"Couldn’t you just talk in your study? Why did you have to go outside? You must be so cold that your bones are frozen. I wonder if you’ll catch a cold tomorrow morning.","\"Next winter, if your soldiers come to our house in the middle of winter, just invite them in. I don’t want to see you suffer like this.\"","Major General Yang never received his subordinates who came to his house personally other than for work. Mrs. Yang was aware of her husband’s character, so she didn’t say much before.","Now that she saw Major General Yang’s lips turning purple from the cold, her heart ached so much that she couldn’t help but say a few more words."]},{"number":4678,"title":"Chapter 4678: Explain","paragraphs":["Major General Yang rubbed his stomach, which was starting to warm up. After a while, he sighed and said, \"Commander Xia’s only son dropped by. He’s a demon incarnate. He never visits unless he needs something. How would I dare to let him in?\"","...","Mrs. Yang wanted to smash the cup in her husband’s face. However, she remembered Major General Yang’s temper. She could only snatch the cup in his hand and glare at him before getting up to leave.","She couldn’t say that it was unfair for him to reject the only son of Commander Xia.","Although she wanted to say it in her heart, she could only suppress it.","At one 1:00 am, G3, who was staying at the base, received a call from his captain, Xia Jinyuan. When he received the call in the middle of the night, G3 thought that it was an urgent mission. After listening to it, G3 was silent for a long time before sighing softly. \"You don’t mean the things you say. Didn’t you ask her to be independent? Why are you the first to object when she really has to go out and be independent?","\"The major general is right. You seem to be very ruthless to Ye Jian. You’re so ruthless that you’d personally teach her a lesson and bring her to the battlefield. But don’t you think that your ruthlessness is only limited to...\"","G3 paused. Xia Jinyuan asked, \"Limited to what? Don’t leave someone hanging. A man should be straightforward.\"","\"F*ck, why are you saying that I’m not a man anymore?\" G3 gritted his teeth and sat down. He planned to talk to him in the dark. \"I’m just wondering if you’ll be able to accept my personal opinion.\"","\"Stop dilly-dallying. Speak.\"","\"Think about it. When are you always so ruthless to Ye Jian? Think about it carefully. I feel that you should be able to guess what I want to say. You can also understand why Major General Yang said that you’re the one who can’t bear to let go.","\"You’re right. Ye Jian has gone out and is acting independently. In the end, you can’t bear to let go... It’s indeed you. I didn’t expect it either. However, thinking about what you’ve done in the past, it’s only normal that you’d act this way.\"","After hearing what G3 said, Xia Jinyuan started to think about the times he was ruthless to Ye Jian.","After thinking for a while, Xia Jinyuan’s expression froze. He seemed to have guessed what G3 wanted to say. He understood why Major General Yang said that he was the one who couldn’t bear to let go.","Every time he was ruthless to Ye Jian, he would always be by her side. Every time Ye Jian went out for combat, he would always be by her side. That meant that he knew that he had to train Ye Jian ruthlessly. Only then could she develop better. Unknowingly, his actions went against his expectations.","\"Do you know what I want to say?\"","G3 broke the short silence. With the captain’s ability, he could think of it easily.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his thin lips slightly and hummed softly. After pondering for a moment, he said, \"That’s true. I told her that besides relying on her own hard work to come back alive, she should become the strongest support of her comrades. I know that very well, but my actions have deviated.","\"Every time I was ruthless to her, I was always around her. I have to reflect on myself.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t relax because of this. Instead, he frowned even more.","He had always thought that he could control his personal emotions and distinguish matters strictly. He had always thought so and always thought that this was what he had been doing.","One could only say that the bystander had the clearest view of the situation."]},{"number":4679,"title":"Chapter 4679: Gentlemen","paragraphs":["Major General Yang realized it and remembered it in his heart. He told Xia Jinyuan at an appropriate time to make him realize that although he treated Ye Jian equally during training, he still subconsciously protected Ye Jian under his wings and hadn’t really let go of her.","That was why he panicked when he knew that she was going on a mission alone. He wasn’t able to help but wanted to carry out a mission with her. He wanted more information about her.","Now that he heard what G3 said, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t come up with a good solution. He needed to calm down and think about it.","\"Rest early. I’ll go back to the base the day after tomorrow.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who wanted to think about it calmly, was about to end the call when G3 sighed and stopped Xia Jinyuan in time. \"You woke me up. I don’t mind enlightening you. After all, there aren’t many chances to enlighten you.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled. He raised his eyebrows and asked with a faint smile, \"It’s not easy for you to get the chance to reprimand me, so you want to get back at me in one go?\"","\"Ha, you’re too narrow-minded.\" G3 smiled too. \"Actually, you don’t have to feel burdened. Although you’ve always been protecting Ye Jian, you still know what you’re doing. You don’t mean to protect Ye Jian.","\"Actually, it’s normal for you to keep Ye Jian under your watch. Besides being your comrade, she’s also your lover. What kind of man won’t protect his lover?","\"It’s in your nature to protect Ye Jian. If you don’t believe me, let me ask you. What would you do if there’s a mission that requires Ye Jian to complete it and no one can do it but her, but it’s very dangerous and she might not be able to come back if she goes? Would you try to think of a second option?\"","\"No.\"","Without any hesitation, Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"There wouldn’t be a second option. Ye Jian is the first option.\"","\"That’s right. You’d definitely do that. We all believe that you’d do that. Hence, it’s normal for you to protect Ye Jian when she’s in front of you. We can understand and accept it.","\"The major general said that because he wanted to remind you to let go when it’s time. The major general won’t hesitate if she needs protection. You’re the one who got flustered over nothing.\"","At first, G3 was still smiling slightly. Gradually, his eyes turned serious. \"Could it be that Ye Jian is already carrying out a mission alone? Is it a high-risk mission? Is it very dangerous? It’s not our team’s mission?\"","Speaking of this, Xia Jinyuan pursed his lips and said in a low voice, \"She’s going undercover to the core of the Golden Triangle, alone. I don’t know what mission it is.\"","At first, he wanted to get more information tonight. Who knew that after two hours of braving the cold wind, Major General Yang’s speech became as stiff as ice. Xia Jinyuan didn’t manage to find out anything more.","Going undercover to the core of the Golden Triangle meant it was naturally related to drug dealers. Why did Ye Jian have to go?","Unless the matter was quite tricky and required someone who was strong in all aspects to step in. If the male soldiers couldn’t do it and they could only let a female soldier complete the mission, Ye Jian, who was outstanding in all aspects, would be the first choice.","G3’s heart sank slightly.","Ye Jian, who was far away in Yun Province, didn’t know that her first undercover mission had already made many people worried.","Ye Jian woke up at two in the morning. Zhou Niannian, who woke up with a start, held her hand tightly and said seriously, \"We’ll wait for you to come back. Please come back safely.\"","Ye Jian, who had completed her disguise, held Zhou Niannian’s hand. She smiled without any fear. \"Don’t worry. I’ll definitely come and look for you. If I can’t find you, I’ll bring my cousin to look for you.\"","It was a test."]},{"number":4680,"title":"Chapter 4680: Deal","paragraphs":["When Ye Jian suddenly mentioned Li Jinnian, a young and cold face flashed past Zhou Niannian’s mind. His black eyes were like cold stars, and his back was as steady as a mountain. She had only seen him once, but her memory of him was so vivid as if it just happened yesterday.","The corners of her lips curled up into a smile. \"Okay, I’ll wait for you to come back and look for me.\"","\"It’s a deal.\"","\"It’s a deal.\"","The two girls high-fived each other and smiled at each other. They were like old friends. There was no need to say anything else.","Captain Deng personally sent Ye Jian to the car. Zhou Niannian couldn’t send her off.","After passing through the corridor around the sniffer dog training ground, Captain Deng reminded her again, \"Remember to protect yourself first. Don’t act tough, and don’t underestimate those drug dealers.\"","\"They move around the border all year round and deal with the narcotics police forces of various countries. Their abilities are not as ordinary as you think sometimes. Don’t underestimate them. Even if it’s a child, your unintentional exposure will be fatal.","\"Don’t trust anyone easily. Before you have a good foundation, don’t walk around casually. They’re a group of drug dealers who would rather kill a thousand innocent people than let anyone off. They won’t listen to any explanations and will only deal with people cruelly in their own way.","\"Talk less. Protecting yourself is the most important thing! Do you understand?\"","Captain Deng spoke for a long time and kept reminding her. He even repeated some words over and over again. He didn’t stop until he reached the car door.","The people who came to fetch Ye Jian were two plain-clothes policemen who often visited the market. They greeted Captain Deng first before introducing themselves to Ye Jian.","After they finished introducing themselves, Captain Deng said to the two plain-clothes police officers in a low voice, \"Before Little Ye leaves, I’ll leave her safety to the two of you. You must protect her!\"","\"Don’t worry, Captain. We understand.\"","The sliding door was pushed open. One of the plain-clothes policemen asked Ye Jian to get in the car. Ye Jian, who was standing in front of the car door and preparing to get in, retracted her right leg and turned to look at Captain Deng. She saluted him solemnly. \"Captain Deng, wait for my good news.\"","\"Okay!\" Captain Deng returned the soldier’s salute and nodded. \"I believe you’ll definitely bring back good news and make a safe return.\"","It was a must-do.","However, safety was the biggest question mark when carrying out high-risk missions.","After the car drove for a distance, Ye Jian turned around and looked at the back of the car. She saw Captain Deng still standing there without moving. He was watching her leave silently.","As the captain of the Narcotics Brigade, Captain Deng couldn’t even remember how many comrades he had sent out for high-risk missions. Every time he sent them off, his mood was the worst. He liked to see his comrades return safely. He didn’t want to see... his comrades closing their eyes forever.","Even after experiencing so many farewells, Captain Deng was still afraid that the scene he didn’t want to see the most would happen.","\"Little Ye, you’re a special forces soldier. Use all your abilities as a special forces soldier. I believe that you’ll definitely be able to return safely!\"","The car that drove away had already disappeared in front of them. Captain Deng, who had almost merged with the night, was still standing there. He only turned around and left slowly when the wind blew and brought with it waves of coldness.","Zhou Niannian had insomnia. She didn’t sleep from 2:00 am until the morning. She didn’t lie on the bed either. She just sat there until dawn.","She found Captain Deng and decided to return to the capital city today. Captain Deng didn’t force her to stay. They had already found the most suitable spy and sent her out. If Zhou Niannian wanted to leave early, she could."]},{"number":4681,"title":"Chapter 4681: Picking Goods","paragraphs":["Zhou Niannian left Yun Province. Ye Jian sat in the car that led to the border until 1:00 pm before arriving at the small city at the border.","Next, it was time to ’pick the goods’. She was the ’goods’ that had to be picked.","The two plain-clothes policemen turned into well-versed traffickers. One of them kept an eye on Ye Jian while the other went to the market outside. About two hours later, they brought back a skinny middle-aged woman in her early 40s with shrewd eyes.","The middle-aged woman looked at Ye Jian as if she were choosing goods. She looked up and down before nodding.","The matter was settled.","Seeing that the matter was settled, the two plain-clothes police officers took a deep breath and secretly gave Ye Jian an ’OK’ sign before leaving the hotel.","It had already been three days since Ye Jian entered a small town under the jurisdiction of the Golden Triangle. On the third day, she carried a bag that was wrapped with a piece of blue cloth and asked around if there was anything she could do and if she could return to China.","Ye Jian, who ’escaped’, started to wander. When she was tired, she would sleep in a corner of the town. When she was hungry, she would ask the townspeople for food and ask how she should leave this place and return to China.","The town was the last town to enter the Golden Triangle. The residents of the town were either drug dealers or grew drugs in the mountains. They were very vigilant against outsiders, especially Ye Jian. It was obvious that she had been deceived into the Golden Triangle and wanted to go home. The people here wouldn’t easily get involved with her.","There were rules in the underworld. Whoever broke the rules would be cutting off their own path of survival. No one would help Ye Jian leave because of pity. Who knew if the unfamiliar girl in the town would call the police when she returned to China?","Chinese people loved to look for the police when they had difficulties!","The town was surrounded by towering mountains. There was only one winding road that led outside, which was the Yellowstone Highway. Ye Jian walked out of the town several times before returning obediently. Some people paid attention to her while others sent news to certain places to see if anyone had escaped recently.","On the morning of the seventh day, Ye Jian finally drove out of the town in a ’kind person’s’ car.","Someone watched the car leave through the dusty glass window. Five minutes later, Captain Deng of Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade received the latest news. The undercover agent who escaped to the town closest to the Golden Triangle had been picked up and was heading toward the core of the Golden Triangle.","Captain Deng, who received the call, narrowed his eyes and said in a low voice, \"Keep an eye on her during this period of time. If there’s any news, report it immediately!\"","The net of the narcotics police had been set up. Whether they could catch the big fish or destroy the new drug chain was all in this net.","Captain Deng, who had stayed up the entire night, hung up the phone and walked out of the office. Just as he walked out of the gloomy sky, a golden light suddenly broke out of the layers of dark clouds. It was like a golden arrow shooting straight into the ground. Dark clouds covered the entire ground. Only this golden light passed through thousands of mountains and rivers, illuminating the office building in front of him.","There were countless heroes guarding that place. The female soldier who left last night had stood in front of the Wall of Heroes and saluted again.","Today, the golden light shot over like an arrow. Its majestic aura seemed to want to carve a path through the abyss.","Captain Deng stood outside and looked up at the golden light until it disappeared.","This was a very good sign. It was a sign that his mood would gradually improve.","What followed was a tough battle. He and his comrades were already prepared and waiting for the tough battle to start."]},{"number":4682,"title":"Chapter 4682: Entering the Trap","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who had already entered another country, started to make a fuss in the car. She shouted that she wanted to get out of the car and go home. After she was slapped several times and threatened by the people in the car, she didn’t dare to make a fuss anymore. She didn’t even dare to cry.","That was because the other party really revealed a scimitar that was about 20 centimeters long and four centimeters wide.","The sharp curved knife flashed past Ye Jian’s eyes. A cold light flashed past her eyes. The blade reflected a cold light. Ye Jian couldn’t help but close her eyes. She was so afraid that she didn’t even dare to cry.","On the first day that Ye Jian ’escaped’ into the town, she was targeted. On the second day, she was investigated clearly where she came from and how she entered the country from China. On the third day, she was secretly watched. On the fourth day, she was watched again. On the fifth and sixth days, they started making arrangements. On the seventh day, she was successfully deceived by them and got into their car.","The car drove on and turned many corners. They passed through mountains, and Ye Jian listened to the mountain wind blowing past their ears. She saw the mountains moving past her one after another. Ye Jian, who was deep in the tiger’s den alone, was getting farther and farther away from the Chinese border.","In order to prevent Ye Jian from escaping, the two of them only gave Ye Jian very little water for two consecutive days. Other than that, there was no food. Hunger resistance was a hurdle that a special forces soldier had to go through. Ye Jian’s record for hunger resistance and water deprivation was six days. Xia Jinyuan’s record was seven days, and the Xueyu unit’s record was nine days.","Two days of drinking only a small amount of water was enough for Ye Jian. On the fourth day after Ye Jian was kidnapped, she arrived at a small mountain village.","\"Get off!\"","The car door was pushed open. A skinny man, who had been guarding Ye Jian, reached out and grabbed Ye Jian’s wrist. He pulled her out of the car forcefully.","After leaving China for 11 days, Ye Jian arrived at a small village in Myanmar that was isolated. The mountain range covered the entire village. It was like a paradise, but it was dangerous.","Before she came, Ye Jian had an understanding of the terrain of the entire Golden Triangle and how many days it would take to enter the core area of the Golden Triangle. Based on their current itinerary and the speed of the car, it would take at least two days to reach the core area.","Moreover, they had yet to enter a blind spot in traffic and could still drive cars. This meant that she had yet to approach the dark areas where the various forces were divided and their deeds could corrode a civilized society.","Although she hadn’t entered the core area that was filled with darkness, the smell of drugs floated in the air. Ye Jian knew that she was already close to the outermost edge of the core. This place even seemed peaceful.","似饼干的香味自然不是真正的饼干所散发了来,而是麻果的气味.","She was still outside the small village. Before she entered completely, she could already smell the drugs. If she entered the village... the entire village would probably be enveloped by the smell of it.","Magu was a processed product of meth. Its main ingredients were methamphetamine, caffeine, and so on. It was mostly in the form of a tablet. This drug directly affected the human central nervous system. It had a hallucinatory effect and was very addictive. It was extremely harmful.","Ye Jian was able to identify all kinds of drugs accurately based on their smell. That night, when Ye Jian arrived at the Narcotics Brigade , she had to pass the assessment in the early morning. That morning, she saw a total of 108 types of drugs and smelled 108 types of drugs. After smelling them, she buried her head in the cold water basin that they had prepared beforehand. Only then did the smell dissipate.","That night was the most exhausting night in her entire life. It was also the night when she memorized the most information in the shortest time. It was also the night when she was exposed the most drugs. She remembered feeling shocked."]},{"number":4683,"title":"Chapter 4683: Cutting Grass","paragraphs":["It was not until she stood here that Ye Jian truly understood Captain Deng’s good intentions and why they were so strict when choosing the most suitable undercover agent.","She was only standing at the periphery of the mountain village that was only tainted by a little darkness. She knew that this was just the tip of the iceberg.","When they walked into the small village, they saw children running happily. When the children saw people coming over, their first reaction was not to avoid them. Instead, they made a ’pistol’ gesture with their hands and imitated a gun battle with the three people who entered the village.","These were all children’s games. The adults were used to it.","A 25-year-old man walked over barefooted. He was half-naked and only had a horizontal apron around his waist.","When he passed by the children, he raised his hand and pushed the head of one of them. He said in the local language, \"Useless brats, do you dare to use a real gun?\"","\"Give us real guns, give us real guns!\"","The few children circled around the young man. One of them hugged his leg and begged him to give them real guns. The young man smiled and kicked the children who were arguing with him down. The children didn’t cry from the kick. They got up and grabbed two handfuls of soil to throw at the young man. All of them laughed before leaving.","This was the periphery of the Golden Triangle. Cars could enter the mountain village quite smoothly. This mountain village was also the first village they had to go through to enter the core area of the Golden Triangle.","Ye Jian lowered her head as she got down from the car. From the corner of her eyes, she could see everything around her.","The young man walked in front of the three people who had just entered the village. He sized up Ye Jian before saying to the two people who kidnapped Ye Jian, \"New goods? What’s her background?\"","\"She came out to work in the mountains and forests of China. She was kidnapped and sold to the kidnappers in Yun Province. In the end, the Burmese police suddenly came and the kidnappers hurriedly escaped with a few goods but met with the Burmese police halfway. They lost a few goods, and one of them ran to our town.\"","The kidnappers were in charge of the largest group of women traffickers at the border of the three countries. The leader was the middle-aged woman who came to fetch Ye Jian that day. She was known as the kidnapper by the people in Myanmar.","\"Are you sure there’s no problem?\" the young man asked again.","In exchange, one of the Burmese men, who knew how to talk in Mandarin and was the one who coaxed Ye Jian into the car, said, \"We watched her for six days and investigated her for four days. She’s clean. No one will go looking for her.\"","They were already deep in the mountains and forests. There were few people around. Even if someone passed by occasionally and saw white bones in the forest, they wouldn’t be surprised. They wouldn’t call the police and cause trouble for themselves.","That was why the man who could speak Mandarin was so certain.","The other man, who didn’t speak Mandarin and communicated in the local language of Myanmar, pointed at the wooden house not far ahead and said a few words coldly. The young man who received the two of them turned his body to make way for them, indicating that they should lock Ye Jian up first.","They had been on the road for four days. They had already finished everything they could eat. The two of them needed to prepare food that could fill their stomachs for the next three days. Then, they would fill the car with fuel and reserve two barrels of fuel for the road before driving away.","Ye Jian, who had the scimitar pressed against her back, was pushed twice again. The man who could speak Mandarin had an appearance that was no different from a Chinese but was a Burmese. He threatened her, \"Don’t jump around. Be careful of the scimitar in my hand. It’ll cut off your head easily. If that happens, the children will kick it around like a football.","\"Do you see that? The football they’re playing with now, it’s a human skull.\""]},{"number":4684,"title":"Chapter 4684: Evil","paragraphs":["Ye Jian looked in the direction he was pointing at and saw a grayish-white object being kicked around under the feet of the children who were playing games just now...","It was... a human skull.","The children, who were holding a human skull and kicking it like a football without batting an eyelid, were not afraid at all. The environment had created their temperament, and the environment had nurtured their brutal side since they were young.","When they grew up, they would be a new batch of drug makers, drug dealers, and even perpetrators who would bring darkness to the end. This cycle would continue generation after generation.","The wind in the mountain blew and sent chills down her spine. Ye Jian’s eyes trembled slightly as she ’panicked’ and retracted her gaze. She lowered her head tightly and pretended not to dare to look. She was so afraid that her entire body was trembling.","The young man who came received them laughed. After laughing, he said, \"She’s not bad. Even if she’s useless, she can be sold for a good price overseas.","\"Some Westerners like Asians with black hair, black eyes, and fair skin the most. They like Chinese girls the most.","He sized up Ye Jian brazenly. He even suddenly reached out his hand and lifted Ye Jian’s chin forcefully. An obvious look of surprise flashed past his eyes. He swallowed his saliva.","Just now, she had her head lowered, so he couldn’t see her clearly. Now that he saw her clearly, he realized that she was actually so beautiful that he wanted to ’test’ the goods first.","On the first day before entering the core area, Ye Jian met one of the greatest dangers that Captain Deng mentioned.","The young man was already lustful. His hand moved toward Ye Jian’s face. \"You’re willing to let go of such a beautiful girl? I don’t think she’ll be able to come back out. How can you bear to let her go?\"","Ye Jian’s heart turned cold. She didn’t dare to show any coldness in her eyes. She could only turn her head forcefully to avoid the other party’s fingers that smelled like drugs.","The young man didn’t give up. Instead, he became more interested. He clicked his tongue and laughed lewdly.","He was speaking in the Burmese dialect. This was Ye Jian’s shortcoming. It was also something that Captain Deng found regretful. He asked Ye Jian to learn the Burmese dialect as much as possible while she was undercover.","With such a strong retention, it shouldn’t be a problem for her to learn the Burmese dialect within two to three months. The fastest narcotics officer to learn the Burmese dialect only took six months.","Ye Jian remembered Captain Deng’s suggestion. If possible, she hoped that she could learn the Burmese dialect within two to three months.","The feeling of the man’s hand on her face made Ye Jian feel nauseous. She could only endure it. She could only endure it when she saw the other party’s wretched smile.","The driver, who didn’t speak much, raised his hand and swatted away the dirty hand of the young man. After saying a few words emotionlessly, Ye Jian saw the young man’s expression suddenly change. A hint of fear flashed past his eyes.","He retracted his hand resentfully and replied in a low voice. He pointed at a dilapidated wooden house in front of him and asked them to bring her there and lock her up. Right on the heels of that, he picked up the bamboo whistle that was hung around his neck with a red string and blew it.","Soon, the rustling of branches came from the dense forest. Two men in traditional Burmese attire walked over with rifles on their backs.","They were in charge of imprisoning Ye Jian. After taking two steps, the young man said something else. Ye Jian turned around and saw the malicious smile in his eyes.","When he saw Ye Jian looking over, he licked his purple lips. His lust hadn’t disappeared. There was a hint of gloominess in his expression."]},{"number":4685,"title":"Chapter 4685: Kill","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t pay much attention to the gloominess in his expression. She knew that he was afraid of the driver. Captain Deng had told her that with the way the Burmese acted, they usually wouldn’t take the initiative to provoke people who were stronger than them.","What made her heart sink was... his malicious smile.","Right on the heels of that, the young man pointed at the wooden house and stared at Ye Jian. His malicious smile got bigger.","What... was in the wooden house?","Ye Jian ’hurriedly’ retracted her gaze. She hugged the cloth bag that had been searched countless times. She trembled as she walked to the dilapidated wooden house.","Clang!","Suddenly, something flew over from the left. It hit the wooden door first before bouncing back and hitting Ye Jian’s feet. When she looked down, a skull was facing Ye Jian. That was enough to give most people nightmares.","\"Ahhhhh!!!\"","Ye Jian’s screams reverberated throughout the forest. As she screamed, she jumped up and ran out. The two men who were escorting her grabbed her collar and her arms tightly. She was pulled back before she could even take three steps.","The children laughed loudly. Their voices were clear, but Ye Jian shivered for no reason.","Why was sin not eradicated in this place?","Because... they had successors!","While the children were laughing, Ye Jian was pushed into the wooden house. Then, the door was closed tightly with a creak. A layer of dust fell from the wooden door.","Dust floated in the air and floated into Ye Jian’s nose. A damp moldy smell entered her nose.","At first, she thought that seeing a human skull was the most shocking thing that would happen today. When she smelled the lingering stench in the air, Ye Jian knew that the real challenge had yet to come.","The rest of the skeleton was in here. The only thing missing was its head.","The young man was smiling so eerily at her just now probably because of this skeleton.","The people outside heard even more horrified screams coming from inside. The old wooden door, which had turned dark gray from the sun and rain, was slammed on. It was as if the seemingly fragile wooden door would shatter if she used a little more strength.","\"Stop making a ruckus! Shut up!\"","The man guarding outside used his homemade gun to knock on the door a few times. He used the local language to warn Ye Jian not to make a fuss anymore.","\"Tongta, what’s inside?\" The Burmese man who could speak Mandarin frowned. \"This is the time when we need your help, so I hope that our villages can get along.","\"Mozhi, if I didn’t want peace between our two villages, I would’ve dragged your new goods into the forest and tested them myself.\"","Tongta was the man who had bad intentions for Ye Jian. He was the leader chosen by the village, similar to a village leader.","The man who coaxed Ye Jian into the car and could speak fluent Mandarin was called Mozhi and Zhu Sheng in Chinese.","Mozhi didn’t want to have a conflict with Tongta. Although their villages weren’t close, they had been helping each other sell the drug materials. Hence, the villagers of the two villages had always had a good relationship.","As for why Tongta was afraid of the driver, it was because the driver was someone who had walked out of the core area of the Golden Triangle.","He had no other identity. He was just a driver transporting drugs.","A driver was enough to scare the leader of a village. It was obvious how dangerous the core area was."]},{"number":4686,"title":"Chapter 4686: White Bones","paragraphs":["The three of them left together. The screams from inside the wooden door didn’t stop. Mozhi walked far away and could still hear Ye Jian knocking on the door and screaming, \"I want to go out! I want to go out!\"","Hahaha...","Get out?","Get out to where?","Go back to China?","Was that possible?","She shouldn’t even think about it.","In the wooden house, Ye Jian slammed the door until her palms hurt. The locked wooden door was never opened. The two men guarding outside let Ye Jian scream and cry.","The children who were playing ran over and picked up the skull that was kicked over on purpose just now. When they heard the cries coming from inside the wooden house, an older child hugged the skull and pretended to be an adult. He placed one hand on his waist and shouted, \"If you shout again, I’ll use the ax that we use to split wood to cut off your head!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the children around him imitated him. Killing people didn’t seem to be a big deal to them. It was a very casual small matter.","The two men from Myanmar shouted in a low voice. The children made a few faces at the two of them. The older child threw the skull in his hands to the ground. The children rushed up. One moment, they held it in their hands, and the next moment, they kicked it. The white skull was just a toy to them.","Ye Jian’s eyes turned cold as she listened to their laughter.","\"Little Ye, don’t underestimate the children on their side. Children will also use killing weapons to hurt you. Their environment teaches them that killing isn’t a big deal. They can kill anyone who violates their interests.","\"Because of the environment, treat the adults and the children in the same way.\"","Treat the adults and the children in the same way. At this moment, Ye Jian understood Captain Deng’s advice.","There was only one best solution—eliminate the roots!","After screaming for about ten minutes, Ye Jian seemed to be tired. Her cries slowly stopped, giving the guards outside the wooden house the illusion that she was finally tired.","Ye Jian, who sounded like she was crying and making a fuss, still had clear eyes. There were no tears in them at all. The only thing that made her uncomfortable was her throat.","Rubbing her dry and tense throat, Ye Jian turned around and walked slowly toward the skeleton with light footsteps.","The headless skeleton reminded her of the skull kicked around by the children outside. Then, she looked at the skeleton that was so rotten that the original color of its clothes couldn’t be seen. However, she could tell at a glance that it was a knee-length dress. There was a faint haze in Ye Jian’s eyes.","The dead girl was around 150cm in height. If you looked at the color of her dress carefully, you could see small pink flowers. The fabric should be plain, somewhere between white and grayish green.","Only one of her feet had shoes. It was not a high heel. It was a pair of canvas sneakers with white edges. Ye Jian thought that the deceased was a very young girl.","A very young girl...","Ye Jian, who came with a mission, thought of the more than ten young girls who had gone missing. The average age was 19 years old, with the youngest being 16 years old and the oldest 21 years old. They came from poor mountain villages and left their homes to reduce the burden on their families.","The narcotics police and the criminal police in charge of investigating the cases couldn’t provide all the information about the missing girls. They visited the missing girls’ houses and their neighbors and drew a portrait of the missing girls based on their parents’ appearance.","They were all from families that were poor. They didn’t have photos of the girls.","Fortunately, the criminal police were good at drawing portraits. The portraits drawn were not 100% similar, but they were at least 85% similar."]},{"number":4687,"title":"Chapter 4687: Distinguish Bones","paragraphs":["Ye Jian remembered all the portraits of the missing girls. She also remembered what color and style of clothes they wore before they left.","Now, she was quickly searching through her brain, trying to find a match for the color and style of the dress. In less than a minute, a girl’s portrait entered her mind clearly as if she had copied it.","Ye Jian closed her eyes gently. The missing girl had a similar knee-length dress.","Could it be that this skeleton was her?","She needed to confirm it again. She couldn’t confirm it just because of a similar dress. She needed to confirm it again!","Ye Jian’s heart trembled slightly as she walked closer slowly. She walked toward the skeleton’s leg directly. The girl’s left foot only had four toes because she was injured when she was young. This was the biggest hint to identify the skeleton.","Ye Jian, who was approaching, slowly squatted down and gently moved the withered grass away from the leg. She saw a pile of scattered white bones. Some were small and some were big. The bones were all messy. It was impossible to recognize them. She needed to carefully identify them.","In order to find evidence to prove the skeleton’s identity, Ye Jian needed to observe at a close distance. However, she needed to avoid the people outside from finding out that she had been investigating something. Besides moving away the withered grass, Ye Jian didn’t even touch the scattered bones.","Time passed slowly. Ye Jian, who had a good understanding of the human body’s structure and bones, started to assemble the scattered bones in her mind.","Starting from the heel, she assembled the bones piece by piece in her mind.","Finally, a complete left foot appeared in her mind.","At that moment, there were thick dark clouds in Ye Jian’s clear black eyes. Even the wind couldn’t blow them away.","One of the missing girls had been found. She was already a skeleton.","After wiping away any traces that she might’ve left behind, Ye Jian slowly retreated and walked back to the wooden door. From time to time, she would raise her hand and knock. She shouted weakly, \"Let me out. I want to go home.\"","The two people guarding outside ignored her. They didn’t shout at Ye Jian to shut up either. They stood guard like wooden stakes.","After half an hour or so, Ye Jian leaned against the wooden door and closed her eyes. She had been running around for the past few days.","Where would she go next?","Everything was unknown. She only knew that she would face more danger and difficulties.","Ye Jian, who had been sleeping soundly for two hours, heard footsteps outside. She opened her eyes and started knocking on the wooden door. She kept repeating, \"I want to go home.\"","The iron lock was opened, and the sound of the iron chain moving could be heard. Ye Jian got up and knocked on the wooden door harder. She was panicking and anxious.","Mozhi kicked the wooden door open with one leg. The wooden door that slammed open hit Ye Jian’s head heavily. As she screamed in pain, Mozhi used his leg to block the wooden door that was slamming back. He turned the scimitar in his hand. Standing at the door, he looked at the Chinese girl whose head was red from the collision and said lazily with a fake smile, \"Let’s go. I’ll send you home.\"","Who would believe him?","Ye Jian naturally wouldn’t believe him. She knew that he was lying to her.","She didn’t say anything. She hugged her bag tightly, and her eyes were filled with tears. The fear on her face pleased Mozhi. \"If you know that I won’t let you go home, why are you still shouting? Eat the pancake.\""]},{"number":4688,"title":"Chapter 4688: Visit","paragraphs":["He threw the pancakes wrapped in leaves at Ye Jian’s feet. The leaves fell. Now, one side of the golden pancakes was stained with dust.","Ye Jian was hungry. She cried and picked up the pancake. She ate it as she got into the car that brought her to the mountain.","The driver was still the same. However, the cap on his head had been changed into a denim cap. The front of the cap was rolled up so that his vision would not be affected. When she got into the car, Ye Jian glanced at the drive from the corner of her eyes and saw that the driver’s scalp was green.","It was revealed after he shaved his head. Before he changed his cap, she clearly saw his greasy black hair that hadn’t been washed for a few days.","As she lowered her eyes, Ye Jian concealed the suspicion that flashed past her eyes.","The car, which had been parked for about two hours, started moving and continued driving into the depths of the mountain. In the evening, the sky in the deep mountains turned dark. The continuous mountains became sleeping giant beasts that merged into the cold night sky. In the end, the mountains and the sky merged into one. It was like a ferocious beast’s mouth waiting for its prey to fall into its trap.","The car seemed to have reached the end of the mountain road. The car didn’t stop and continued moving forward. The rumbling sound of the motor startled the birds that were resting at night. They flapped their wings and rushed into the black sky. Ye Jian’s pupils constricted as the birds flew away.","It wasn’t that there was no path. It was a mountain path that was completely hidden in the mountain and could avoid satellite cameras!","There were more than 3,000 villages and towns in the Golden Triangle. Due to the special geography of the mountain range, there were many deep valleys and rapid tributaries. There were also bottomless canyons and endless cliffs. With such a special terrain, the possibility of outsiders entering was zero.","Not only did the blind spots prevent the villagers in the mountain range from interacting with the outside world, but it also made the country have limited management. They could not control the various villages.","The complicated terrain provided a natural shelter for countless drug dealers. It was impossible for outsiders to enter, but the people inside could lead them outside.","At this moment, the car drove onto a small mountain road that was hidden and carved out by humans. Only one car could pass through it. On the side was a cliff.","The mountain road was bumpy as they passed through the cliff and drove past the river. They drove for six days on the road. The journey was so bumpy that it seemed like the car was about to fall apart. Finally, they arrived at a mountain stronghold guarded by heavy guns.","The mountain stronghold was located at a higher altitude. The mountain stronghold that was surrounded by white fog looked more like a cultivation place that was isolated from the world. It didn’t look like a mountain stronghold with a large number of drug dealers.","Here, they entered the core area of the Golden Triangle.","The core area didn’t refer to a specific place. It referred to a place where a large amount of drug goods were sold.","The driver got out of the car first. He went to the pagoda in front of the village and placed his hands together before bowing piously.","Mozhi grabbed Ye Jian’s collar and got out of the car. He walked in front of the pagoda before letting go of Ye Jian’s collar. He placed his hands together and bowed piously.","The top of the pagoda in front of the village was made of pure gold. Because of its old age, it had lost the golden luster that gold should have.","The two of them didn’t enter the mountain village immediately. They greeted the guards with guns and waited outside quietly.","After waiting for half an hour, someone finally came out. What surprised Ye Jian was that the person who came out was a monk with a shaved head and green scalp. He was wearing an earthen yellow robe!"]},{"number":4689,"title":"Chapter 4689: Forgotten","paragraphs":["A monk?","Looking at the pagoda outside, could it be a temple?","The people of Myanmar believed in Buddhism. Buddhism was the national religion. Some Burmese people even worshiped monks to show their piety. Could it be that this mountain village was a temple?","Was it because a drug lord had come to the temple?","The monk’s appearance made Ye Jian lose her train of thought for a few seconds.","However, the monk that walked over didn’t act like a monk. Even his face was very fierce. Ye Jian, who had been silently observing, immediately realized that she might have met a fake monk. Would a real monk have a pistol on his waist?","How could a monk know how to hold a gun?","There was no information about fake monks in the information Captain Deng provided.","The monk in the yellow robe looked at Mozhi. He didn’t know him, but he didn’t ask about his identity. Instead, he glanced at the driver and frowned as he asked a few questions in the local language.","The driver lowered his head slightly. He wasn’t as cold as he was two days ago in the small village. He lowered his posture and replied. Ye Jian noticed that after the driver said a few words, he looked at Mozhi and said a few more words. Only then did the fake monk relax.","With the driver’s introduction, the fake monk started talking to Mozhi.","Toward the end, Mozhi pushed Ye Jian, who had her head lowered and didn’t dare to pull any tricks, in front of the monk. Mozhi started to suck up to the monk.","\"She’s a beautiful Chinese girl. There’s nothing wrong with her. Nothing will happen even if she dies...\"","He said many things, and the fake monk kept listening. However, from time to time, he would look at the driver from the corner of his eyes. It was only when the driver nodded slightly that a faint smile appeared on his fierce face.","Mozhi heaved a sigh of relief when he saw the fake monk smile. Ye Jian, who was pushed in front of the three of them, continued lowering her head. Her trembling shoulders allowed everyone to see that she was afraid—very, very afraid.","The fake monk and Mozhi had a short conversation. Due to the language barrier, Ye Jian couldn’t understand what they were saying. She was even more eager to learn the Burmese language.","After the two of them ended their conversation, Ye Jian, who was pushed away, saw the driver take off his denim cap that he hadn’t taken off for a few days. She saw that the driver had the same bald head as the fake monk, but the roots of his hair were green and black.","The driver... also used the identity of a monk as a cover outside?","Ye Jian’s gaze darkened as she entered the mountain stronghold that was guarded by sentries and guns. Just as she had guessed, the mountain stronghold was indeed a temple built deep in the mountains for the villagers to worship.","The temple wasn’t a real temple. The monks guarding the temple weren’t real monks either. Besides the fact that the pagoda was a real one, everything else was just a disguise for drug dealers.","Ye Jian was dragged out and locked up alone. Mozhi left with the fake monk and didn’t appear until dawn the next day.","Two days later, Ye Jian, who was locked up, seemed to have been forgotten. Other than to send over a bowl of water and a pancake, no one else appeared.","On the third day, someone sent water and biscuits. Then, they disappeared for two consecutive days. It could be seen that they didn’t want to give Ye Jian too much food and water to prevent her from having the strength to escape.","On the seventh day, a bowl of water and a pancake were sent to her on time. On the eighth day, she was hungry again. For eight consecutive days, Ye Jian’s range of activity was only in the small room where she was locked up. During the day, there was sunlight to accompany her. At night, there were night insects chirping. It was so quiet that she seemed to be the only one in the entire village.","At around 10:00 pm on the eighth day, Ye Jian, who had become much thinner due to hunger, heard the sound of countless motors. The quiet village instantly became lively. Torches lit up the pitch-black night. Even on her side, she could vaguely see the flames."]},{"number":4690,"title":"Chapter 4690: Mist","paragraphs":["With the flames, the village was no longer as quiet as before. However, Ye Jian didn’t hear anyone speaking. As the engine of the car turned off, the village returned to its usual peace. Even the fire had been extinguished. If not for the faint flames from the torches, Ye Jian would have thought that she was hallucinating from hunger.","Ye Jian took a deep breath. Even though she was hungry, her skills were not affected at all. She ran up and kicked the wall with her legs. Then, she jumped up. Her slender body was as agile as a bird flying through the leaves. She straightened her arms and grabbed the railing of the only window tightly.","Using a pull-up position, she exerted strength in her arms and finally saw the outside through the window.","She was being held in a utility room. The front of the utility room was extremely wide. The surrounding trees had all been cut down, creating an open-air square. The car that disturbed the peace in the mountain was parked in the square. There were people guarding the front and back of the car.","Someone got out of the car. Although the night was hazy, Ye Jian could still see who it was with the light from the torches.","The first man to come down was none other than Mozhi, the person who coaxed her into the car and spoke fluent Mandarin.","He was the first to get out of the passenger seat. He immediately opened the back door. A middle-aged man in a suit and leather shoes came down calmly while buttoning his suit jacket.","The fake monk in an earthen-yellow robe received the man. The two of them shook hands politely. The fake monk made a ’please’ gesture. The middle-aged man in a suit and leather shoes with the aura of a businessman naturally walked in front.","He was a successful man who was used to walking in front. He never stopped to wait for others.","The man in a suit and leather shoes and the fake monk walked at the front. They chatted as they walked. From Ye Jian’s position, she could vaguely see the two of them chatting happily under the light of the torches.","Mozhi, who was following closely behind the man in the suit, waved his hand behind him. A few men in black suits, who were guarding the car, immediately followed closely and fulfilled their duties as bodyguards.","Ye Jian’s gaze landed on one of the bodyguards. Among the photos of undercover agents provided by Captain Deng... this bodyguard was one of them.","On the 14th day of entering the Golden Triangle, she finally saw a narcotics police officer.","A young man in traditional Burmese clothes followed them closely. Ye Jian knew him too. He was the man she met when she entered the first mountain village. He was lustful toward her.","A group of dozens of people entered the mountain stronghold majestically. Then, the torches were extinguished again. In less than ten minutes, the entire mountain stronghold returned to calm.","Ye Jian jumped back to the ground and rubbed her hungry stomach with one hand. She had to bear with it. On the ninth day, there should be a small bowl of water and a pancake.","Captain Deng told her very clearly that her mission this time was not to keep an eye on the various drug dealers entering and leaving the core area of the Golden Triangle. Instead, she had to find out where the missing girls went and which villages in the Golden Triangle the new drug chain came from.","Although the Golden Triangle was a world-famous drug supply area, it wasn’t just one person who controlled the entire Golden Triangle. It was supplied by local ethnic militants, local warlords, local drug lords, and some villages.","Ye Jian, who sneaked in, couldn’t immediately figure out who had the motive of abducting young girls and where the young girls went. However, ever since she found out that the white skeleton belonged to one of the missing girls and that the village was controlled by a group of fake monks, she vaguely felt that the missing girls might have been under the control of several factions."]},{"number":4691,"title":"Chapter 4691: Abuse","paragraphs":["If that was the case, then the Chinese narcotics police were enemies with almost all the forces in the core area of the Golden Triangle. Once they noticed it, not only would the missing girls be in danger, but the border defense armed police officers and narcotics police would also be in great danger.","Ye Jian didn’t pay attention to the narcotics police anymore. Since Captain Deng told her not to interfere with other things, she had to remember not to make decisions on her own.","Ye Jian hadn’t been eating enough for 14 consecutive days. She hid in a corner and continued sleeping in a daze.","Ye Jian couldn’t sleep well. Besides waking up from hunger, she was also woken up by the commotion outside.","The car parked outside started moving again at around three in the morning. Ye Jian woke up again and heard footsteps rushing over. Unexpectedly, the sound of chains moving could be heard. Someone opened the door and instructed two men in black to go in. Without a word, they carried Ye Jian and walked out.","\"What are you doing?! What are you doing... Let me go, let me go. Please, let me go home. Please, I want to go home... I want to go home...\"","Ye Jian kept begging. Her hoarse and unpleasant voice was so weak as she had lost all her strength. It was so weak that the black-shirted men couldn’t hear what she said.","After being hungry for so long, she couldn’t take it anymore.","Ye Jian knew that she was skinny from hunger, but she didn’t know that she was no longer recognizable. Mozhi looked at her for a long time before he recognized her.","\"Why is she still here?\" Mozhi asked the fake monk in surprise. Ye Jian recognized the fake monk from the corner of her eyes.","When the driver drove her to the village, he was also wearing a yellow robe.","\"We were waiting for you,\" the driver replied concisely. Mozhi looked at the Chinese girl who was so skinny that he almost couldn’t recognize her. He laughed and said, \"In your hands, no matter how beautiful a girl is, she’ll become the ugliest person.\"","\"As long as she’s still alive.\"","The driver smiled coldly. The vicious look in his eyes made Mozhi shudder secretly.","He always thought that the driver was just an ordinary driver, but it wasn’t the case!","Instead, he was the figure who always gave the Shan State police a headache. He was a ruthless character who had taken countless lives of Chinese narcotics officers and border defense armed police officers.","With him guarding the mountain stronghold, no one would dare to cause trouble easily. If they wanted to cause trouble, they would have to consider if their heads would be blown up by him.","Ye Jian was dragged into the car again. Ye Jian was feeling weak. She cried weakly, saying she wanted to drink water. She wanted to eat. She was very, very hungry...","An apple and a few biscuits were what Ye Jian had been surviving on for the past few days.","Ye Jian, who had stayed in the mountain village for almost nine days, was pulled into the mountain again. The journey took two days. They went from the Shan State in the south of Myanmar to Kachin State. They were getting farther and farther away from Cheri City.","At this point, Ye Jian was no longer locked up alone. She was locked up with four girls.","Ye Jian’s pupils constricted when she saw the four girls with dull eyes. They were at the brink of collapse. But there were no signs of torture on these girls. Their lips were dry and their hands were on their abdomens as they sat down.","They... were the same as her. They were exhausted from hunger.","Unfortunately, the four girls were all Burmese girls. Ye Jian couldn’t communicate with them at all, but it gave Ye Jian a chance to learn the Burmese language."]},{"number":4692,"title":"Chapter 4692: Fight","paragraphs":["When the four girls saw Ye Jian coming in, their black eyes moved slightly. They saw Ye Jian, but there were no emotions on their faces. Even their expressions were numb.","They had been hungry for too long. They were so hungry that they didn’t even have the energy to look up at people. They even thought that it was better to die as soon as possible than to starve day by day.","The iron door creaked closed. Ye Jian, who was thrown in like a rag, waited until she couldn’t hear the footsteps outside before slowly getting up and moving to the four girls.","Her arrival made the girls, who were motionless like wooden stakes, move a little. They looked at Ye Jian and saw the bag in her arms.","Ye Jian was still thinking about how to communicate with her when suddenly, a skinny girl walked past the two girls in front of her and pounced on Ye Jian.","She pounced on Ye Jian and said something. She reached out and grabbed the bag in Ye Jian’s arms tightly.","Although she was very fast, Ye Jian immediately hugged the bag tightly when she realized her intention. She didn’t let the skinny girl snatch the bag away.","Besides clothes, there was nothing else in the bag. The temperature in the mountains was very low at night. She was hungry all the way here yet didn’t fall sick. It was because she relied on the few thick clothes in the bag to resist the cold.","Her clothes could not be snatched away.","\"Let go, let go, let go!\" The skinny little girl said in a low voice. She wanted to live. \"Let go! Do you hear me?","\"I want food, I want food! Let go\"","She glared at Ye Jian. Her eyes, which were as dull as stagnant water, changed again and again. It was no longer filled with despair. All her hopes were ignited. There seemed to be a ball of fire burning in her eyes. It let Ye Jian see her desire to live.","Ye Jian didn’t understand what she was saying at all. She only knew that she was snatching her bag. The more she wanted to snatch it, the more Ye Jian didn’t want to give it to her. She hugged it tightly and shouted in Chinese, \"What do you want? Let go! This is mine, this is mine!\"","In the end, both of them fell to the ground. Not only did they use their hands, but they also used their legs.","The skinny girl couldn’t beat Ye Jian. She had no choice but to call for reinforcements. In the Burmese dialect, she shouted at the three girls who were just looking at her. \"Why aren’t you moving? She must have food on her! Aren’t you hungry? Don’t you want to eat? Don’t you want to live?\"","A girl’s expression changed. The skinny girl’s words piqued her interest.","She was hungry too. She wanted to eat. She wanted to survive.","Another older girl pulled her back and shook her head gently. The two of them looked similar. They might be sisters. The remaining girl closed her eyes. She was trembling in fear.","Ye Jian only knew that the other party suddenly raised her voice and screamed. She used all her strength in this scream. At the highest point, her voice suddenly fell. Then, she didn’t have the strength to snatch the bag in Ye Jian’s arms anymore. She finally let go.","When she realized that she didn’t have the energy to snatch the bag anymore, her eyes widened and her facial features turned hideous. She pounced on Ye Jian crazily.","\"Food, food, I want food! I want to eat...\"","She kept repeating the same words.","She was so hungry that she would make do even if it was just a drop of water.","Ye Jian vaguely knew what she wanted to do.","Ye Jian, who was retreating step by step, looked a little flustered as she opened the bag. She took out a few clothes and shook them forcefully. She used her actions to tell the other party that she had no food in her bag."]},{"number":4693,"title":"Chapter 4693: Different","paragraphs":["The girl who wanted to snatch the bag stared at Ye Jian intently. Her eyes didn’t move at all.","When Ye Jian shook off the clothes, the flames in the girl’s eyes receded bit by bit. Her last hope disappeared...","\"Ah!\"","Her hope was destroyed again. The skinny girl let out an even more desperate scream. Then, she fell to the ground and cried.","When the oldest girl among the four saw this, she moved her body with difficulty. She didn’t even have the energy to stand up. She crawled to the crying girl and comforted her in Burmese.","Ye Jian met four Burmese girls in this environment. They were kidnapped like her and sent to the depths of the Golden Triangle. Then, they were starved.","Ye Jian knew that the four of them were detained on the same day. The two sisters were sent in in the morning. The skinny girl was sent in with the other timid-looking girl.","As for how many days they had been locked up, they shook their heads, indicating that they didn’t know how long they had been locked up.","It was as if time had stopped in the depths of the mountain. It was unknown how much time had passed in the mountain.","Xu Wen had been waiting for Ye Jian’s call. She sent Ye Jian countless messages and called her countless times, from the start of the new year until before school started, but Ye Jian never replied.","Seeing this, Song Zhiqiu hugged his girlfriend’s shoulder lightly and said in a low voice, \"You have to know that Ye Jian is different from us. She might have gone somewhere to settle something. She’ll naturally return to school after she’s done.\"","Different from them?","What was the difference?","Xu Wen slowly frowned. There was a probing look in her eyes. \"Do you know something?\"","\"I don’t know anything, but think about how different Ye Jian is from us. We can’t contact her now. I don’t think it’s that she doesn’t want to contact you but it’s inconvenient for her to do so.\"","\"So, no matter how many times you call or text her, she won’t be able to reply to you.\"","How was Ye Jian different from them?","Xu Wen fell into deep thought. Song Zhiqiu sighed silently in his heart and frowned. There was no news of Ye Jian for so long. Could it be that the mission she was carrying out was very difficult?","What mission was she on?","There were still two days before school started. Xu Wen no longer took out her phone every time she returned to her dormitory to see if she had received a reply. She vaguely understood why her boyfriend said that Ye Jian was different.","The new year passed, and the students returned to school one after another. The day before school started, all the students who needed to report back to school arrived. Ye Jian hadn’t returned.","Xu Wen had to hand over her phone again because school had started. There was still no news of Ye Jian. She waited with He Jing until the third day after school, when the two of them went to look for the instructor together.","The instructor didn’t know where Ye Jian went either. He only knew that Ye Jian had other plans and didn’t know when she would return to school.","\"Don’t worry. I thought you were all used to Ye Jian disappearing from time to time? She’s fine. She just has something on and can’t return to school on time.\"","He Jing frowned and asked, \"Is she in danger?\"","\"Danger?\" The instructor was stunned and laughed. \"What danger can there be in the military unit? Don’t worry, especially you, Xu Wen. You’re already in her fourth year. You can’t relax just because Ye Jian isn’t around.","\"The closer you get to the end, the more you have to persevere. When Ye Jian comes back, I’ll ask her to test you and see if you’ve fallen behind!\"","So she had gone to the military unit!","When Xu Wen heard this, she felt the weight in her heart lift. She smiled at the instructor and said, \"I won’t disturb you anymore. Have a good rest. Goodbye, instructor.\""]},{"number":4694,"title":"Chapter 4694: Disloyal","paragraphs":["After that, Xu Wen didn’t ask about Ye Jian’s whereabouts anymore. He Jing was the same.","However, after the two of them returned to the dormitory, they would look at the empty bed first. Every night, before they went to bed, they would spread out the green blanket. The next morning, they would fold it into a cube. Everything was done according to the rules.","Ye Jian, who was remembered by Xu Wen and He Jing, was still worried about her three meals a day. No one paid attention to them. Every two days, a bowl of clear water and a pancake would be sent over on time.","No matter how much the five of them begged, the person’s lips seemed to be glued together. No matter what the girls said, he wouldn’t answer.","He didn’t say a word, which made the girls feel more and more despair. Their negative emotions got stronger too.","The skinny girl who tried to snatch Ye Jian’s bag started to show signs of self-harm. In the middle of the night, she kept hitting her head against the wall. The other girls were still so hungry that they forced themselves to sleep and not pay attention to it. Ye Jian, who was always vigilant, opened her eyes and listened carefully to where the thumping sound came from before she noticed something amiss.","She knew who was hitting their head, but she didn’t act rashly. Instead, she chose to listen quietly.","She couldn’t act rashly. Before she found the missing girls and came into contact with the new drug transport chain, she couldn’t interfere with anything.","Even if a life was destroyed in front of her, she only had one choice—to watch calmly!","Today was the eighth day of Ye Jian’s imprisonment with the four girls. Tomorrow was when food would be delivered.","A bowl of clear water and a pancake were Ye Jian’s hope of not starving to death.","The sound of self-harm didn’t last long. Ye Jian slowly closed her eyes when she didn’t hear anything. A bad feeling flashed past her heart.","The next day, Ye Jian saw the bruise on the forehead of the skinny girl who tried to snatch her bag to see if there was any food. It was a shocking sight.","When the other three girls saw it, they crawled to the skinny girl and asked with concern.","The skinny girl didn’t say anything and just lowered her head. No one knew what she was thinking. The two sisters didn’t surround her anymore. They retreated to the corner of the wall, leaving only the other girl to accompany the skinny girl. After a few minutes, the skinny girl took the initiative to talk to the girl accompanying her.","Her voice was very soft. It was so weak that she had to pause a few times.","Ye Jian didn’t notice it, but the other party’s gaze kept looking at her. Ye Jian was puzzled and vigilant.","The two of them... seemed to be discussing something.","It was time for the water and pancakes to be delivered today. The iron door opened on time again. Every time the Burmese man sent them water and pancakes, he would appear on time and take out the water and pancakes from the bamboo basket.","There were five servings in total. After putting the food and water down, he would leave immediately.","Only after he left, would the five girls dare to crawl over and pick up their share. Ye Jian also took her share. Just as she was about to turn around, her back tensed up. She felt someone staring at her from behind, waiting for her to turn around.","Ye Jian, who was so skinny now that she didn’t have much flesh on her body, narrowed her eyes slightly. She didn’t turn around immediately. Instead, she chose to... eat the pancake with her back facing them.","The two girls, who were staring at Ye Jian, exchanged glances and stuffed their pancakes into their pockets. At the same time, they rushed over from both sides.","The two girls started snatching the food. Their first target was Ye Jian.","They already had a plan and were waiting to execute it.","The two sisters were not part of their plan. Firstly, the sisters would definitely team up. Secondly, they were both from Myanmar as well.","However, it was still possible for them to target the sisters next."]},{"number":4695,"title":"Chapter 4695: Internal Discord","paragraphs":["The younger one of the two sisters was frightened. She sat on the ground and kicked her legs. She didn’t forget to grab two palm-sized pancakes with her hands. As she stuffed them into her mouth, she kicked her legs and retreated.","She was afraid that the pancakes in her hand would be snatched away.","The elder sister immediately protected her younger sister as she retreated. She didn’t dare to join in, nor did she have any thoughts of snatching other people’s pancakes.","Ye Jian, who was on a mission, wouldn’t give anyone a chance to snatch her only source of food. She wouldn’t show any sympathy.","The two of them pounced over. Ye Jian avoided them agilely. When the two sisters saw this, they couldn’t help but lean back. At the same time, they held the pancakes in their hands tightly and looked at the two people who collided with each other in horror.","Ye Jian’s detour caused the girls to bump into each other. Their foreheads hit each other, and the sound of bones colliding could be heard.","This collision was a little ruthless. The two of them fell to the ground and saw stars in front of their eyes.","At the same time, the pancakes in one of the girls’ pockets were knocked out and fell beside the skinny girl’s legs. The girl who lost her pancakes didn’t notice it. The skinny girl’s eyes lit up. She picked up the pancakes and crawled to a corner without caring about anything else. She quickly scarfed down the pancakes.","The girl who didn’t have any pancakes realized that she didn’t have any. She didn’t expect the skinny girl to snatch her pancakes.","No one told her about it. The two sisters just kept hinting at her with their eyes. They looked at the skinny girl who had started to eat the second pancake. The girl who lost her pancakes was only focused on searching the square ground and didn’t see anything.","The two sisters chose to shut up because they didn’t want to cause trouble. As for Ye Jian, she watched coldly from the side. The other party wanted to snatch her things just now, and it was premeditated. Why should she sympathize with a criminal who had tried to commit murder?","No wonder the two of them were whispering to each other in the morning. She was right. As it turned out, they were really plotting something. They were plotting how to snatch her pancake.","The pancakes were very cold and hard, but Ye Jian still ate them without leaving any crumbs. Even though the girl without the pancakes fell to the ground weakly, Ye Jian didn’t show any sympathy.","In the end, the two sisters left half a pancake each for the girl who couldn’t find her pancakes. She was so hungry that her eyes rolled over, and it was as if she would die at any moment.","The skinny girl finally felt full. At the same time, Ye Jian saw her narrowing her eyes as if she was planning something.","Seeing this, a very vague feeling flashed past Ye Jian’s mind. It surged quickly but disappeared in an instant. She seemed to have grasped something, but it disappeared suddenly.","The skinny girl licked her lips and crawled toward Ye Jian. Ye Jian stared at her and slowly retreated.","The strange feeling that flashed past her mind appeared again. This time, Ye Jian seized it tightly. In an instant, her heart was in turmoil, and her expression changed.","What happened today... was probably the start of the worst!","Soon, it was confirmed that there would only be four servings of water and pancakes next time!","In other words, there would be one person who wouldn’t get anything.","The girl who lost her pancakes last time didn’t wait for the person she was afraid of to leave. She pounced on him immediately and tried to take two portions.","The skinny girl, who was domineering to begin with and also wanted to take two portions, was unwilling to fall behind. She first slammed into the first girl and said something in the Burmese language. With a fierce expression, she was the first to snatch two portions of pancakes."]},{"number":4696,"title":"Chapter 4696: Leave","paragraphs":["She took up two portions. The remaining two portions had to be split between four people. This time, even the two sisters came to a disagreement.","The entire scene instantly went out of control. The four Burmese girls fought over the food.","Ye Jian took advantage of the situation and was the first to get the pancake.","At night, the skinny girl who managed to snatch two shares of food was brought away and never came back even when it was early in the morning. Ye Jian stretched her numb legs. There was a hint of seriousness in her eyes.","She still needed to observe her.","She didn’t know if it was just like what she thought, that the most ruthless person could end their starvation in advance.","The next time, Ye Jian confirmed her thoughts. The second girl was taken away at night and never came back.","When she saw that there was only one serving of water and pancakes, Ye Jian started fighting. She had been here for 20 days. She had to fight because she needed to leave this place. She needed to hurry up and investigate.","This time, Ye Jian was taken away.","Spring had arrived quietly. The ginkgo and maple trees in the school seemed to have sprouted new green shoots overnight. They stretched their leaves against the warm spring breeze. The colors of the seasons had changed to the new green of spring. A row of dark green figures passed through them. Their footsteps were neat and powerful, and they walked forward with fearless determination.","The fourth-year students started their last year of training. The compulsory and elective courses became the focus of the fourth-year students. As for the physical training, it didn’t decrease. They continued training as usual.","The trainees of the command department heard the most complaints from their instructors. Every time the instructors saw that their physical performance was not ideal, they would say, \"Ye Jian is not here. I’m not even interested in training you guys!","\"Look at your results. Do you think it’s alright? If Ye Jian comes back, she’ll beat you up in minutes!","\"Have you not eaten? Have you not woken up? Ye Jian isn’t here, so you guys think there’s no need to make comparisons anymore? Do you think you’re so impressive?","\"Look at all of you. It’s just a little more focused training and you’re already saying that it’s hard. Did Ye Jian say that it’s hard? Such an outstanding person is still working hard. What about you? Do you think you’re as outstanding as Ye Jian?\"","Although Ye Jian wasn’t at school, her presence was stronger than when she was around. Every time they trained, the students would tense up and be especially nervous, afraid that the instructor would compare them to Ye Jian again.","Ye Jian was a legend, and they were mostly mediocre. How could they become a legend so easily? Since they couldn’t become a legend, they couldn’t be compared to the legendary Ye Jian.","Facing the instructors who would mention Ye Jian from time to time, Xu Wen sighed at He Jing in private. \"It’s a good thing I know that the instructors really like our Jian. Those who don’t know might think that they’re stacking the deck against her to incite our hatred.\"","There was no harm without comparison. Once comparison was made, the harm was huge!","Relying on her height, He Jing raised her hand and patted Xu Wen’s head. She smiled and said, \"Not bad. You just need to know that even if Jian isn’t around, you can’t be lazy.","\"The instructors are right. Our Jian is indeed very powerful.","\"Train obediently. Don’t think that you can be arrogant just because you’ve found a boyfriend. You’ll be a graduate student. You don’t have the right to waste time. Do you understand?\"","Xu Wen, who chose to take the postgraduate entrance examination, had plunged into the sea of studies. She finally felt that there wasn’t enough time. She finally understood why Ye Jian always said that there wasn’t enough time."]},{"number":4697,"title":"Chapter 4697: Servant","paragraphs":["Even though Ye Jian wasn’t by her side, Xu Wen didn’t relax because of this. Occasionally, she wanted to relax too. She wanted to slack off. But her boyfriend, Song Zhiqiu, would appear out of nowhere and supervise her.","Xu Wen was the typical type of person who could be persuaded but not coerced. As for Song Zhiqiu, he was a smart person. Although Song Zhiqiu always gave in when the two of them interacted, in actual fact, Xu Wen was the one who was being led by him. She was so willing to be led by him that she thought that she had subdued her boyfriend.","Every time He Jing saw her being kidnapped by Song Zhiqiu, she would secretly give Song Zhiqiu a thumbs-up.","Xu Wen was lazy. Although Ye Jian had corrected many small problems for her, Xu Wen didn’t have much discipline. Usually, Xu Wen would revert back to her old ways not long after. She needed someone to supervise and remind her.","Since Ye Jian wasn’t around, Song Zhiqiu took over everything. He didn’t get tired of it and liked it very much.","There were a few times when Xu Wen threw a tantrum, but Song Zhiqiu wasn’t angry. Instead, he smiled at He Jing and said, \"You’ve very cute. The more I look at you, the more I like you.\"","\"...\" The speechless He Jing almost vomited from his mushy words. She didn’t expect Song Zhiqiu’s understanding of ’cute’ to be so strange!","The way a man looked at a woman and the way a woman looked at a woman was bound to be different!","Xu Wen was very good at acting coquettishly. She knew when to stop. She was sometimes barbaric, sometimes delicate, and sometimes flirtatious. It had to be said that to a certain extent, she had Song Zhiqiu wrapped around her finger too.","He Jing said that one of them was willing to hit while the other was willing to be hit. They were a match made in heaven.","She admired Ye Jian’s interaction with her boyfriend. That was a normal relationship. They weren’t as mushy as Xu Wen and Song Zhiqiu.","The fourth year seemed to pass very quickly. New buds were sprouting from the leaves of trees. When they looked up again, they saw that the peach blossoms had already withered and small green fruits were hanging on the branches. In the blink of an eye, it was already the end of spring. The season was about to end.","Ye Jian, who was remembered by the students and instructors, entered the western part of the Langbang Province in Laos.","The Langbang Province was also within the scope of the Golden Triangle. The scope of the Golden Triangle included the Shan State and Kbang Province in the north of Myanmar, the Qingmai Province in the north of Thailand, the Luangta Province, the Shali Province, the Usse Province, and the Langbang Province in the west of Laos. There were more than 3,000 villages and towns of all sizes.","Two days ago, Ye Jian was still in the Kbang Province in northern Myanmar. Two days later, she came to the western part of the Langbang Province in Laos. She would complete her first drug deal here.","It was already May. Ye Jian had been in Myanmar for four months. After starving for an entire month, Ye Jian ’chose’ to be obedient and ’live’. She became a slave that could be abandoned by the drug lords at any time and could be pushed out to take bullets at any time.","That night, Ye Jian was brought out and sent to a beautiful woman with a high bun. She was wearing the traditional clothes of a Burmese woman. The woman didn’t say anything. She just stretched out her long and sharp fingernails and raised Ye Jian’s chin. Her fingernails were painted red. After she finished looking at Ye Jian carefully, her chin was left with a deep nail print.","Then, the woman waved her hand. The two men who carried Ye Jian over carried Ye Jian again and walked into the dark forest. There was no light at all.","At that moment, Ye Jian was ready to escape."]},{"number":4698,"title":"Chapter 4698: Justice","paragraphs":["In the end, her life wasn’t at stake. Instead, they asked her to stand in front of the vertical hole that was just wide enough for one person to enter. It emitted a stench that made people vomit. The beautiful snake-like woman gently touched the back of Ye Jian’s neck and smiled coldly. \"Do you want to live?\"","She spoke in Mandarin.","Of course, Ye Jian wanted to live. She nodded obediently and replied. There was a look of horror on her face that made the woman giggle. In the middle of the night, in the dark forest that was as dark as the entrance to hell, the woman’s laughter was clearly delicate, but there was a gloominess that made people afraid.","\"You have to be obedient. I like obedient children the most. As for naughty children...\" A second ago, she was still smiling as she spoke. The next second, she suddenly pressed the back of Ye Jian’s neck tightly and forced her to nod. She looked at the pitch-black hole that was enveloped by the stench.","She shone her flashlight at the nearby light source, illuminating the bottomless hole. Ye Jian felt nauseous. When she saw what was in the hole, her pupils constricted...","\"Blargh...\"","The bile in her stomach rushed out of her throat. Ye Jian vomited.","It wasn’t because she was afraid that she vomited. It was because... the bones below were piled up like a small mountain. Her vision and mind were severely damaged. All her reactions were focused on her stomach. She couldn’t control the reaction in her body at all and vomited.","The pitch-black cave was filled with bones. There were even... decaying limbs.","\"Little Ye, this world is darker than we thought. You have to remember that darkness isn’t frightening. What’s frightening is that the representatives of justice are ignoring the darkness and allowing it to grow. That’s what’s truly terrifying.\"","This world was darker and scarier than she had imagined. Even though she had bathed in blood on the battlefield, she still felt a chill down her spine when she saw everything in front of her.","How many people were buried below? How many people had died at their hands?","How evil could a human’s heart be?","Would there be an end to ’evil’?","Ye Jian, who was vomiting until her stomach hurt, was so stimulated that her eyes were filled with tears. Would there be an end to ’evil’? There might be no end.","The woman’s cold laughter kept echoing in her ears. For a few nights, Ye Jian would wake up from her nightmares. She seemed to be able to hear the woman’s laughter. It was cold and inhumane.","Why did the Chinese narcotics police swear to fight the drug dealers of the Golden Triangle to the death? Why did they continue to move forward and fight to clear the darkness even though they knew that there were many dangers ahead and that they might die here one day?","The piles of white bones were the best answer.","Because they knew they had to fight for justice!","At night, Ye Jian knew that this woman was the transfer teacher who trained all the girls. In the following days, she was taught by this vicious woman.","The days of training were quite torturous. In the end, only three of the girls who were locked up survived. Two of them disappeared silently.","The first to disappear was the girl who lost her pancakes. Later, the younger sister disappeared. They were still around that night, but Ye Jian never saw them again the next morning.","Her sister cried and asked about her. In exchange, she was beaten up. She was told that if she wanted to see her sister, she had to be obedient.","Where did the two people who disappeared go?","No one knew for sure.","The three people who stayed behind were the skinny girl, the elder sister, and finally, Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who came out alive, had the chance to come to Laos today."]},{"number":4699,"title":"Chapter 4699: Little Cutie","paragraphs":["Before entering Laos, Ye Jian thought that the journey would take some time. Unexpectedly, it went surprisingly smoothly. Even though she was hiding drugs, she could still enter Laos smoothly. When she entered the territory and met the local police, Ye Jian, who came out for the first time, even broke out in a cold sweat.","In the end, it was a false alarm and they didn’t check on her. The drug dealer in charge of communication stuffed a roll of dollar bills into one of the police officers’ hands. The police officer casually rummaged through the luggage before letting them in.","In China, no drug dealer would dare to be so presumptuous.","China was one of the countries with the strictest drug control and counter-narcotics in the world. Its harshness would often attract criticism from Western countries. No country was as strict as China in counter-narcotics. No matter how much the bribe was, the officials would be investigated for criminal responsibility once they were caught.","More than a hundred years ago, China was a country riddled with holes because of opium. In the end, the mountains and rivers broke down. Countless people died in wars and were destroyed by drugs. Using history as a testament, one could see the rise and fall of China. That was why China was so strict with drugs today.","Ye Jian felt a chill down her spine when she saw with her own eyes that people could buy and sell anything with money.","Ye Jian, who had successfully entered the territory of Laos, changed into the traditional clothes of Laos. She had not cut her hair since the winter vacation. Her black hair, which reached her neck, was combed into a bun and tied high. She changed into a colorful cylindrical dress and wore a shawl of the same color. She wore gold and silver bracelets on her hands and followed closely behind the evil woman who was walking under the alias ’Lina’.","As soon as they entered the territory of Laos, they immediately got into the special car that came to fetch them. It was a black Benz with luxurious interiors. One of the bodyguards immediately opened the car door while another stood at the side and looked around vigilantly. The vicious woman, Lina, got into the car first, followed by Ye Jian.","The car drove into the bordering county city and finally stopped at the entrance of the highest-class hotel with ethnic characteristics. A doorman immediately came over to open the car door and asked Lina to get off first. Then, Ye Jian got off.","As for the bodyguards getting out of the car, there was no need for the doorman to serve them.","The sun at the end of May was just right. It was so bright that the sky was blue. Ye Jian couldn’t help but squint when she got out of the car. She seemed to have forgotten that she needed to follow Lina closely.","Lina, who was walking in front and twisting her waist like a snake, realized that the person behind her wasn’t following her. She stood still and turned around elegantly. Although she was smiling, her eyes were cold as she waved at Ye Jian. \"Little cutie, hurry up and follow me.\"","Ye Jian, who had a flustered facial expression, hurriedly followed. She bent her back and lowered her head. She looked like she had never seen the world. Lina couldn’t help but frown. She raised her hand and slowly touched Ye Jian’s face. Her poisonous gaze was fixed on her. The jealousy in the depths of her eyes was revealed when she touched Ye Jian’s tender face.","The weather at the end of May was very hot. Lina’s hand was the same as herself, cold like a snake.","She laughed softly and said, \"You need to slow down your footsteps and relax your expression. I need a beautiful and obedient girl. I don’t need a girl who’s as stiff as a rock and doesn’t interest anyone at all.\"","It was good to be young. Her face was so tender. Touching it felt like playing the piano between her fingers. Every light touch was so mesmerizing and captivating.","What a good face, what beauty. Not to mention whether men would like her or not, even a woman like Lina would take an interest in Ye Jian. She liked Ye Jian so much that... she really couldn’t help but want to destroy her.","She had to bear with it, though."]},{"number":4700,"title":"Chapter 4700: Frightening","paragraphs":["It wasn’t easy for her to train the new goods. It would be a waste to destroy Ye Jian so quickly, especially considering her beautiful face. Tsk, tsk, tsk. How good would it be if it was hers?","Unfortunately, it wasn’t hers. Hence, it was better to destroy it.","\"Be good, little cutie. When you take out the good stuff later, remember to introduce it seriously. If the customer is satisfied, there’ll be a reward. If not...\"","Her sharp nails scratched Ye Jian’s chin. A sharp pain suddenly came. Ye Jian felt a burning pain on her chin.","\"Be good, understand?\"","Ye Jian was in so much pain that her eyes were filled with tears. She nodded frantically and replied in Burmese, \"I’ll definitely be obedient. I’ll definitely satisfy you, Lina.\"","\"Wrong!\"","A vicious look flashed past Lina’s eyes. \"You don’t need to satisfy me. You need to satisfy the customer, understand? I’ll only be satisfied if the customer is satisfied!\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. I understand. I understand. I’ll definitely satisfy the customer. Lina, don’t worry. I’ll be good.\"","Ye Jian’s eyes were filled with tears. Her eyes and face were overcome with deep fear. Her expression made Lina let go of her hand in satisfaction.","She didn’t forget to pat Ye Jian’s face lightly. \"That’s more like it. I like obedient little cuties.\"","When she turned around, she didn’t see how a cold look flashed past Ye Jian’s eyes even though she appeared afraid a second ago. Lina was the one who taught the girls who went missing in Myanmar and helped them adjust. Then, she brought them out to hide and traffic drugs. The girls had to hide drugs in their bodies and also use their looks to recommend drugs. If the customer had any needs, the girls had to satisfy them unconditionally. If she resisted at all, they would kill her!","The methods were so cruel that it made people’s hair stand on end!","A new and more inhumane drug chain was born. These people didn’t think that it was against human nature. They only recognized the benefits it brought back.","Ye Jian was one of the people who could bring benefits to Lina and the rest.","To prevent Ye Jian from escaping, two bodyguards followed behind her. The bodyguards didn’t have any drugs on them. Only Ye Jian did. She had a total of 50 grams of high-purity ice seeds. They were mainly supplied to countries like Europe, America, and others.","After entering the fourth floor, she pushed open the sliding door. Lina, who had a cold expression just now, smiled the moment she entered the door. She placed her hands together and waited inside. A buyer from a Western country greeted her.","Lina spoke fluent English and had a native American accent. It was pleasant and smooth to the ears. At this moment, she didn’t look like a Burmese but more like an American.","The decorations in the room were Japanese-style. There was a raised platform in the room. The entire floor was covered with a plain carpet. There was a tatami, a tea room, a chess room, and a martial arts room. The most eye-catching thing was two crossed samurai swords.","Including Lina, there were six people in the spacious room. The two buyers from North America were introduced and soon started chatting with Lina.","Ye Jian didn’t go in immediately. She waited outside for Lina’s instructions before she dared to go in. After about three minutes, the closed sliding door opened again. Lina walked out and pulled Ye Jian’s hand.","One of the two bodyguards went in while one of them stayed outside to keep watch.","The high-purity ice seeds were taken out from Ye Jian’s calf. Lina personally bent down to take the goods and passed them to Ye Jian. Ye Jian then passed them to the North American customer sitting opposite her.","\"It’s the latest purity. There’s very little of it. I hope you’re satisfied,\" Ye Jian introduced it in Burmese.","The two buyers from North America didn’t take the goods immediately. Instead, they smiled and asked the introducer, \"Is this the special deal you mentioned?\""]}]);
